<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">KEJ- Alkitab Bahasa Biak</book>
  <para style="h">Sarmur Randak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sarmur</para>
  <para style="toc3">SaR.</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sarmur Randak</para>
  <para style="mt1">SARMUR RANDAK</para>
  <para style="is">WOS VEKFIN</para>
  <para style="im">Sas <char style="bk">Sarmur randak </char> fyawar vadir vavesarmur nanki ma supswan ine kasiper, up randak ro snonkakusya, sasar randak ma vavekanderaya isya ro sup swan ine, ma movsa Allah fyes vavekayam kuker snonkaku. Sas <char style="bk">Sarmur randak</char> sirwas i fa vye rarwas ri suru eve fandun kaku:</para>
  <para style="ip">1.<char style="it">Ram 1-11.</char> Fyawar user Allah Ifrur nanki ma supswan ine kasiper ma kako randak ro snonkakuya vye veyofer. Var rarwas ine kako fyawar user Adam ma Hawa, Kain ma Habel, Nuh ma favruv vebaya, ma kako Kaderen Babel.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. <char style="it">Ram 12-50.</char> Fyawar up randak er Israel. Up randakya isoine Abraham. Vye sno fafayava snar kakyar ma saso asuser vyena faro Allah I. Insape ewaipamya isoine sarisa vekur Abraham romawa vye Ishak i, Ishak romawa vye yakub i (Yakub snir kako i ve Israel.) Posa wer ido sarisa vekur Yakub romawa samfur seser di suru vyansi. Siso vekapar pampyam er samfur seser di suru ro er veba Israel ansi. Manfasfas ve fas sas ine fyawar vardi romawa oser monda ro Yakub romawa vyansi venirve Yusuf ma kako roi vebor venyanem si evedar Yakub i kuker romawa ma kina vyesyakam sfaryan bo sibur ve sup Mesir.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sas ine fyawar badir snonkaku vero awar madero iwara, imbape mnuk veser anun epen kakuya isoine sarisa vekur fararur veba Allah Vyena. Sas ine vye rak kuker fawar vefasnai vadir Allah ifrur kwar supswan ine, ma vye vesisen kuker asas isoine Allah nari myam epen pdef kawasa Vyesi. Vekif epen roi vebor vero sas ine kasiper isoine Allah eve mankara ma vave ninyan faro mundiri vefrur sasar sya. I monda vefarkin ma vesaramper kawasa Vyesi, ve sarmur sarisa vekur si. Sas vekwar kaku ine vye vefas infa iser fawar vekur kayaryar er veba oso ma kako insa vyar sonem kayaryar sena insa nakenem pdef.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fasfas ro sas ine</para>
  <para style="io1">Fararur nanki ma sup swan kuker snonkaku <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 1:1-2:25">1:1—2:25</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Sasar ma marindi randak kakuya <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-24">3:1-24</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Randak ro Adam isof Nuh <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 4:1-5:32">4:1—5:32</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nuh i ma favruv beba <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-10:32">6:1—10:32</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kaderen Babel <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 11:1-9">11:1-9</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Randak ro Sem isof Abraham<char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 11:10-32">11:10-32</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Snonvukor ro kina: Abraham, Ishak, Yakub <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-35:29">12:1—35:29</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Esau up vyesi <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 36:1-43">36:1-43</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yusuf ma naek vyesi <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 37:1-45:28">37:1—45:28</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kawasa Israel sya sro sup Mesir <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 46:1-50:26">46:1—50:26</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Allah Ifrur Nanki ma supswan ine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Ro randakya, fafisu Allah Syarmur nanki ma supswan ine,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ro randakya, fafisu Allah ... nanki ma supswan ine, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">orovaido </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Fafisu Allah Syarmur nanki ma supswan ine.</char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kafkofen Vair: </char><char style="it">Heaven – the dwelling place of God</char> = Nanki – mov Allah Vyeparensa. <char style="it">The water above the vault</char> = War vero bo farsyos sansoren. <char style="it">Vault of heaven</char> = Farsyos sansoren. <char style="it">Earth</char> = Supswan. <char style="it">The abyss of waters </char> = War vero bav supswanya. <char style="it">Pillars of the sky </char> = adir farsyos sansoren. <char style="it">Pillars of the earth</char> = adir supswan. <char style="it">Sheol</char> = mun aivui. </note> <figure style="fig" file="HK00338C.TIF" size="col" ref="1:1">Nanki ma supswan</figure> <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />supswan ine imawes vaim ma syampurnak kaker. Sorenya irvaren ma ikawef roi vebor kam ro pampan veba kakuya dori, imbape Rur Allah iswor farma ro warya bori.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ro wos Ibraniya kowos kaver i kako imbape Rur Allah orovaido ma wam ro Allah orovaido ma wam veba.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Allah Ikofen, “Ivyekada sananaiya isya!” Rarirya sananaiya isya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:6">2Kor. 4:6</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Allah Myam sananai anya ipyum, muraido Pyandwas sananaiya bur pampanya, <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />ma Allah Nyir sananaiya ve “Isnai” ma pampanya ido “Rov.” Rovya dande, vo arwo. Irya ras randakya.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6-7" />Ro ras eve suruya, Allah Ikofen, “Ivyekada farsyos sansoren isya fa iyarwarek ma pyandwas warya fa ivesisye ro mov ri suru.” Muraido roi evesya anya ryadirya. Rarirya Allah Ifrur farsyosya fa pyandwas war vero farsyos anya bori bur war vero bavdinya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:5">2Ptr. 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Farsyos sansoren anya Allah Nyir ive “Mandep.” Rovya dande vo arwo. Irya ras eve suru.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Posa Allah Ikofen, “Ivyekada war vero nankya bavdi naryur ro mov oser, isof sapropya iprese.” Muraido roi evesya anya ryadirya. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Allah Nyir vesyorya ve “Sup,” ma war veryur anna Dapna ve “Soren.” Allah Myam nakam napyum. <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Allah ikofen wer, “Ivyekada rokaker veborno nasur ro sapropya bori, isoine rokaker syos eve mor ma rokaker syos eve bon.” Mura ido roi evesya anna nradirya. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Rarirya sapropya isasyar rokaker vebor vesur veve mor ma ai vemarem eve bon raris syos vyena oser-oser. Allah Myam na Imarisen. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Rovya dande vo arwo. Irya ras eve kyor.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14-15" />Posa Allah Dawos wer, “Ivyekada roi vesnai ro farsyos sansoren naisya fa nasnai ser supswan, infa npandwas isnaiya bur rovya, ma ne avyair vekur fasna ras ma pasivarekna, ma fararwe fafisu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14-15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Fararwe fafisu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">orovaido fararwe pasivarekna.</char></note> Mura roi evesya anna nradirya. <verse eid="GEN 1:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Rarirya Allah Ifrur roi vesnai veba ri suru, susoine ori fa isnai ro meserya, ma paeki fa isnai ro rovya; vese wer ido Ifrur maksya. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Allah Vye orya, paeki ma maksya ro farsyos sansoren fa sisnaiser supswanya, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />insa sisnai ro meserya ma rovya, ma insa pyandwas sananaiya bur pampanya. Allah myam nakam napyum. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Rovya dande vo arwo. Irya ras eve fyak.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Posa Allah Dawos wer, “Ivyekada aiwan vekenem sibor kaku syos ve syos sisya fa sikenem ro warya do, ma mansya sibor sirov ro farsyos.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Posa Allah Ifrur aiwan soren veba kakusya, ma aiwan vebor syos ve syos vekenem ro warya dori, ma mansya syoso ve syoso. Allah Myam nakam napyum. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Allah Vyevok nakam ma Vyuk sasoser faro aiwan vekenem ro warya dori insa sikapar siryewen sfamok sorenya, ma faro mansya insa sibor siryewen.<figure style="fig" file="HK00072C.TIF" size="col" ref="1:22">Man verov ro farsyos</figure> <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Rovya dande vo arwo. Irya ras eve rim.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Posa Allah Dawos wer, “Ivyekada aiwan veborno sisya ro supswan ine bori, aiwan vefafir ma verafdi, aiwan veba ma kasun.” Inja nakam nradirya. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Rarirya Allah ifrur nakam ma Myamna vo Imarisen.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Posa Allah Dawos wer, “Ivyekada Kofrur snonkaku fa imnis farari kuker Ko. Insa ikifepen in vebor vero soren, man vero farsyos, ma aiwan vese syakam, vefafir ma verafdi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fasfas bepon kaku: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">aiwan vese syakam, vefafir ma verafdi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">wos Ibrani: aiwan vefafir sya ma supswan ine kasiper.</char></note> veba ma kasun.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:7">1Kor. 11:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Rarirya Allah Ifrur snonkaku, Ifrur fa imnis farari Mankundi. Ifrur snon ma vin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mat. 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:6">Mrk. 10:6</ref></char></note><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:1-2">SaR. 5:1-2</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Raimnai Allah Vyevok su ma Ikofen “Mukapar fa muryewen, insa up muvesi sfamok ro supswan ine fa sikenem ma siwaren warek i. Yavuk fa mufaduru ma muwaren warek in vero soren ma man vero farsyos, ma aiwan vesesya. <verse eid="GEN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Mumame, nanan Yavuk ve mu nasoine rokaker veve mor ma aibon. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Imboi faro mansya kam ma aiwan vekenem ro supswan inensya, Yavuk nanan ve si ro avris ma rokaker ram berumek.” Inja nakam nradirya. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Allah Myam roi vebor Ifrurkwar anna kam, ma imarisen kaku. Rovya dande vo arwo. Irya ras eve wonem.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Rarirya Allah ifrur nanki ma supswan ine ma roi vebor vero dori nakam fa namawes. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Ro ras eve fikya Allah fararur Vyena ne posakam kwar, inja Imnaisu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:4">Ibr. 4:4</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 10">10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Mura Vye vok ras eve fik anya ma Fyasreni. Ro ras anya Allah Imnaisu snar fararur Vyanna namaweskam kwar.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Kel. 20:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Irya fawar vekur supswan ine fafisu vye vesarmur.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="GEN 2:4">Yaf Eden ma Snonkaku randakya</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Fafisu <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ifrur supswan ine, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />rokaker mor ma rokaker vese nakpis ma nasur vaim snar <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> isabu mekemya vaim ma snonkaku sisya fa som sker sapropya vaim. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Imbape war na nakavavyai ro sapropya dori ma nfamasi supya bori.<verse eid="GEN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Fafisu anya <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> dun saprop kerna, insape doferna fa nve snonkaku,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">saprop ... snonkaku. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wos “snonkaku” ma “saprop” ro wos Ibraniya surok ra mov oser. </char></note> raimnai Iwuf svayoi vevuk kankenem ro snonisi; mura snonkaku anya ikenem.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:45">1Kor. 15:45</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Insape <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ifrur yafya ro Eden var wamuremya, ma Ryir snon Ifrurkwar anya fa ryo yaf ani. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" /><char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vyuk sur aiknam syoso ve syoso vepyum kaku, vemarem ma vevuk bon vepyum ma veyan kir kaku. Aiknam ri suru susur kako ro yaf anya faduri, susoine aiknam vevuk kankenem, ma aiknam vevuk fawawi vekur roi vepyum ma roi vevyeva.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">aiknam vevuk fawawi vekur roi vepyum ma roi vevyeva </char><char style="ft" closed="false">orovaido fawawi vekur roi vebor kam.</char></note><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:7">Why. 2:7</ref>, <ref loc="REV 22:2">22:2</ref>, <ref loc="REV 14">14</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Marei veba oso idaf ro Eden, fa ifamasi yaf anya; ma ro Eden vandiri marei veba anya pyandwas ra vye snau ri fyak. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Veponya snori Pison; war snaw anine idaf yar sup Hawila. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Mov anya iser brawen vekakur ma damar papoi vespum ma karui<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">karui wos ebeseya isoine keru, koru, koryui.</char></note> eve maija. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />War snau eve suruya snori Gihon; war anya idaf yar sup Kus.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kus: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Ro Padan-Aram); rovaido Sudan.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />War snau eve kyorya snori Tigris. War anya idaf ro sup Asyur var wamuremya. War snau eve fyakya snori Efrat.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Insape <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ryir snon anya fa ryo yaf Eden insa ifararur ma fyaduru yaf anya. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" /><char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ikofen faro snon ani, “Yavuk fa wan aibon ro aiknam vebor vero yaf ine, <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />imbape aiknam fawawi vekur roi vepyum ma roi vevyeva, wan awer bon vyedi, snar rofyor wan i, nari wamar veri ro ras anya kako.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Insape <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ikofen, “Ipyum ba veri fa snon ine ikenem ro mankundi. Ivye Yafrur snonkaku oso vemnis kuker i fa isaramper i.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Mura Manseren Allah dun saprop ker na fa dofer na farari aiwan vero saprop yabo ma vero farsyos. Insape Dun si faro snon ani insa myam bo vyuk snonsnon ve si. Irya randak kaku aiwan ansya sismai snonsnon. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Rarirya snon anya vyuk snonsnon faro aiwan vebor vero sapropya bo ma vero farsyos ansi. Imbape ro fandu aiwan ansi, oso imnis fa vye kari ma isaramper i va.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Mura <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ifrurfa snon anya denef moser kaku, rofyor denef kaker, <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> dun kor oser ro dar vyesi, insape dofer epen swaf anya kuker krafna. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Ro dar kor anya <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ifrur vin oso, raimnai Dun i faro snon ani. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Mura snon ani ikofen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">“Ine irya, min vemnis kuker aya --</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">Kor vyesya irya kor ayesi, ma kraf vyena irya kraf ayena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">Yaniri ve vine, snar vye veyun ro snon.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ro wos Ibraniya wos vekur </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Snon</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ido ISH, ma wos vekur vin ido ISHA.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Evedar snonya nari ibur kmari ma snari su ma vye oser kuker swari, isof suve kraf oser.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:5">Mat. 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:7-8">Mrk. 10:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:16">1Kor. 6:16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:31">Ef. 5:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Snon ma vin ansuya suvaver, imboi supok sumaiva.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Adam ma Hawa susapi ro sasar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Ikakya irya aiwan vefawi nanem syadi ro aiwan vebor <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ifrur kwar ansi. Ikak anya ifuken faro vin ani, “Kaku ke Allah dove muyan awer aibon ro aiknam vebor vero yaf ine nna?” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:9">Why. 12:9</ref>, <ref loc="REV 20:2">20:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Vin ani kyarem ve ikak anya, “Aibon ro aiknam vebor vero yaf ine nna nuyan nakame, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />imboi aiknam vero yaf ine faduri, Allah dove bon vyena nuyan awer rova nupan awer; snar nuveyuk ido, nari numar.”<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Ikak ani kyarem ve i, “Ryarisyava; nari mumarva. <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Allah ikofen radirya snar Ifawi rofyor muyan aibon ani, swaruser muvena nari nbase; ma nari mumnis raris Allah I<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Allah, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amfyanir </char></note> ma mufawi roi vepyum ma roi vevyeva.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mufawi roi vepyum ma roi vevyeva; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rovaido fawawi vekur roi veborkam.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Vin ani myam aiknam anya ipyum kaku, ma bon vyedi nari danpyum kaku. Kyara ro sneri, ipyum syadi insa dakfawi nanem. Inja dinek aibon ani, ma dan i, ma vyuk aibon anya kako ve swari fa dakan. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Suyan aibon anyara posa ido, swaruser suvena nbase vo sumam ma suvaver. Mura su kum ara ramna fa sufmar.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Fyor mandira murvav ido surower <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> imbran ro yaf anya dori, mura suyofek ro ai fuwar anna insa <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> myam awer su. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Imbape <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> dor snon anya ma Ikofen, “Mov risai ausya roya?”<verse eid="GEN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Snon ani kyarem, “Yarower Ausya wambran ro yaf ine dori; imboi yamkake, inja yayofek snar yavaver.”<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Allah ifuken i, “Mansei vekofen ve au vo veyove baverya? Imbude ausya wan aibon Yove wan awer anya ndi?”<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Snon ani kyarem, “Vin Buk fa eve kari aya nanya, vyuk aibon anya ve aya, mura ido yakan i.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />
    <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> ifuken faro vin ani, “Wafrur radirya kukro?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Vin ani kyarem, “Ikak anya i veyankar aya, isof yan aibon anyani.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:3">2Kor. 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:14">1Tim. 2:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Allah Vyuk fras faro ikakya, Hawa i ma Adam i.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Mura <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ikofen faro ikak ani, “Nari wasmai fras<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">fras orovaido fafras orovaido farasras imnis kako kuker dawar, iwar.</char></note> snar frur banine; ro aiwan vebor sya kam wemir monda nari vebar fras ine: Randak ro kur ine nari wasyaves kuker snevav bedi, ma wan oref saprop ro ras kenem bena kasiper. <verse eid="GEN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Au kuker vin anine nari muve mbrov yaye mu, up vyesya ma up besya nari sembrov si vesyakwar, up vyesya nari saref epen vrumri, ma nari au kako wasos wekuver sena.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:17">Why. 12:17</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Insape <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ikofen faro vin ani, “Nari Yafanfon dafduf faro au rofyor fadores ma fafisu waven romawa besi. Imbape rariryano, nari snembri vyenamu kaku<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">isararan isoine sneri ryo snonya, sneri imyof snonya.</char></note> faro swambri, mboi nari kwunem faro i.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Insape <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ikofen faro snon ani, “Snar wamnaf wos ro swambri mura wan aibon yave warek insa wan awer anya, ifnai vedar sapropya ismai fras. Nari wafararur ra bekandera kaku ro ras kenem bena kasiper insape sapropya vyuk nanan vemawes ve au.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:8">Ibr. 6:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Avris ma kavrai borek nari nasur ro sapropya faro au, ma rokaker vesur famfnom nari ne rovean ve au. <verse eid="GEN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Nari wafararur bekandera kaku rao domes bena nadai insape saprop ine vyuk royo ve au, isof kwaver wer ve saprop, snar be veyofer ro saprop. Yafrur au ro saprop, ma nari kwaver wer ve saprop.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Adam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wos Ibraniya isoine “er vebor, snonkaku sya kam”.</char></note> nyir swari ve Hawa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya inido “kankenem”. </char></note> snar vin anine irya up ro snonkaku sya kam vekenem ro supswan ine bori. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" /><char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ifrur sansun ro aiwan kifsya faro Adam i ma swari, insape Vye fa susansun.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Allah Iyau Adam ma Hawa fa subur yaf Eden</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />
    <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ikofen, “Fafis ine snon anya imnis kuker Ko kwar ma ismai fawawi vekur roi vepyumya ma roi vevyevaya. Inja vye vedwarek insa dan awer aibon ro aiknam vevuk kankenem vemnaiva anya insa ikenem fioro-fioro awer.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:14">Why. 22:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Mura <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> iyau su bur yaf Eden ma iwan su fa sufararur ro saprop mov suve knam muma roya. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Insape ro var wamurem ro yaf anya ro kedwai vesunya varpondi, <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ryir manakyasya,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kerub ido Manakya eve prer veve vadir Allah Isya ro mov ani kuker papoik Vyena.</char></note> ma rorabi vefadameser vesaravreves farma fa idwarek nyan veso yov aiknam vevuk kankenem ani. Rarirya osero vaveri fa nari syun mundum fa fyanam aiknam ani.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kain ma Habel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Rarirya Adam vye oser <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Adam vye oser kuker Hawa i orovaido denef kuker i, fyarvuk i.</char></note>kuker swar Hawa i. Vin ani fyadores ma daven romawa snonya, mura ikofen, “Kuker fanfnovek ro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I yasmai kwar romawa snon ine.” Inja nyir i ve Kain.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon Kain ro wos Ibrani isoine “yasmai kwar”.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Posa Hawa daven romawa snon iya wer, nyir i ve Habel. Habel inido manfarandous aiwan domba, imboi Kain inido manamom.<figure style="fig" file="HK00003C.TIF" size="col" ref="4:2">Manfarandous</figure> <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Fafisu ri veso nasyonde ido Kain dun ro yaf vyanna rovean na fa vyuki farsarser ve <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> I. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Habel ikako dun domba mkun rak oso ro domba vyansi, kyaruk i, insape fyarser kraf ma mafen vepyum kaku na faro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I. <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> imarisen faro Habel farsarser vyena,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:4">Ibr. 11:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />imboi Kyurpum Kain farsarser vyena. Inja Kain imsor kaku, ma myam karfiva. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Mura <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ifuken faro Kain i, “Rosai evedar wamsorya? Rosai evedar mam karfivaya? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Rofyor wafrur roi vepyum ido nari wakamambrif;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nari wakamambrif; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rovaido nari Yamarisen farsarser bena.</char></note> imboi rofyor wafrur roi vevyeva ido, sasarya isya isin au fa syun ro snembri. Sasarya ive daw ninyan au, imbape ivyekada swambrav fa pankarna.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Kain ikofen faro vedar vye Habel i, “Rwama kura ve yafe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fasfas epon kaku na: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rwama kura ve yafe. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Syap Ibrani wos nane naisya va</char></note> Surande ro yaf kwar ido, Kain iprer Habel i ma myun ra imar.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat. 23:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:51">Luk. 11:51</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:12">1Yoh. 3:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />
    <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> ifuken faro Kain i, “Vedar bani Habel i ryoiso?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">Kain kyarem ve I, “Yafawi i va. Ayaiso vewaren warekinya?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Mura <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> ikofen ve i, “Rosai wafrur kwar ine? Vedar bani rik vyena nkanes nor Aya ro sapropya bori, raris mkarem ve fararyor insa vye vemunsu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:24">Ibr. 12:24</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Rarirya wasmai fras inja nari wafararur ro saprop anine werva. Rik vedar bani vyena nasyun saprop inekwar, saprop ine vyas svari fa iser rik vedar bedi vyanna fafisu mun inya. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Rofyor wamom ma kwaker, sapropya nari vyuk royova; nari wabur wadawai farma mura muma raris snonkaku vena supva.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Mura Kain ikofen faro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> I, “Munsu ine myarvak mankenem, yasambrav fa yavar iva, <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Wayau aya bur saprop ine, yavinkwan bur varpon Vedi. Nari yambran yadawai farma mura muma imnis snonkaku vena mov va ro supswan ine bori, mansei vesrow ayansyanido nari smun aya.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Imbape <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> ikofen faro i, “Orova veri! Oso myun au ido, nari wasmai munsu, snonkaku ri fik.” Insape <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ryir kakopya ro Kain i insa mansei vesrow kuker insya, smun awer i. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Mura Kain rya ibur mov dakawos Manseren i ro anya, ma kyain ro sup Nod,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nod ido sup vedawai.</char></note> ro Eden var wamuremya.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kain romawa ma up vyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Kain ma swari sukapar romawa snonya ma sunir i ve Henokh. Posa ido Kain vyawes kota oso ma nyir i raris snonsnon romawa vyani, <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Henokh ikapar Irad. Irad ikapar Mehuyael. Mehuyael ikapar Metusael, ma Metusael irya Lamekh kmari. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lamekh vyuk vin ri suru, susoine Ada ma Sila <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada ikapar Yabal, ma Yabal up vyesya siso vefaduru rofanfan ma siso vefrur soyai fa svarek ro.<figure style="fig" file="HK00223C.TIF" size="col" ref="4:20">Soyai</figure> <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Veknik vyedi snori Yubal, ma up vyesya siso befnak nebi ma vewuf sonker.<figure style="fig" file="BK00176C.TIF" size="col" ref="4:21">Nebi</figure> <figure style="fig" file="BK00177C.TIF" size="col" ref="4:21">Sonker</figure> <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Sila ikapar Tubal Kain, ma up vyesya siso eve kamasan vekam rosaser ma romamun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Up ro kamasan sya</char></note> ro kansai ma mankarmomen. Tubal Kain srar vyedi snori Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lamekh ikofen faro swa vyansuya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada ma Sila, murower:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">ne, Lamekh swa vyena mu, murower muma ve wos ayenane:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Yamun snon oser kwar snar imer par aya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">yamun romawa babo anya snar iprer aya ra yafarvyar-vyar;<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />snar rofyor Kain vye vemunsu rarwan ri fik ido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:24">Lamekh ima rarwan samfur di fik seser di fik.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Set ma Enos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adam kuker swari sukapar romawa snon oser wer. Hawa ikofen, “Allah vyuk ve aya romawa snonya wer fa fyadwer Habel, Kain myun kwar ani.” Rarirya nyir i ve Set.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Set i ro wos Ibrani inido “svuki kwar” orovaido “vefadwer”.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Set ikapar romawa snonya nyir i ve Enos. Fafisu anya iso snonkakusya sve randak samsom sena faro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> I.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Adam up vyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Ine fasfas vadir vekur Adam up vyesi. Fafisu Allah Ifrur snonkaku, Ifrur si fa simnis raris Mankundi. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Ifrur si, snonya ma vinya. Vye vok si ma nyir si ve “snonkaku”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mat. 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:6">Mrk. 10:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Adam ikenem pasivarek usin oser samfur di kyor insape ikapar romawa snon oso imnis farari kaku i, mura nyir i ve Set. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Adam ikapar romawa inai siya wer ma ikenem kaker pasivarek usin di war. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Inja Adam ras kenem vyedi vye pasivarek usin di siw samfur di kyor insape imar.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Set ikenem pasivarek usin oser seser di rim, ikapar romawa snonya snoriso Enos. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Raimnai Set ikapar romawa inai siya wer ma ikenem kaker pasivarek usin di war seser di fik. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Set ikenem pasivarek usin di siw samfur eser seser di suru, insape imar.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Fafisu Enos ikenem pasivarek samfur di siw, ikapar romawa snonya snoriso Kenan. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Raimnai Enos ikapar romawa inai siya wer ma ikenem kaker pasivarek usin di war samfur seser di rim. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Enos ikenem pasivarek usin di siw seser di rim, insape imar.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Fafisu Kenan ikenem pasivarek samfur di fik, ikapar romawa snonya, snoriso Mahalaleel. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Kenan ikapar romawa inai siya wer ma ikenem kaker pasivarek usin di war samfur di fyak. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Kenan ikenem pasivarek usin di siw seser samfur, insape imar.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Fafisu Mahalaleel ikenem pasivarek samfur di wonem seser di rim, ikapar romawa snonya, snoriso Yared. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Mahalaleel ikapar romawa inai siya wer ma ikenem kaker pasivarek usin di war samfur di kyor. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Mahalaleel ikenem pasivarek usin di war samfur di siw seser di rim, insape imar.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Fafisu Yared ikenem Pasivarek usin oser samfur di wonem seser di suru, ikapar romawa snonya snoriso Henokh. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Yared ikapar romawa inai siya wer ma ikenem kaker pasivarek usin di war. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Yared ikenem pasivarek usin di siw samfur di wonem seser di suru insape imar.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Fafisu Henokh ikenem pasivarek samfur di wonem seser di rim, ikapar romawa snonya snoriso Metusala. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Henokh ikenem ma vye manivov kuker Allah I pasivarek usin di kyor, ro swaf ine ikapar romawa inai siya. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Inja Henokh ikenem pasivarek usin di kyor samfur di wonem seser di rim. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Snar Henokh vye manivov kuker Allah I, mura Allah duni bur supswan ine ro fafisu ivye kaker, inja snonkaku sya smam i werva.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:5">Ibr. 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:14">Yud. 14</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Fafisu Metusala ikenem pasivarek usin oser samfur di war seser di fik, ikapar romawa snonya, snoriso Lamekh. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Raimnai Metusala ikapar romawa inai siya wer ma ikenem kaker pasivarek usin di fik samfur di war seser di suru. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Metusala ikenem pasivarek usin di siw samfur di wonem seser di siw insape imar.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Fafisu Lamekh ikenem ra vye pasivarek usin oser samfur di war seser di suru, ikapar romawa snonya. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Lamekh ikofen, “Romawa ine nari vyuk ve ko sneprei rodo fararur kovena vefo kuker kandera ro saprop <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> ifras kwar ine.” Inja Lamekh nyir romawa anya ve Nuh.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nuh: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya imnisra “Sneprei”. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Raimnai Lamekh ikapar romawa inai siya wer ma ikenem kaker pasivarek usin di rim samfur di siw seser di rim, <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Lamekh ikenem pasivarek usin di fik samfur di fik, insape imar.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Ras kenem Nuh vyedi vye pasivarek usin di rim, ikapar romawa snon di kyor, sisoine, Sem, Yafet, ma Ham.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Varvor snonkaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Fafisu snonkaku sikapar rao sibor siryewen kaku ma sfamakmok ro supswan ine bori, ma sikapar inaisya kako, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />romawa manserensya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Romawa Allah, Romawa manseren, Snon nanki.</char></note> smam inkbor ansya sidoser mura sun ro fandu inkbor ansya min simarisen sya fa sna ve swa. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Inja <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> ikofen, “Nari Yavuk fa snonkakusya sikenem fyoro-fyorova; snar si oref saprop monda nari vemar. Randak ro fafis ine ras kenem sena pasivarek usin oser samfur di suru monda.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Ro fafisu anya ma ras varpurya wer, snonkaku veba kakusya sisya ro supswan ine. Sinido vinkbor snonkaku vefarvuk kuker romawa manseren ansya romawa sikapar sirya. Snonkaku veba ansine sirya mambri eve sno ro awar madero.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:33">Bil. 13:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />
    <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> myam snonkaku vero supswan ine sivarvor kaku; swaruser sena kam nafo kuker varvor.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:26">Luk. 17:26</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:20">1Ptr. 3:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Inja Fyafko snar Ifrur snonkaku ansya kwar ramnai Vyesifa sikenem ro supswan ine. Sneri fyafardun kaku, <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />muraido Ikofen, “Nari Yapyos snonkaku Yafrur kwar ansine bur supswan ine, kako man vero farsyos ma aiwan veborsyakam, Yafafko snar Yafrur sikwar.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Imbape Nuh i ma ifrur marisen <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nuh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9-10" />Ine irya fawar vekur Nuh i. Nuh ikapar romawa snon ri kyor, sisoine Sem, Yafet ma Ham. Nuh ima dakfrur sasarva, ma derer monda snonkaku kenem venapes ro fafis anya. Ikenem ma vye manivov Allah I.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:5">2Ptr. 2:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 6:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Imbape snonkaku vesesya kam sivarvor kaku ro varpon mamam Allah vyedi, ma varvorna naisya ro mov nakam. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Allah Myam supswan anya ma imkok fafayava, snar varvor snonkakusya kam sifrurna.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Inja Allah Ikofen faro Nuh i, “Yun wos vemuk kwar fa Yapyos snonkaku ma roi veborkam vekenem. Nari Yapyos si kam fnovek supswan ine, snar supswan ine ifo kuker frur vevyeva sena. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Wafrur wai vebayo ve au ro ai farfir vemku kaku ma vesrawen kaku; wafrur simno ro dori, ma won i ro do ma vandiri kuker akem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akem ido kavrai baken veba, kif vyeja suni fa svuki krof orovaido svuki dakem wai veba, bam vandi ma dori.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Wai veba anya kawanwanya kav<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kav inido wos Indonesia sove meter.</char></note> usin oser samfur di kyor seser di kyor, avavamya kav samfur di suru seser di suru, ma kakakiya kav samfur eser seser ri kyor. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Rwares epen bori, ma buk manak ro epen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rwares epen rova kovkir.</char></note> anya ve wai veba anya bamya vrapur<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vrapur imnis ra: 45-50 cm.</char></note> oser. Wafrur wai veba anya fa vye syos ri kyor, ma wafrur kedwai osero ro bamya kako. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Wamnaf navye kaku! Snar nari Yave favruv vebayo fa myun pres roi vebor bekenem ro supswan ine. Roi vebor vero supswan ine nakam nari nro ra nadawer. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Imbape nari Yafesepen eren kuker au, swun ve wai veba anya dori kuker swambri, ma romawa bansya kuker swa sesi. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19-20" />Wun kako ve wai veba anya dori man ma aiwan vesesya snoman ma vin, aiwan ansine nari sramuma ve au fa ssun ve wai veba anya dori insa simar kam awer. <verse eid="GEN 6:19-20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Wun kako fasasos nanan nabor kaku faro au ma aiwan ansyakam.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Nuh ifrur nakam raris mov Allah dawos ve i raya. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:7">Ibr. 11:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Favruv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Insape <char style="nd">Manseren </char> Ikofen faro Nuh i, “Swun ve wai veba aniya dori, au ma kina besyakam, snar werer monda snonkaku vekenem pyum raris marisen Ayena ro fandu snonkaku vero fafisu inensya. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2-3" />Wun kako ro man sya snoman ma vin sya farkyam ri fik ma kako ro aiwan venapessya snoman sya fik ma vin sya fik, imboi aiwan venapesva sya snoman oser ma vin oser monda. Wafrur ra dirya insa aiwan ansya simarkam awer, insa sikapar ma siryewen ro supswan ine bori. <verse eid="GEN 7:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Ras ri fik wer nari Yasabu mekemya ma nari imyun pdef ras samfur di fyak ma rov samfur di fyak, insa snonkaku ma roi vebor Yafrur kwar anna nro ra nadawer.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Mura Nuh ifrur nakam raris mov <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> ikofen kwar ve i raya.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Ras kenem Nuh vyedi pasivarek usin di wonem fafisu favruv veba anya myun supswan ine. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Nuh i ma swari, ma romawa kuker swa sesya ssun ve wai veba anya dori insa favruvya myun awersi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:38-39">Mat. 24:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:27">Luk. 17:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Ro aiwan venapes ma venapesva sya, man sya ma aiwan vesyaves ro sapropya bori syoso ve syoso, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />saksun kako ro wai veba anya fnovek Nuh i, raris mov Allah ikofen faro i raya. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Ras ri fik nawas ido favruv veba anya myun supswan ine.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Ras kenem Nuh vyedi pasivarek usin di wonem, ro ras eve samfur seser ri fik ro paek eve suruya, war vebor vero sapropya dori narvaren. War vebor vero mandepi nakam nasbawer,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:6">2Ptr. 3:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />ma mekemya imyun ras samfur di fyak rov samfur di fyak. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Ro ras anya kako Nuh i ma swari susun ve wai veba anya fnovek romawa suvesi, isoine Sem, Yafet ma Ham ma swa skovesi. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Rarirya kako man vebor ma aiwan vesesya, vefafir ma verafdi, aiwan vero vonde ma vesyaves ro sapropya bori veba ma kasun. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Snoman oser ma vin oser ro aiwan vebor ansya saksun kako ro wai veba anya fnovek Nuh i, <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />raris ananun Allah vyena faro i. Ssun kam kwar ra posa, <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> isisen kedwai vero wai veba anya bamya ni.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Favruv anya myun ras samfur ri fyak, inja warya dek ra ikaki isof ikanow wai veba anya ra ipyare. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Warya dek ra ikaki syadi wer, isof wai veba anya ipyar ro warya bori. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />War anya dek syadi kaku wer isof ikawef bon vekaki syadi kaku na. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Warya dek pdef isof isyadi bon pum vekaki syadi kaku na kav ri fik. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21-23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21-23" /><char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ipyos roi vebor vekenem ro supswan ine bori: Snonkaku, man ma aiwan vero sapropya bo kasun ma veba. Veyakmar va sisoine Nuh i ma vefnovek i ro wai veba anya dorinsya. <verse eid="GEN 7:21-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />War anya imyomek fasaw va ras usin oser samfur di rim.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Favruvya imyomek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Allah iswarepen Nuh i ma aiwan vebor vefarso fnovek i ro wai veba anya dori. Allah Vyuk wamya fa ikbun, isof warya imyomek fawase. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />War mkamor vebor vero sapropya dori ma vero mandep iyaswa Isisen nakam. Mekemya imnai, <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />ma warya imyomek pdef. Ras usin oser samfur di rim nawas ido warya ikaki werva. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Ro ras eve samfur seser ri fik ro paik eve fikya, wai veba anya ider ro bonpir oso ro bonvepampyam <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bonpampyam imnis kuker bon orovaido urek vekain fafaris. </char></note>Ararat. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Warya imyomek pdef ma ras randak ro paek eve samfurya bonpir na navyak.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Ras samfur ri fyak nawas ido, Nuh syeven varare oso vero wai anya, <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />ma ryir manwawa oser fa irov. Man anya kyaver ve wai veba anyava imboi irov pdef mura muma isof warya imyomek ra ivro. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Swafo wer ido, Nuh ryir mandunya fa irov fa myam karapan warya imyomek kwar ke rovaim. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Imbape snar warya ikawef kaker sapropya bori, mandun anya ismai movo fa irwai ra kyain rova. Mura irov kaver ve wai veba anya; Nuh iser i ma dun kaver i ve wai veba anya dori. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Nuh iwaf ras ri fik wer, posa ryir mandun anya fa irov wer. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Fafisu oriwai mandun anya kyaver ma darek epen saitun kakyeiya. Inja Nuh ifawi warya imyomek kwar. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Iwaf ras ri fik wer ido, ryir mandun anya fa irov wer; ro rarwan ine mandun anya kyaver ve i werva.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Fafisu Nuh ikenem vye pasivarek usin ri wonem seser oser, ro ras randak ma paek randakya, warya imyomek ra ivro fafewa. Nuh syeven sosef vero wai veba anya, ma myam be vandivar. Myam ido saprop anya bori isyor kwar. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Ro ras eve samfur di suru seser di fik ro paek eve suruya, supya bori isyor kwar.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Insape Allah Ikofen ve Nuh i, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Wasasyar bur wai veba iya kuker swambri, romawa bansya kuker swa sesi. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Wasasyar kako man vebor ma aiwan vesesya, veba ma kasun, insa sikapar siryewen ma sfamakmok supswan ine.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Mura Nuh isasyar bur wai veba anya kuker swari, romawa vyansi ma swa sesi. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Man vebor ma aiwan vero vande sisasyar kako bur wai veba anya sfarkyam syos oser-oser.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nuh vyuk farsaser</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Nuh vyawes apen farsarser oso faro <char style="nd">Manseren </char> I. Dun oser-oser ro Man ma Aiwan vese venapes sya, insape ikun si ve farsarser ro apen farsarser anya bori.<figure style="fig" file="HK00251C.TIF" size="col" ref="8:20">Apen farsarser</figure> <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Diref vemarfir ro farsarser anna nafrur marisen <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I, mura Ikofen ro sneri, “Nari Yafras supswan ine werva; snonkaku sya kakara ma frur sena navyeva fyor sibavaya mumyas, rariryano nari yapyos snonkaku ma roi vebor bekenem ro supswan ine bori wer va raris rosai Yafrur kwar ine. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Fyor supswan ine isya kaker, fafisu naisya, isoine fafisu amom kaker ma fafisu aninek, fafisu supya iprim ma fafisu supya isam, fafisu dares ma fafisu imayanyun, isnai ma rov.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Allah Fyes eren kuker Nuh i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Allah Vye vok Nuh i ma romawa vyesi ma Ikofen, “Mkokapar isof mkoryewen, insa up mkovesi sfamok supswan ine kasiper.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:28">SaR. 1:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Man vebor ro farsyos ma in sya ma aiwan vesesya kam nari simkak ma siraryof faro au. Au veve knam si ma vewaren si. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Fafisu bepon iyafa yavuk rokaker ram berumekna kwar fa nve nanan vemko. Fafis ine Yavuk kako aiwansya syoso ve syoso ma mansya sve nanan ve mko. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Imbape rik ro man rova aiwan mko karuksya, mkan awer veri snar rikya vyadir kenem Yavuk kwar faro snonkaku ma aiwansya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Im. 7:26-27</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17:10-14</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Ul. 12:16</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 23">23</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15:23</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Snonkaku orova aiwan vemun snonkakuyo fa imar nari Yamunsu i. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Yafrur snonkakuya fa imnis farari Mankundaya; inja mundiri vemun snonkakuyo fa imar, sonkakuyo nari myun i fa imar kako.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">SaR. 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:13">Kel. 20:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />Inja, mkokapar fa mkoryewen, insa mkokenem, mkofamakmok supswan ine kasiper.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:28">SaR. 1:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Allah Ikofen faro Nuh i ma romawa vyesi, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Ras ine Yafes eren kuker au ma kpu besi, <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />ma roi vebor vekenem, isoine mansya ma aiwan vero sapropya bori, vesasyar so au ro wai veba aniya. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Ine irya fes eren Ayedi kuker au: Randak ro ras ine nari roi vebor vekenem ro supswan ine favruvo myun na werva. Ma nari favruvo myun supswan ine werva. <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Avyair Yafrur fa vekain fyoro-fyoro, fandu Aya kuker mko ma kuker roi vebor vekenem nakam isoine, <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />avyair sasevi ro mandif infa fyasnai vadir fes eren Ayedi kuker supswan ine. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Ro fyor Yarir mandif na fa nakawef mandepya, ma fyor sasevi vyadir ido, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />nari Yaswarepen fes eren Ayedi faro mko ma roi vebor vekenem, isoine favruvya nari isyawerva. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Rofyor sasevi vyadir ro mandep, nari Yamam i ma yaswarepen fes eren vekain fyoro-fyoro fandu Aya kuker roi vebor vekenem ro supswan ine. <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Irya avyair fes eren Ayedi Yavuk faro roi vebor vekenem ro supswan.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nuh ma romawa vyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Nuh romawa vyesi vesasyar ro wai veba anya sisoine Sem, Yafet ma Ham. Ham irya Kanaan kmari. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Romawa Nuh vyansine sirya up ro snonkaku vebor ro supswan ine.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Nuh irya manamom, iso vefrur randak yaf anggur. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Ras oso dinem war anggur sya ra imser. Pyer sansun vyena kam ma denef vaver ro soyai vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Fafisu Ham, isoine Kanaan kmari, myam ma kmar vyaver, mura isasyar fa ikofen vadir ve naek vyansuya. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Inja Sem i kuker Yafet i suyun kruvenya fa susawer ro erdai suvena. Insape sumbran sususu ve varpur fa susun ro avdares anya ma sukawef kma suvanya kuker kruven anya. Suknenef sasyar insa sumam awer sinan suvedi vevaver ani. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Ro fafisu Nuh iknon ro marsarserya ma ifawi rosai romawa kasun vyanya ifrur yov i nya, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />mura ikofen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">“Fras faro Kanaan!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:25">Nari vye women faro naek vyesi.<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Sanandik Faro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char>, Sem isyomya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaan nari vye women faro Sem i.<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Ivyekada Allah fyanfon Vok faro Yafet i<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yafet: Snonsnon ine ryok ra wos Ibrani ido sove “fanfon”.</char></note> ma vyuk mov kankain vemkei ve i.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:27">Ivye up vyesya nari sikenem so Sem up vyesya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 9:27">Kanaan nari vye women ve Yafet i.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Posa ro Favruv anya, Nuh ikenem kaker pasivarek usin di kyor samfur di rim wer. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Nuh imar fafisu ras kenem vyedi vye pasivarek usin di siw samfur di rim.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Nuh romawa ma kpu vyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Ine irya Nuh romawa vyesi, sisoine Sem, Yafet ma Ham. Posa ro favruvya skokapar romawa snonsya.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Yafet romawa vyesi sisoine Gomer, Magog, Madai, Yawan, Tubal, Mesekh ma Tiras. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Gomer romawa vyesi sisoine Askenas, Rifat ma Togarma. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Yawan kpu vyesya sisoine Elisa, Tarsis, kawasa Kitim ma kawasa Dodanim. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Sinido up ro er vebor vekain ro swan andir ma myosna.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 10:5">Irya Yafet kpu vyesi. Kawasa vebor ansine skain ro sup mnuk sena oser-oser, ma kuker wos sena vesisye er sena vesisye.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Ham romawa vyesi sisoine Kus, Misraim, Put ma Kanaan. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Kus kpu vyesi sisoine Seba, Hawila, Sabta, Raema ma Sabtekha. Romawa Raema vye suiso Syeba ma Dedan. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kus ikapar romawa snonya snoriso Nimrod iso eve snon mambri randak ro supswan ine. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Ikako snon vesamnaf eve snonsnon snar famfnovek ro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I. Evedar isof ras ine snonkakusya sikofen vo sove, “Ivye kada <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ifrur au fa be mambri wamnisra Nimrod i” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Vave sasoser vyedi vyeraki ro Babel, Erekh, ma Akad, kota skoinekam ro Babilonia. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Ro diya ryave Asyur, insape vyawes kota Niniwe, Rehobot-Ir, Kalah, <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />ma Resen vekain ro swaf Niniwe ma Kalah. Nanekam kota veba nairya.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Misraim ikapar kawasa Ludim, kawasa Anamim, kawasa Lehabim, kawasa Naftuhim, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />Patrusim, Kasluhim, ma Kaftorim. Er Kasluhim sine sirya up ro er Filistin.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kanaan romawa vyesi, romawa rakya isoine Sidon, ma Het. <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />Kanaan ikako up ro er Yebusi, Amori, Girgasi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />snonkaku Hewisya, Arki, Sini, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />Arwadi, Semari ma Hamati. Er vebor Kanaan vyansine skakek vinkwan kaku, <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />isof sup skain roya imkei kaku, wasya ryo Sidon ve var wamires vesoyov Gerar, isof fanam Gasa, ma ve var wamurem vesoyov Gomora, Adma, ma Seboim, isof fanam Lasa.<verse eid="GEN 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Sirya Ham kpu vyesi. Er vebor ansine skain ro sup fyor sena kuker wos sena vesisye.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Sem i, Yafet eba vyedi, irya up ro er Ibrani. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Sem romawa vyesi sisoine Elam, Asyur, Arpakhsad, Lud ma Aram. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Aram kpu vyesya sisoine Us, Hul, Geter ma Mas. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Arpakhsad ikapar Sela. Ma Sela ikapar Eber. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Eber ikapar romawa snon di suru; veponya snori Peleg,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibrani ido “serarwas”.</char></note> snar ro fafisu anya Allah kyakek snonkakusya fa sfamakmok ro supswan ine bori; eve suruya snoriso Yoktan. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yoktan kpu vyesya sisoine kawasa vekain ro Almodad, Selef, Hasar-Mawet ma Yerah, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadoram, Usal, Dikla, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obal, Abimael, Syeba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofir, Hawila ma Yobab. Sinekam sirya Yoktan kpu vyesi. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Sup skain roya iryer ma ikei ro Mesa ve Sefar, isoine bonvepampyam ro var wamurem.<verse eid="GEN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Sine sirya Sem romawa ma kpu vyesi raris wos sena, sup sena ma Er vebor ansine skain ro sup fyor sena kuker wos sena vesisye. <verse eid="GEN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Sinekam sirya romawa ma kpu vebor Nuh vyesi, syos ve syos. Siso vekapar pampyam er vebor ro supswan ine fafisu favruvya isyonde.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Kaderen Babel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Randakya er vebor vero supswan ine kasiper sna wos oser ma mkarem oser monda. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Fafisu anya sisasyar bur mov skain vepon roya ma simbran ve var wamurem, isof sisrou saprop veyavam ma vepyom oso ro Babilonia, mura skain pdef ro diya. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Fafisu ri veso nawas ido sawos yaye ve si ra dine, “Mkorama kofrur kerui no ve apyak ma kokun na fa npakrek.” Rarirya sismai kerui apyak vefrur rum na ma saprop kararof kerui na. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Insape sikofen yaye ve si, “Mkorama kovawes kota oso ma komarar kaderen vekaki ra pumya kyer mandepi, insa kosmai snonsnon ma kokakek awer ro supswan ine bori.” <figure style="fig" file="CO00638C.TIF" size="col" ref="11:4">Kaderen vekaki</figure><verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Mura <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> isabu fa myam kota ma kaderen snonkaku sya svawes ani. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" /><char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> ikofen, “Snonkaku sine er oser kuker wos oser, ine irya randak ro au sena. Fyoro va ido nari sifrur roi veba syadi kakuno wer. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Ivye Kosabu fa korvaren wos sedi insa sifawi yaye awer wos sawos na.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Rarirya <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> vye si fa skakek ve supswan ine kasiper. Inja simnai vo svawes pdef kota anyava. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Evedar kota anya snir i ve Babel,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ro wos Ibrani, wos ine inido “napnap kawairon” rovaido “sampurnak”.</char></note> snar ro mov anya <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> irvaren wos ro er vebor ansyakam, ma ro mov anya kako <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> vye si fa skakek ve supswan ine kasiper.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sem kpu vyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Sine sirya romawa ma kpu Sem vyesi. Pasivarek ri suru posa ro favruv veba anya, fafisu Sem ikenem pasivarek usin oser, ikapar romawa snon oso venirve Arpakhsad. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Raimnai ikenem kaker pasivarek usin ri rim wer, ma ikapar romawa inai sya wer.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Fafisu Arpakhsad ikenem pasivarek samfur ri kyor seser ri rim, ikapar romawa snon oso, snori Selah. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Raimnai Arpakhsad ikenem kaker pasivarek usin ri fyak seser ri kyor wer, ma ikapar romawa inai sya wer.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Fafisu Selah ikenem pasivarek samfur ri kyor, ikapar romawa snon oso, snori Eber. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Raimnai Selah ikenem kaker pasivarek usin ri fyak seser di kyor wer, ma ikapar romawa inai sya wer.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Fafisu Eber ikenem pasivarek samfur ri kyor seser ri fyak, ikapar romawa snon oso, snori Peleg. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Raimnai Eber ikenem kaker pasivarek usin ri fyak seser samfur ri kyor, ma ikapar romawa inai sya wer.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Fafisu Peleg ikenem pasivarek samfur di kyor, ikapar romawa snon oso, snori Rehu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Raimnai Peleg ikenem kaker pasivarek usin risuru seser ri siw, ma ikapar romawa inai sya wer.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Fafisu Rehu ikenem pasivarek samfur ri kyor seser ri suru, ikapar romawa snon oso, snori Serug. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Raimnai Rehu ikenem kaker pasivarek usin ri suru seser ri fik ma ikapar romawa inai sya wer.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Fafisu Serug ikenem pasivarek samfur ri kyor, ikapar romawa snon oso, snori Nahor, <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Raimnai Serug ikenem kaker pasivarek usin ri suru, ma ikapar romawa sya wer.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Fafisu Nahor ikenem pasivarek samfur ri suru seser ri siw, ikapar romawa snon oso, snori Terah. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Raimnai Nahor ikenem kaker pasivarek usin oser samfur seser ri siw, ma ikapar romawa inai sya wer.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Fafisu Terah ikenem pasivarek samfur ri fik, ikapar romawa snon ri kyor, skoisoine Abram, Nahor ma Haran.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Terah kpu vyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Terah kpu vyesi siso sine: Terah ikapar Abram, Nahor ma Haran. Haran ikapar romawa snonya snori Lot. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Haran imar ro sup marin skovedi, isoine Ur ro Babilonia, fafisu kmar Terah ikenem kaker. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Abram fyarvuk kuker Sarai, ma Nahor fyarvuk kuker Haran inai vyedi isoine Milka. Haran ismai romawa snon oso wer isoine Yiska. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Imbape Sarai i pyasnasem.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Terah ibur Kota Ur ro Babilonia fnovek romawa vyedi Abram, kpu vyedi Lot, ma imbikin vyedi Sarai, isoine Abram swari. Terah kyara fa skombran ve sup Kanaan. Imbape fafisu skora ro Haran, skokain pdef ro diya. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Ro mov anya kako Terah imar fafisu vye pasivarek usin ri suru seser ri rim.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">Abram ismai fararyor ro Allah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />
    <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> dawos faro Abram i, “Wabur sup marin bedi, naek besya ma kako kmami rum vyeja, ve sup nari Yakur fasnai faro au.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:2-3">Kis. 7:2-3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:8">Ibr. 11:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Nari Yavuk ve au fa kpu besya sibor kaku ma nari sve er veba kaku. Nari Yave vok au ma Yafrur fa snonsnon bedi iryer, snar au, kawasa vebor nari sismai vok.<verse eid="GEN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Nari Yave vok snonkaku eve vok au sya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:3">ma yafras snonkaku vefras au sya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 12:3">Ma snar au</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 12:3">Nari yave vok er vebor vero supswan ine syakam.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ma snar ... supswan ine syakam </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rovaido Er vebor nari sfararyor ve Aya insa Yave vok si raris Yave vok au kwar raya. </char></note><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:8">Gal. 3:8</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4-5" />Abram ras kenem vyedi vye pasivarek samfur di fik seser di rim fafisu isasyar bur Haran, raris <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> wanwan Vyedi faro i. Abram imbran be Kanaan kuker swar Sarai i ma fno vyedi Lot i, ma nana vebor vyena kuker manfyan infyan ismai kwar ro Haran.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 12:4-5">Fafisu ifyafer kwar ro Kanaan, <verse eid="GEN 12:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Abram imbran yar sup ani isof syuver ro aiknam veba tarbantin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tarbantin wos Ibrani inido aiknam veba veryewen vemnis asar. </char></note> ro More,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:6: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">More ido mov raryur kankain kakara kayam; mankurari, mankara.</char></note> fanam Sikhem. Fafisu anya snonkaku Kanaan sya sisya skain ro sup ani. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" /><char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> fyasnai mankundi faro Abram ma dawos faro i, “Ine irya sup nari yavuk faro kpu besya.” Muraido Abram daker apen farsarser oso rodiya faro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> befasnai mankundi kwar faro i.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Kis. 7:5</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:16">Gal. 3:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Ramnai ido imbran pdef maran vyeja ve var wamires, ve mov eve bonuk ro Betel var wamuremya, ro swaf Betel ma Ai: Betel ryo var wambarek ma Ai ryo var wamurem. Vyaus apen farsarser faro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I ma dap snonsnon Vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Posa Abram imbran wer, rarirya imbran binkwan kaku, isof ro var wamires sup Kanaan.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abram ryo Mesir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Imbape fafisu anya basbiser veba kakuya myun ro sup Kanaan, isof ro Abram rya ve Mesir fa ikenem ro diya rao basbiser ani isyonde. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Fafisu ive syun be sup Mesir, ikofen yov swar Sarai i, “Swa ayedi, wapyum fafayava. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Inja Snonkaku Mesirsya smam au ido na skara vo sove swa ayediso au mura na smun aya imboi sfakman au fa wakenem. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Inja ipyum syadi wakofen vo wove au ido srar ayedi, insama sfakman aya fa yakenem ma sve navye aya.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:2">20:2</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Kakara Abram vyanya kyaku, fafisu Abram ryandum kwar ro Mesir ido, snonkaku Mesirsya smam Sarai ipyum fafayava. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Faker Firaun vyesya ono smam Sarai i mura sikofen vadir padakduk vyedi faro Firaun i; mura ido sun i ve Firaun aidoran vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Sarai vyedar, Firaun vyenavye Abram i ma vyuk manfyan infyan, rofanfan domba ma kambing, sapi, keledai ma unta ve i.<figure style="fig" file="LB00039C.TIF" size="col" ref="12:16">Unta</figure><verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Imboi snar Firaun dun Sara i fa nya ve swa, mura <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> vyuk duf veba na fa nmun Firaun i ma kawasa vebor vero aidoran vyanyansya. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Mura Firaun dor Abram i ma ifuken i, “Rosai wafrur kwar yov aya ine? Swa bedisine raisya vo wakofen isnaiva. <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Wakofen vo wove srar bediri evedar yun i fa ive yana ve swa. Swa bani, isine; inja wun i ma wabur mov ine!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Insape Firaun vyuk sasoser ve faker vyesya fa sun Abram i, swari ma kawasa vyesya fnovek nana sena kam fa sisasyar bur sup anya.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Abram ma Lot suvesisye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Abram isasyar bur sup Mesir kuker swari ma nana vebor vyena ve sup Negeb, ma Lot i kako iso. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Abram snonkaku venana rirya; ismai ve domba, kambing, sapi, sarak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sarak: rovaido </char></note> ma brawen. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Imbran vyeryar ro mov mnaisu iya ve mov mnaisu iya wer veso yov Betel, mov fafis iyafa syoyai randak roya swaf Betel kuker Ai <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />ma mov daker apen farsarserya ro. Ro mov anya iso Abram dap randak kaku snonsnon <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Lot i kako nya kina ma manfyan infyan, domba, kambing ma sapi si. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Imbape saprop ma maper ro mov anya imkei va snar rofanfan suvesya sibor rape. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Irya newari mbrov ro fandu manfarandous Abram vyesya ma manfarandous Lot vyesyi. Fafisu anya snonkaku Kanaan ma snonkaku Feris sya sna mnu ro sup anya kako.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Mura Abram dawos ve Lot i, “Kuinema kina oser, inja fanfavri ma rapapik naisya awer fandu aya ma au ma kako rofandu manfarandous ayesya ma manfarandous besya. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Imbo sup aniwara ikei, inja ipyum syadi kuvesisye. Kwinfir ro saprop ine mov risai wamarisen i, wabur ve var ine ido na yabur ve varo vese.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Lot myam ve vandivar ma sneri pyoserbos kaku kadwas Yordan isof ro sup Soar snar war na nabor kaku ro dwas anya, imnis kaku yaf Eden orovaido imnis raris sup Mesir. Irya payamyum ro vepon ro randak Allah vye ninyan sup Sodom ma Gomora vaim.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:10">SaR. 2:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Inja Lot kyinfir kadwas Yordan kasiper, insape ibur Abraham i ma ryave var wamurem. Rarirya snonkaku ansuya suve sisye. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abram kyain pdef ro sup Kanaan, vape Lot syoyai ro kadwas Yordan ro kota vefanam ve Sodom. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Kawasa vekenem ro Sodom sya sivarvor fafayava ma sifrur sasar nabor kaku ro varpon <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> I.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abram isasyar ve Hebron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Posa ro Lot ive sisye kuker Abram i kwar ido, <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> dawos faro Abram i, “Mam farma ve vandivar, mam kako ro mov wores ro iya ve wamurem ma wambarek, wambrur ma wamires; <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Sup vebor mam kwar annane nari Yavuk na faro au ma faro kpu besya isof fyoro-fyoro.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Kis. 7:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Ma nari Yafrur fa kpu besya sibor kaku, isof oso fa nari kyor napok siva. Rarirya osova kako fa nari kyor napok oref vero saprop, rarirya kako kuker kpu besya oso fa nari kyor napok siva. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Fasos, wambran yar sup ine raris kawanwan ma avavamya, snar nari Yavuk na faro au.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Posa Abram rya fa vyawes soyai fanam aiknam tarbantin vero Mamre<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mambri ido snonsnon snonkaku ma mov.</char></note> vefanam Hebron, ma rodiya vyawes apen farsarserya faro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> I.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Abram fyaspar Lot i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Fafisu Abram vyarek fanam Hebron, wairek ri fyak, ro var wamurem, sisoine; Amrafel wairek Babilonia, Ariok wairek sup Elasar, Kedorlaomer wairek sup Elam, ma Tideal wairek sup Goyim, skoryur skove oser fa <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />skomamun kuker wairek ri rim ro var wambarek, sisoine; Bera wairek Sodom, Birsya wairek Gomora, Syinab ro sup Adma; Semeber wairek ro Seboim ma wairek oso wer vera ker sup Bela rovaido sup Soar. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Wairek ri rim anskoine skove oser ma skoryur rak mamun skovesya ro kadwas Sidim, mov babo kir ine sap ve Soren vemar. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Pasivarek samfur seser di suru wairek ri rim anskoine skove women faro wairek veba Kedorlaomer i, imbape ro pasivarek veve samfur seser kyor ine wairek anskoine skove mbrov wairek Kedorlaomer i. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Inja ro pasivarek veve samfur seser fyak, Kedorlaomer ma wairek eve kayam kuker i sun rak mamun sesya ma sembrov kuker kawasa Refaim ro sup Asyterot-Karnaim, kawasa Susim ro Ham, kawasa Emim ro Syawe-Kiryataim, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />ma kawasa Hori ro bonvepampyam Edom, seveyau vinkwan kaku ve varare maper ro sup El-Paran. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Rodiya snonkaku veyom ansya siwarye ve En-Mispat, mov babo kir ine sap ve Kades. Skomamun yar ma skovriwarek sup Amalek, ma skomerkar kako snonkaku Amori eve mnu ro Haseson-Tamar.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Rarirya kako wairek vebor ro sup Sodom, Gomora, Adma, Seboim ma Bela sisasyar fa sfasos snon mamun sesya ro dwas Sidim <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />fa smamun kuker wairek Elam, Goyim, Babilonia, ma Elasar; inja wairek ri fyak sko ve mbrov wairek ri rim. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Dwas ani ifo kuker marser aspal, inja fafisu wairek Sodom ma Gomora suve sewar fa sufrar subur mamun veba anya, snon mamun suvesya siya sisapi ro marser aspal anna. Wairek ri kyor sifrar sibur ve bonvepampyam na. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Wairek ri fyak vesambrav ansya, sfasyar pres roi vebor vero Sodom ma Gomora, ma rovean vebor na kako, posa ido sibur. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Abram fno vye Lot i kyain ro Sodom, mura sun i kako warpu nana vebor vyena kam.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Imbape snon oser vefaspar ro mamun veba anya ikofen vadir pres roi evesya annakam ve Abram, snon Ibrani anya. Abram vyarek ve mandaman ro saprop mnuk Mamre snon Amoriya vyedi, fanam aiknam tarbantin anya. Mamre ma naek vyesuya susoine Eskol ma Aner. Snonkaku anskoine skove oser fa skomamun so Abram i. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Fafisu Abram imnaf romawa fno vyani sun i ve women, mura iryur snon vebor vero mov vye ryar ro nanya, snon vefawi vemamunsya utin di kyor samfur eser seser di war, insape iyom wairek ri fyak ansya ra isof kota Dan. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Ro mov anya Abram irwas snonkaku vyansya fa sve rarwas ri veso, insape ro mun rovya fyarmun mrov vyansya ma imerkarsi. Iyau myun si ra isof ro Hoba vero var wambrur kota Damsyik. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Abram dun kaver roi vebor sfasyar anna, kuker Lot i ma nana vebor vyanna, var vin sya ma women vesesya.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Melkisedek vye vok Abram i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Posa ro imerkar wairek Kedorlaomer kuker wairek vewarpu insya, insape Abram kyaver. Muraido wairek Sodom rya isrow kuker Abram i ro Kadwas Syawe, kadwas ine sap kako i ve Kadwas Wairek. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Melkisedek, wairek Salem vekif nasan imam Allah Vekaki Syadi Kaku, dun mamami ma anggur sya ve Abram i,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:1-10">Ibr. 7:1-10</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />Posa vye vok Abram i ma dawos ve i radine, “Ivye Allah Vekaki Syadi Kaku, vefakais nanki ma sup swan ine vye vok au! <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Sandik faro Allah Vekaki Syadi Kaku, vevuk fa wamerkar mbrov besi.” Posa ro diya Abram vyuk faro Melkisedek i roivebor fyasyar fa dun kaver anna barborya rarwas-var samfur.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Posa wairek Sodom dawos faro Abram i, “Kwaver monda snonkaku ayansya imboi nana vebor fasyar annakam wun na.”<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Imbape Abram, kyarem faro i, “Yafores ro varpon <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> Vekaki Syadi Kaku, Vesarmur nanki ma sup swan, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />yapok yun roker mkuno vaveri ro nana banna, ma ro kavrai pusyom rova kavrai karsyower besya kako. Rarirya nari wapok wawos vo wove, ‘Aya vefrur fa Abram ismai nana naborya.’<figure style="fig" file="LB00161C.TIF" size="col" ref="14:23">Kavrai karsyower</figure> <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Yamewer yun royo-royo vardi ve aya ndi. Imbape rosai snonkaku ayansine san kwarna, yasmai na ra diri. Imboi ivye kada manivov-manivov vewarpu ayanansya, sisoine Aner, Eskol ma Mamre, skoiso veyun rarwas var skovena.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ananun Allah kuker Abram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Posa ido, Abram myam mamam oso ma imnaf <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> dawos faro i vo dove, “Abram wamkak awer, nari yakadaun au ro marindi venyanem au, ma yavuk vavyak veba kaku faro au.”<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2-3" />Imbape Abram dove, “<char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> Mamboryas, buk romawayo ve ayava. Snonkaku nari eve knam arasai vebor ayena iyer monda Elieser i, manfyan yun ro Damsyik ani. Inja faindayova fa <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> buk vavyak ve aya.”<verse eid="GEN 15:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Romura Abram imnaf <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ikofen yov i vo dove, “Manfyan bedinema nari vye knam nana bannaneva imboi romawa snon karyer mankundaw bedi.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" /><char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> dun Abram i ve vondi ma ikofen faro i, “Mambe nank iyaswa ma kwor karapan mak sya, nari wasmai rer<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keturunan</char></note> sibor kaku raris mak siyaswa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:18">Rm. 4:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:12">Ibr. 11:12</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Abram ikyar faro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> I ma ro diya <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> kyori ve snonkaku vefrur marisen sneri.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:3">Rm. 4:3</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gal. 3:6</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Yak. 2:23</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Posa ido <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> dawos faro i, “Aya <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vefarkin au fafisu wasasyar ro sup Ur ro Babilonia, ma vevuk saprop ine faro au fa nwave sup mankun.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Vape Abram ifuken, “Sye, <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vekain ro mov Vekaki Syadi kaku, mov risai yafawi kaku nari yana saprop ine ve sup mankun raya?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />
    <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> kyarem ve i, “Wun ma ve Aya sapi vin oser, kambing vin oser, ma domba snoman oser, si vardi se pasivarek ri kyor, ma kako manveyoren ma mandun oser.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Irya Abram dun aiwan ansya faro Allah I. Sapi, kambing ma domba sya sivardi skes si ra sve vardi suru, insape srir si fa skar yaye syos ri suru. Imbape man ansya ido sisiper. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Man vebor veyan kraf sirwai fa ive san kraf ansya, Abram iyau si.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Fafisu ori syun murvav, Abram denef moser imnis raris snonkaku vemar. Fyoro va pampanya ikawef i inja imkak namsinba kaku<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:13">Ayb. 4:13</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 14">14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" /><char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ikofen faro i; “Waswar epen, kpu besya nari sve kawasa mandaman ro sup vese; nari sve women ro diwa ma na sve wayam si pasivarek utin di fyak.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:1-14">Kel. 1:1-14</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:6">Kis. 7:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Imbape er eve wayam si ve women ansya nari yamunsu vesi posa ido kpu besya nari sisasyar bur sup ani, ma sun sfaryan nana nabor kaku.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40-41">Kel. 12:40-41</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:7">Kis. 7:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Au vardi nari ras kenem bedi ikwan kaku rawo pik bena napyoper; nari wamar kuker kananon, insape sikram au.<verse eid="GEN 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Kpu besya syos ri fyak isyonde ido, nari skaver wer muma ve dine. Fafisu ine Yayaw snonkaku Amori sine bur sup ine baim rao varvor sena nfamfanfon ra nabor kaku, insape Yamsor si ma Yaveninyan si.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Fafisu rovya, fyoro va sayer vepawya ma amyas vesak oso, suyunuk ro fandu rofanfan kraf ansi. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Kur anya veri <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char>, fyes eren kuker Abram i. <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> dove; “Yakofen kaku ve au; sup ine kasiper nari Yavuk i faro up besya, randak ro yawek sup Mesir isof marei veba Efrat,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Kis. 7:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />kako sup Keni, Kenas, Kadmon, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />Het, Feris, Refaim, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Amori, Kanaan, Girgasi, ma Yebus.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s1">Hagar ma Ismael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Abram swa vye Sarai, ismai romawayova kaker. Imboi ismai vinfyan vin Mesir oso, inkbor ani snoriso Hagar. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Sarai ikofen faro Abram i vo dove, “<char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vyuk fa yakaparva. Rarirya ipyum syadi wenef kuker vinfyan ayanine imbude iso nari vekapar romawayo ve ayanya ndi.” Abram vyuk kaku ro Sarai swaruser vyanine. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Rarirya Sarai dun Hagar i fa Abram nya ve swa. Kur anya Abram ikenem ro sup Kanaan pasivarek samfur kwar. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Abram denef kuker Hagar i, inja vin anya fyadores. Imbape fafis vyavir fyadores, mura dow vinkundi ma kyorwef Sarai i.<verse eid="GEN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Mura ido Sarai dawos faro Abram i, “Yavuk infamyan ayedi Hagar i kwar faro au fa nwa ve swa, ma fafisu ifawi kaku fyadores mura ido kyorwef aya. Inja Sasar bediri. Ivye<char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vye user frur evesya ine faro au ma aya.”<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Abram kyarem faro i, “Rwower, vinfyan bedirya ma kyunem ro bav bedi; wafrur yov i ra mov wamarisen raya.” Muraido Sarai vye navye Hagar iva ma vye wayam kaku i, inja Hagar ifrar ibur i.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Manakya <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> vyedi isrow kuker Hagar i ro war sun vero sup veve ursva, fanam nyan rayuk veso mura ve Syur. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Manakya ani ifuken, “Hagar, vinfyan Sarai vyanawi rwa kero ma ive rwave?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Hagar kyarem ve i, “Yafrar yabur vin amber ayedi Sarai i.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Manakya ani ikofen; “Kwaver ve i ma wuf farmyan i.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Manakya anya dawos wer, “Nari yavuk ve au romawa kpu sibor kaku, manseiryano nari kyor napok si va. <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Fyoro va ido nari waven romawa snono ma nwir ive Ismael,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:11: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ismael: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya isoine: Allah ryower. </char></note> snar <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ryower kwar kankanes bena. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Imbape romawa anya nari ikenem imnis keledai verafdi; romawa anya nari fyanfavri kuker snonkaku, ma snonkaku sya nari sfanfavri kuker i. Romawa anya nari ikenem ro vondi bur naek vyesyakam.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Hagar ifuken ro sneri, “Kaku ke yamam Allah I kwar, vemam faduru aya?” Rarirya Hagar dap <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> veyawawos kwar faro i anya, “Au Allah vemam faduru aya.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Evedar fa sap war veyer ro swaf Kades ma Bered anya, “War veyer Lahai-Roi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:14:</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lahai-Roi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya isoine: “Au Allah vemam faduru aya.”</char></note><verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Rarirya Hagar i ikapar romawa snonya, ma kmar Abram, nyir romawa anya ve Ismael.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:22">Gal. 4:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Fafisu anya Abram ras kenem vyeja, pasivarek samfur di war seser di wonem.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Sunat vye avyair fasfes-eren Allah kuker Abraham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Fafisu ras kenem Abram vyedi vye pasibarek samfur di siw seser di siw, <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> fyasna mankundi ma Ikofen ve i vo dove, “Ayaine kada Allah veve knam Papoikya. Waso user Aya ma wafrur marisen Ayena vesya kwar. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Nari Yafes eren kuker au ma Yavuk romawa ma kpu besya ra sibor rape.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Inja Abram vyan suba faro I, insape Allah Dawos wer, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4-5" />“Ine irya fes eren Ayedi kuker au: Yavuk anun faro au snar au irya up ro er vebor syakam. Rarirya snombri nari sap ive Abram werva imboi sap i ve Abraham.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:4-5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abraham: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibrani ryok imnis wos veyove: “Sinan up ro er vebor”.</char></note><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:17">Rm. 4:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 17:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Nari Yavuk ve au romawa inai sibor kaku, ma rofandu si nari ono sve wairek. Kpu besya sibor fafayava, isofro nari sve er vebor veba.<verse eid="GEN 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />Nari yave asuser eren Ayedi faro au ma kpu besya, syos ve syos, ma fes eren ine kyain fioro bis. Ayaine yave Allah ve au ma Allah ve kpu besya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:55">Luk. 1:55</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Nari Yavuk ve au ma kpu besya, saprop kurine wakenem ve mandaman ro ine. Saprop Kanaan kasiper nari vye sup marin ve romawa kpu besya isof fioro ma nari sisyom monda faro Aya.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Kis. 7:5</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Allah dawos wer ve Abraham i, “Au kako ivye waserepen nako faro fes eren ine, au ma kpu besya syoso ve syoso. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Au ma kpu besya snon sya ivye sve sunatsi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:8">Kis. 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:11">Rm. 4:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11-12" />Randak ro kurine nari be sunat romawa kapira snon eve ras ri war, kako manfamyan sikapar ro rum bedi dori rovaido manfamyan kwoves si. Sunat anine nari vye avyair fes eren Ayedi kuker au. <verse eid="GEN 17:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Snon syakam sismai sunat. Ine nari vye avyair vefasnai vadir fes eren Ayeja kuker au kyain fyoro bis. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Snon eve sunatva sya, saksun karkor ro kawasa ayesyava snar sveyuk fes eren ani.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Posa Allah Ikofen faro Abraham i, “Nari wap swambri snonsnonya ve Sarai werva; imboi randak ro ras ine nari wap ive Sara. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Nari yave vok Sara i. Nari Yavuk fa daven romawa snono ve au. Kaku, nari Yave vok Sara i, ma nari vye up faro er vebor. Ro fandu kpu vyansine nari ono sve wairek.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Inja Abraham kyankunem, imbrif ma kyara fasis ro sneri, “Ras mundiri snon eve mansar bos kaku yaine nari yasmai romawayo raya? Ma Sara ikako vye pasivarek samfur di siw kwar inja nari ikapar?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Mura ikofen faro Allah i, “Ipyum syadi Ismael i eve knam nana ayanna-ni.”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Imbape Allah Ikofen, “Orova. Swambri Sara i nari daven romawa snono ma nari nwir i ve Ishak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ishak: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya isoine: “imbrif”.</char></note> Nari yave asuser fes eren Ayedi kuker romawa ani ma kuker kpu vyesya isof fioro bis. Fes eren anya kyain fyoro bis. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Faro Ismael i, Yamnaf fararyor beja kwar; nari Yave vok i, ma Yavuk fa ikapar iryewen rao sibor kaku; nari ikapar wairek samfur seser di suru, ma nari Yafrur fa vye er veba kaku. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Imbape fes eren Ayedine nari yafesi kuker Isak, romawa karyer bani, nari Sara daven i ro pasibarek babo, imnis fafisu veradine.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Allah dawos ra posa, ibur Abraham i.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Abraham isoyuser Allah ananun vyeja, inja ro ras anya veri vye sunat romawa vye Ismael i ma snon vebor vero rumya dorisya kame, ma manfyan sikapar ro rum vyeja warpu manfyan kyoves sya. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Abraham ras kenem vyedi, vye pasivarek samfur di siw seser di siw, fafisu sesunat i <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />ma romawa vye Ismael i, vye pasivarek samfur seser di kyor. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Sikame sve sunat ro ras oser, <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />fnovek manfyan Abraham vyesya kame.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Allah fyasnai Mankundi ve Abraham i ro Mamre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Ras oso <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> fyasnai mankundi wer faro Abraham i ro soyai vyedi fanam aiknam tarbantin vero Mamre. Ro ras anya daresya iba marsir va. Abraham kyain ro kerwa soyai vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Fafis ikpoi vruri, myam snon di kior skores ro varpon vyedi, Abraham iyor i ma isamberen fa isrow kuker sko. Kyunem ma<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:2">Ibr. 13:2</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />ikofen ve sko vo dove, “Amber anmkoya mkombran pdef bur awer soyai ayedine, ivyekada mkomnaisar insamaido yuf farmyan mko resari. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Nari yun war keno ma vyan amber anmkoya mkowemna, inja mkorama mkokain mbruk ro ai fuar ine. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />insa yun anan ker no ma mkan fa nbuk sambrav ve mko fasamaido mkombran pdef marandan mkovedi. Amber anmkoya mkove syowi kaku aya, evedar mkomnai sar ro soyai ker ayedine ndi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Skokam skokarem be i vo skove, “Kasumasa ve au ro frur pyum bedi. Nari nkomnai sar.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Abraham syun sausau ve soyai vyani, ma ikofen faro Sara i, “Wun fasau tepung vepyum kaku, ma wofer na ra nompnir.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Insape ifrar fasau ve padwar rofanfan vyedi ma dun sapi kuv babo kraf vesvunek ma ve mafen, insape duni ma ve infamyan vyedi fa ikun fasau i. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Posa ido Abraham dun sapi sus sya, sus mafen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sus mafen imnisra buk-buk srai papraf. </char></note> sya, ma sapi kraf vemas fyasos kwar ansya ro varpon dakam vyansi. Fafisu skokain skonan, Abraham mankundi duf farmyan sko ro ai fuar ani.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Skonan ra posa skofuken, “Swambri Sara i ryoiso?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Abraham kyarem ve sko vo dove, “Isya ro diwa, ro soyai iwa dori.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Snon oso ro fandu sko ikofen, “Fafis vera dine ro pasibarek babo nari yakaver. Ro fafisu anya swambri Sara inari daven romawa snono.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:9">Rm. 9:9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Fafis anya Sara isya ryower ro kedwai soyai anya varpurdi. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Abraham kuker Sara su ve mansar vinsar kaku, inja Sara nari ikaparva. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Inja Sara imbrif ro snerido ma ikofen, “Yave vinsar ma yamaryoi, swa ayanya no vye mansar kako, inja mov risai romawa veyun doryav marisen be ayanya yasmai i raya?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:6">1Ptr. 3:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Mura <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ifuken ve Abraham i, “Rosai evedar Sara imbrif ma kyor wanan ro sneri, kakuke nari yakapar romawayo ro fafisu yave vinsar ine? <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Royo isyafa syamswen faro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> iva? Raris insanja Yakofen kwar ani, fafis veradine nari Yakaver ve dine wer ma fafisu anya Sara nari daven romawa snono.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:37">Luk. 1:37</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Snar Sara imkake, inja iruken, dove, “Ayama yambrif va.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Imbape <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> kyarem ve i, “Kaku, insanja wambrif.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abraham dor fakamaman faro Sodom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Insape snon dakam anskoiya skombran wer ma Abraham imbran so sko. Skombran raro mov oso ma skores skomam ve Sodom. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" /><char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ikofen ro sneri “Rosai Yave Yafrurya nari Yayofek na bur Abraham iva. <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Up vyesya nari sve er veba nari vekif vave sasoserya. Ro do i, er vebor vero supswan ine nari Yave vok si. <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Yakinfir i kwar fa fyarkin romawa vyesi ma kpu vyesi, insa sisoyuser Aya ma sifrur roi vebor vepyum ma venapes. Inja sifrur na ido, ananun vebor Ayena faro Abraham i nari yavuk na fa namawes.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Romura <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ikofen faro Abraham i, “Yamnaf fawar vevyeva vemarvak vekur Sodom ma Gomora, ma kakuveri varvor Sasar sena nabor naba kaku. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Rarirya nari yasabu mura ve si, fa Yamam fanfaya vebor Yamnaf nane nkakuke orova.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Muraido snon di suru ro fandu snon eve dakam anskoiya, sumbran ve Sodom, imbape <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> isya dores kaker kuker Abraham i. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Abraham isnefer <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> I ma ifuken, “Kaku <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> nari ve ninyan snon kaku vekenem pyum sya fa siwarpu snonkaku vesasar sya? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Imboi snon kaku samfur di rim vesasar va sisya ro kota anya ido, nari <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> beninyan kota anya? Ivyeido Fakman kota ani, insa snonkaku ansine simar awer. <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Sye <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> rariryanawer! Imbude snonkaku vesasar va sya simar warpu vesasar sya ndi? Snar <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> wafrur ra dirya nido, snonkaku vesasar va sya nari se eve ninyan warpu snonkaku vesasar si. Au monda Mankakara faro kawasa ro sup swan. Inja, nari ve Mankara si kuker nanapes!”<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />
    <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> kyarem, “Imbo snonkaku samfur di rim vekenem pyumno sisya ro Sodom ido, nari yavuk fakamaman faro kotaya vesiper snar snonkaku ansine.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Abraham ikofen wer, “<char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> fakman aya ro wos vesyadadi nane. Ayaine snonkaku monda, yasmai papoikova fa yavuk dawawos yov Au. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Imbape, snonkaku samfur di fyak seser di rim monda ryarpon do samfur di rim yava, nari <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> farmun kota anya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">
    <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> kyarem vo dove, “Yasrow snonkaku ri samfur di fyak seser di rim vekakusya ido, nari yafarmun kota anyava?”<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Abraham ifuken wer, “Rariso snonkaku samfur di fyak monda ido?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">
    <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> kyarem ve i, “Snar snonkaku samfur di fyak ansya svedar yambrer au Ayena.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Abraham ikofen wer, “<char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> wamsor awer aya imbe yave yafuken wer. Rariso snonkaku samfur di kyor monda ido?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Kyarem vo dove, “Yasrow snonkaku samfur di kyor monda ido, nari yambrer swaruser Ayena”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Abraham ifuken wer, “Buk fakman ve aya ro wos syadadi ayena insa yawos pdef wawos ayena, <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ivye snon kaku samfur di suru monda ido?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">
    <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> kyarem, “Yasrow snon kaku samfur di suruyo ido, kota iwa nari yafarmun iva.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Papupesya Abraham ikofen wer, “Wamsor awer aya <char style="nd">Manseren Allah,</char> yafuken monda ve rarwan osero wer. Snonkaku samfur monda ido, rariso?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">
    <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> kyarem ve i, “Snonkaku samfur monda i vesasarvaya ido, nari Yafarmun kota anyava.” <verse eid="GEN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Rarirya<char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> dawawos kuker Abraham i ra posa, insape Ramura, ma Abraham i kako ibur ve soyai vyedi.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Sasar varvor kawasa Sodom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Snondi kyor anskoiya skove ryar so Abraham i ra posa, manakya ri suru ansuya sumbran ve Sodom ma sura ro diwa ido fanam rov kwar. Lot isya kyain ro kedwai veba kota ani. Ma rofyor myam manakya ansuya, iyori ma imbran ra isrow kuker su, kyer wepur ro varpon suveja ma kyunem yov su, <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />ma ikofen yov su vo dove, “Amber anmuine, ivye kada mumnaisu ro rum ayedi. Amber anmuine muvan wemin muvesya posa muyenef ro rum ayedi. Mumarisen ido meser arwo primya insape mumbran pdef marandan muvedi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Imbape snon ansuya sukofen vo suyove, “Kasumasa, nuyenef ro dine monda, ro vuves kota ine kwar.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Lot dor samsom kaku, isof ro susun ma suyenef so i ro rum vyedi. Lot fyasos rovean vemafen ma ryap mamami nabor kako, insape skonan.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Imbape snon dakam vyansuine suyenef vaim, snon Sodom sya srama saiwarek rum ani. Snon ansine randak ro mansarsya isof ro romawa babo, sisya kam ro mov ani. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Sor naba ve Lot i vo sifuken, “Snon di suru rov ine verama eve ryar so au suya suroiso? Rwir su ve inko insama nkomamfar su.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 19:22-24">Hak. 19:22-24</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Lot isasyar ro rum vyedi ma, kyen kedwaiya warek su, <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />insape dawos ve kawasa ansi vo dove, “Naek yena mko yor kaku ve mko, mkofrur awer mnuk varvor ine! <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Indo mkorower, yana inai inkbor ri suru. Ivye yarir su ve mko ma mkofrur su raris marisen mkovena, imboi snon dakam ayesuine mkofrur awer royo faro su; snar surama sufadiren ro rum ayedi.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Imbape snon Sodom ansya sikofen be Lot i, “Wakren bur! Mandaman monda ris au, wove farkor inko? Wakren fasau! Orovaido na nkoprer au nabasyadi ro rosai nari nkofrur faro snon ansuya ni.” Inja spampum Lot ibur vo, ive srer bas kedwai i. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Imbape snon ansuya susawar fa supau Lot i fa syun be rumya dori ra posa suken kedwai anya. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Snon ansuya sufrur mkamor snon vebor ansya sena fa npampan, isof sifawi kedwai anyawerva.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:18">2Raj. 6:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lot ifrar ibur Sodom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Snon dakam ansuya suve vadir faro Lot i, “Ausya nwa romawa snon ma inai, ma kako mambikin orovaido naek evese, sisya ro kota ine ido, wun si fa sisasyar bur mov ine, <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />snar kota ine ive nu ve ninyan i! <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ryower wos kursof vemarvak vekur kawasa vero kota ine, inja nusmai wanwan fa nuve ninyan kota Sodom.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Insape Lot ryafa isrow kuker romawa ive nya ve mambikin ansuya, ma ikofen, “musasyar fasaw bur mov ine, snar <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> nari Vye ninyan i.” Imbape suyoverada Lot dawos fnak monda.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Fafisu orya dompis vaim, manakya ri suru ansuya sudif kaku Lot i fa isasyar fasaw. Sukofen faro i, “Wasamberen kaku.” “Wasasyar fa wabur fasaw kuker swambri ma vinkbor bansuya bur mov ine, insa mkomar awer rofyor kota ine yave ninyan i.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Lot vye virvar. Imbape <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> iswar i; inja snon dakam ansuya sukfin Lot i ma swari kuker inai inkbor vyansuya fa skosasyar bur kota ani.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:7">2Ptr. 2:7</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Posa rodiya manakya ansuya sumindi ikofen, “Mkofrar, mkofaspar mankun mko! Mkopambar fa mkomam be varpur awer ma mkomnaisar awer ro dwas Yordan. Mkofrar ve bonvepampyan iwa insa mkomar awer!”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Imbape Lot kyarem ve i, “Sye, Amber wawan awer fa nkofrar ve bonvepampyam naiwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Amber wasaramper aya ma faspar kenem ayeja kwar. Imbape bonvepampyan naiwa nvinkwan kaku; ma fafisu yafrar kaker mura, kota Sodom vye mompraf kwar inja nari yakmar kako. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Mam mura, kota mkun vefanamya iso iponwa. Rwir fa yafrar mura ve diwa insa yavye.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Manakya ani kyarem ve i, “Ipyum, rarirya ido kota mkun aniwa na yamun iva. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Wasamberen, wafrar! Snar nari yafrur royo vaim rao wafrar ra ro diwa resari.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:22">Snar Lot dove kota anya ibava, mura kota ani snir i ve Soar.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Soar: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon anya ryok imnis wos Ibrani isoine “ibava”.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sodom ma Gomora suve mompraf</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Orya dompis kwar, fafisu Lot ryaro Soar. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Fyoro va ido <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> isabu karui veve for vesapi ro nankya mufes namnis mekem ro bo Sodom ma Gomora. <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />Kota ansuya suve mompraf, kako dwas anya kasiper ma rokaker nakam fnovek kawasa vero diyansya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat. 10:15</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 11:23-24">11:23-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Luk. 10:12</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:29">17:29</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:6">2Ptr. 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:7">Yud. 7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Imbape Lot swari iknenef fa myambe varpur, mura fyarwe fa vye adir karu-masen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:32">Luk. 17:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Arwori fyase, ro arwo baboya, Abraham imbran samberen ve mov mandovindi dores ro varpon Allah i anya. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Abraham myam mura ve Sodom ma Gomora ma dwas Yordan kasiper, ma myam pau<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pau ine ido “pau vesasyar diref vemamur”.</char></note> na nek ro sapropya bori, imnis pau bero fafen veba kaku. <verse eid="GEN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Irya fafisu Allah vye mompraf kota-kota vero dwas mov Lot ikenem ro, Allah iswarepen fararyor ro Abraham i inja isaramper Lot i fa ifrar ibur.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Varpur ro Snonkaku Moab ma Snonkaku Amon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Snar Lot imkak kyain pdef ro Zoar ri, inja ryave bonvepampyan anna kuker inai vyan suya, ma skokenem ro avyav oso. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Inai veba veponya ikofen faro vedar kasun byedi, “Kma kuvanya vye mansar kwar, raimnaido ro sup ine kasiper<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">orovaido supswan ine kasiper.</char></note> snon no sisyava fa nari sfarvuk kuker ku insa kukapar romawano. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Rwama, kufarirem kma kuvanine ra imser, raimnaido kuyenef so i insama kuna romawa.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Rov anya ido, sufarirem kma suvanya kuker anggur, posa inai veba veponya denef us kmari; snar kmari imser mura ifawi royova.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Mun arwoya, inai veba vepon anya ikofen faro vedar kasun vyanya, “Rovanja yenef kuker kamami kwar! Nari rov ido kufarirem i fa imser wer. Ramnai ido wenef us i, na kukame kuna romawa.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Irya rov anya sufarirem Lot i ra imser, posa inai eve suru vyanya denef us i. Snar Lot i imser, ifawi royo va. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Mura Lot inai vyan suya sufadores snar kma suvanya. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Inai vebaya ikapar romawa snon oso ma nyir ive Moab.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Moab: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ryok imnis wos Ibrani isoine “ryamuma ro kamami”.</char></note> Vye up faro kawasa Moab ro fafisu ine. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Inai eve suruya, ikapar romawa snonya, nyir ive Ben-Ami.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ben-Ami: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine rowos Ibraniya isoine: “Romawa eve varpur ro karyer ayesi”, ma rakrok vyedi imnis wos Ibrani “snonkaku Amon”.</char></note> Vye up faro er Amon ro fafisu ine.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Abraham ma Abimelekh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Abraham isasyar bur Mamre ve sup Negeb ro Kanaan var wamiresya ma vyarek ro swaf Kades ma Syur. Insape rya vyarek kako ro Gerar ve mandaman. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Ro mov anya Abraham ikofen be kawasasya vo dove, Sara inido srar vyediri. Mura wairek Abimelekh iwan mamfyan vyeja fa rya dun Sara i fa ive nya ve swa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:13">SaR. 12:13</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 26:7">26:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Rov oso Allah fyasnai mankundi faro wairek Abimelekh ro mafafu ma ikofen, “Nari wamar, snar vin wun aniya; fyarvuk kwar.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Imbape Abimelekh pyan ro Sara i vaim, mura wairek ani ikofen, “<char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char>, yasasar va! Inja nari mun aya ma kawasa ayesineke? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Abraham mankundi monda dove srar kasun vyediri ma vin anya kako dakawos radirya. Ayaine yafrur mnuk anya kuker snewar venapes ma vesren inja yave sasar va.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Muraido Allah kyarem be i ro mafafu radine, “Imbo Yafawi wafrur mnuk anya kuker snewar vesren. Yadwarek au kwar insa wafrur sasar awer ve Aya, inja Yamam monda au fa pan ro vin anya va. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Kur ine veri, kwavri ve swari. Snar swari nabi rirya, ma nari vye nadi kuker au insa wamar awer. Imboi kwavri va ido, waswar epen, au ma kawasa besine kasiper nari mkomar!”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Meser fyas ido, ro arwo baboya, Abimelekh dor faker vyesyakame, ma vye vadir roi vebor myam ro mafafu vyannakame. Sikame simkak fafayava. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Raimnaido Abimelekh dor Abraham i ma ifuken i, “Rosai wafrur kwar faro nkonine? Sasar risaiso yafrur faro auya, evedar fa buk marindi ine faro aya, ma kawasa ayesine? Kaku veri roi wafrur maro aya anine imnis va. <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Wafrur rarirya kukro?” <verse eid="GEN 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Abraham kyarem, “Yakara ro sneri radine, snonkaku vero dinensya simkak Allah i va, inja snonkaku eve snar vin yavuk anyansya nari smun aya fa yamar. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Raimnai, inido srar ayediri. Nuna kam kma oser, imboi sna nuvesya vesisye, inja favye muma ido nuvuk nu. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Fafisu Allah iwan aya fa yabur kamam rumya, yambran ro sup ve sup, yakofen faro vin yavuk anya, ‘Fasnai saswar ma vave syowi bena ve aya, isoine ve vadir faro snonkaku manseirya wer, ayaido srar bedi.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Posa rodiya Abimelekh kyaver Sara i faro Abraham i, ma fafisu anya vyuk manfamyansya kuker domba ma sapi sya kako. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Wairek anya ikofen faro Abraham i, “Ine sup ayedirya kasiper; kwain pdef ro mov risai wamarisenya.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Raimnaido dawos faro Sara i, “Yavuk kwar ve srar bani kumpan sarak syaran oser fa sve avyair faro snonkakusya kam fyasnai vadir wasren ma kaku veri swasarva.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17-18" />Snar Abimelekh dun Sara i, evedar <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ifrur fa vin vebor vero istana vyeja sya kam spasnasem. Posa Abraham vye nadi faro Allah I, ma Allah vyuk pararei faro Abimelekh, swari ma kako infamyan-infamyan vyesya, rarirya var vin ansya nari sikapar wer.<verse eid="GEN 20:17-18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ishak vye veyaven</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />
    <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vye vok Sara i raris rosai Danun kwar. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Fafisu Allah dap soser kwarya imnis, fyor Abraham vye mansar bos kaku, Sara fyadores ma daven romawa snonya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:11">Ibr. 11:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Abraham nyir romawa anya ve Ishak; <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />ma fafis Ishak vye ras ri war ido, Abraham vye sunat i, raris sasoser ro Allah i<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:12">SaR. 17:12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:8">Kis. 7:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Fafis Ishak vye veyaven anya, Abraham ikenem pasibarek usin oser kwar. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Sara ikofen radine, “Allah I frur kwar fa yambrif.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mbrif </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishak ro wos Ibrani ido “imbrif”. </char></note> Snonkaku mundiri vemnaf mnuk ine sikako nari simbrif ma siryav so aya.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Pyam wos vyeja wer ra dine, “Snonkakusya skara vo sove nari yakapar romawayo ve Abraham iva. Imbape inema yakapar vardi kwar ro fafisu snon yavukya vye mansar bos kaku.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Romawa anya isur iba, inja ro ras spaf i bur sus snar vyesya, Abraham ifrur munara papyaf veba kakuya.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hagar ma Ismael suve veyau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Ro ras oso, Sara myam Hagar romawa vye Ismael i ifnak pyum kuker Ishak i va. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Sara myam su raposa ikofen ve Abraham i “Wawan vinfyan aniya fa dun romawa vyediya vo subur. Romawa anya ipok daksmai rarwas ro nana banna nari vekain faro Ishak i.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:29-30">Gal. 4:29-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Abraham imarisen wos Sara vyanna vaveri, snar Ismael ikako romawa vyediri. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Imbape Allah dawos faro Abraham i, “Snembri kyorwanan awer snar vinfyan be Hagar i ma romawa vyani. Waso monda Sara marisen vyedi, snar ro Ishak i monda nari wasmai er vebor veba yanun kwar faro au ani.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:7">Rm. 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:8">Ibr. 11:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Rarirya kako faro Hagar romawa vyedi nari yafrur i fa up vyesya sakve er veba, snar i kako rumkun bedirya.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Meser myas ro arwo primya ido, Abraham vyuk faro Hagar i roveyan ma inoken beser warya fa vyaryam su posa iwan su fa sumbran subur. Mura Hagar imbran vye diwai kuker Ismael i ro maper benir ve Bersyeba. <verse eid="GEN 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Fafis war ken suvaryam ani ivro, Hagar ryir Ismael i fa vyarek ro ai kus na bav na, <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />ma kyain vinkwan bur romawa anya ndokada rof usin oser, iwasen ro sneri radine, “sneri muk ma yasambrav vaveri fa yamampum bo romawa ayeja imar.” Mura ido vin ani kyanes.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fasfas vekwar: romawa iya.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Allah ryower Ismael mkarem vyedi, ma ro nanki yaswa manakya Allah vyedi dawos faro Hagar i, vo dove, “Hagar, rosai evedar snembri vye virvarya? Wamkak awer. Allah Imnaf mkarem romawa banya kwar. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Rwamura mam romawa bannya, wakanow i ma be i fa iknon. Nari Yavuk fa up vyesya sve er veba.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Insape Allah Vyuk fa Hagar myam isnai bos kaku, isof myam war veyer oso. Muraido Hagar rya iser war yaro inoken aiwan kefya, posa vyefa romawa vyanya dinem.<verse eid="GEN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Allah isaramper Ismael i. Romawa anya isur iba; ma vye knam ro maper Paran, ma vye snonkaku vesamnaf eve kir kaku. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Hagar dun vin Mesirya fa vyuk.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fes eren fandu Abraham ma Abimelekh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Ro fafisu anya wairek Abimelekh ma snon mambri vye Pikhol i, surama susrou kuker Abraham i ma sukofen, “Allah ifnovek au ro roi vebor wafur na.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:26">SaR. 26:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Rarirya, fores ro dine ro varpon Allah, snar nari wafrur mnis faro aya, ma kako romawa ayesya, rova kpu ayesi. Imnis yafrur pyum faro au kwar, wafrur rarirya kako faro aya ma kako sup kwaindo ine.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Abraham ikofen, “Imbo yafores!”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Imbape ro varpurya Abraham fyafko Abimelekh i, snar war veyer vyedi manfamyan Abimelekh vyesya sfasyari. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abimelekh ikofen, “Aya ma yakfawi mansei vefrur rariryanyava. Wakofen badir ve aya ro raso vepon va, insape ras ine yakmnaf mnuk ine.” <verse eid="GEN 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Mura Abraham vyuk domba ma sapi ri veso faro Abimelekh i, posa snonkaku ansuya sufes eren. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Abraham irwas domba mkun di fik ro fandu domba vyesya, <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />mura Abimelekh ikmom ma ifuken faro i, “Wafrur rarirya kukro?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Abraham kyarem ve i, “Wun domba mkun ri fik sine mufa insa sve avyair fandu au kuker aya, ma Amber kwarem ve aya, snar war veyer ine aya vevai inya.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Evedar sap mov anya ve Bersyeba,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bersyeba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibrani isoine “War veyer sowar” rovaido “War veyer fik”. </char></note> snar snon ansuya sufrur sowar ro mov anya.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Sufes eren ro Bersyeba ra posa, Abimelekh ma Pikhol sukaver ve sup Filistin. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Abraham kyer aiknam Tamariskaya fa vye swarapepen ro Bersyeba ma ro fafisu anya mov ani nya ive mov isyom faro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char>, vekain fioro. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Raimnaido Abraham vyarek kawan koper ro sup Filistin.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s1">Allah Iwan Abraham i fa Vyuk Ishak fyarsarser</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Fafisu ri veso nande Allah imyouvir Abraham kakyar vyedi. Allah dor Abraham i, “Abraham!” Inja Abraham kyarem, “Ayaisine, <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char>.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:17-19">Ibr. 11:17-19</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Allah dawos ve i, “Rwave sup Moria, wun romawa bonjos bemanmin kaku ani, Ishak i. Ro diwa ro bonpir nari yakur fasnai ve au, wakun romawa banine fa vye farsarser ve Aya.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 3:1">2Taw. 3:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Meser fyas arwo baboya ido, Abraham kyes aivyovek veraren apen vefarsarser anna posa ikanow na fa fyes epen na ro keledaiya bori. Abraham dun Ishak i vo sumbran vinkwan kaku mura ve mov Allah kyur fasnai kwar faro i. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Ro ras eve kyorya ro swaf vevinkwan kaker Abraham myam raro mov ani. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Inja ikofen faro Manfamyan vyansuya, “Muwaf ro dine kuker keledai anine. Aya kuker romawa ine nura vediwara fa nufarsaser ve <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I, ra posa, nari nukaver muma wer.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Abraham vye aivyovek anna fa Ishak vyarna, imboi mankundi dun inoiya ma anum vefrur forya. Fafisu sumbran anya, <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Ishak ifuken, “Kamam!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Abraham kyarem faro Ishak i, “Rosai befandun i?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Ishak ifuken wer, “Kuyun apyame, aivyovek vape domba mkun kufarserya ryoiso?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Abraham kyarem, “Allah mankundi nari vefasos domba mkunyani.” Romura sumbran pdef.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Fafisu sumbran ra ro mov Allah Ikofen vadir faro Abraham i anya, insape vyaus apen farsarserya ma ryir ai vyovek anna ro bo. Posa fyes epen romawa vyanya ma ryir i fa vyarek ro apen farsarser anya bori ro aivyovek na bo. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Posa ido dun inoiya fa ive vyuk iwan bos romawa ani.<figure style="fig" file="LB00291C.TIF" size="col" ref="22:10">Abraham imbe iwanbos Ishak i fa vye farsarser</figure> <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Vape manakya <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vyedi dor ro nanki faro i, “Abraham, Abraham!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Abraham kyarem, “Ayaisine, Manseren!”<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Manakya <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vyani dawos wer ve Abraham i, “Mun awer romawa iya orovaido be i ra movo nawer.” “Snar Yafawi kaku be syowi ma wamkak faro Aya, evewar rwir kapaper romawa bonjos banya faro Aya.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Insape Abraham myam ve vandivar ido domba snomanya knapur vero vukoryansya ssawer ro papusna. Abraham dun domba anya fa vyuki farsarser faro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I fa fyadwer romawa vyanya.<figure style="fig" file="BK00008C.TIF" size="col" ref="22:13">Domba snoman</figure> <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Abraham nyir mov anya ve “<char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> fyasos roi eve fandun na.” Ma isof ro kurine snonkaku sikofen radine “Ro bon anya bori <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> fyasos roi eve fandun na.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fyasos ro wos Ibrani ido myame.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Rarwan eve suruya manakya <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vyani dor ro nanki faro Abraham i, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />“<char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> ikofen: Yafores kuker Snonsnon Ayedi, snar waso user Aya ma rwir vararwi romawa bonjos banya ve Aya, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />inja nari Yave vok au kuker nana ma Yavuk kpu besya fa sibor simnis mak vero farsyos ma yen morem bero swan andir. Romawa kpu besya nari simerkar mbrov sesi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:12">Ibr. 11:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />Er vebor ro supswan nari sfararyor ve Aya insa Yave vok si raris mov Yave vok kpu besya raya -- snar waso user sasoser Ayena.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:25">Kis. 3:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Raposa Abraham kyaver ve manfamyan vyan suya, insape skora ve Bersyeba; Abraham kyain ma nya mnu ro diya.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nahor up Vyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Abraham naek vyeja snori Nahor i. Fafisu ri veso nande, Abraham ryower, Nahor swar Milka i nya romawa snon di war kwar, sisoine: <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Us, romawa rakya; Bus, bedar kasunya; Kemuel, ro varpurya eve sinan be Aram; <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Kesed, Haso, Pildas, Yidlaf, ma Betuel, <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />ro varpurya eve sinan kma ve Ribka i. Irya romawa ri war Milka ikapar ve Nahor, Abraham vedar vyani. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Nahor vye kya vinya venirve Reuma, vin anya dakkapar Tebah, Gaham, Tahas, ma Maakha.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s1">Sara imar ma seraki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Ras kenem Sara vyedi pasivarek usin oser samfur di suru seser di fik, <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />insape imar ro Hebron ro sup Kanaan. Abraham myandak ma fyarswar marmar swar vyani.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Raposa Abraham iyor ibur swa vye vemar kwar ani ma ryave kawasa Het vekaindo sup ani. Ma ikofen ve si, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />“Ayainema mandaman vekenem ro fandu naek ma srar mko, inja mko marisen ido yakoves saprop mnuko fa samaido yakrir swa ayanya ro.” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:16">Kis. 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:9">Ibr. 11:9</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 13">13</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Kawasa ansi skarem, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Nkosom au ve amber mananwir vesambrav ro fandu er ine, inja wakrir swambri ro rus nkovena mindisa vepyum syadi. Nkoinekam nkomarisen nkofasos ruso faro swa bani”<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Abraham kyunem ro varpon sena, <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />ma ikofen, “Naek ayena mko, mkove yakrir swa ayanya ro dine ido, mkawos pyan ve Efron, Zohar romawa vyani, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />insa vyov ve aya avyav Makhpela vero ris yaf vyedi. Ipyum syadi vyov saprop anya ro dine, insama naek anmkoya mkofawi kame. Vavyakya na yavak sararir i insama saprop anya yana i.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Fafisu anya Efron isya kyain kuker kawasa Het sya ro mov farsaso ro kedwai veba ro kota ani. Insape snonkaku vebor ansyakam smam epen, Efron kyarem ve Abraham i, <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />“Er ayedi smamepen, saprop ine ma avyav vyeja yavuki ve amber au insa wakrir swambri ro diya.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Mura Abraham kyunem ro varpon kawasa Het ansya, <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />ma kawasa vebor ansya kam srower dawos yov Efron i radine, “Yor fa wamnaf ve aya. Yaswaruser fa ave yakoves saprop anya kasiper. Inja kwarem fararyor ayedine, insa yakrir swa ayanya ro mov ani.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Efron kyarem ve i, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Saprop mnuk eve kumpan sarak usin di fyak vye maeja mankenem ve ku va? Wakrir swambri ro mov anya kwar.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Abraham imarisen apap anya. Kyor barbor kumpan sarak Efron dap ansya, sarak utin di fyak, kumpan sarak sine marvakvakya simnis karkor snonkaku vefarvavyan ro fafisuya. Posa Abraham vyak faro Efron, ro varpon mamam kawasa Het ansya.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Irya yaf Efron vyedi vero Makhpela ro var wamurem Mamre, Abraham nya vardi i. Saprop anya fnovek yaf ma avyav ma kako aiknam bero diyanna ma aiknam beyores ro was vyena. <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />Saprop anya kawasa Het veyakrama ro sarawrow vero kedwai veba kota anya sya sifawi kam Abraham saprop vyediri.<verse eid="GEN 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Posa rodiya Abraham ikrir swar Sara i ro avyav Makhpela ro sup Kanaan. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Irya saprop ma avyav anya kawasa Het ansya svuki faro Abraham fa nya i ve saprop rus karamram.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s1">Ribka vyevefuken faro Ishak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Abraham vye mansar bos kaku, ma <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vye vok i ro roi vebor kam. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Ras oso Abraham dawos faro manfamyan randak ikyar kaku, vemamwarek ma vefaduru nana vebor vyenakam, “Rwir vramin besuya ro weswaf ayesuine.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ine irya rari vero fafisuya, ma sowar anine na sipok sande iva.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />Fores ve aya, kuker snonsnon <char style="nd">Manseren Allah, </char> veve knam papoikya ro nanki ma sup swan ine, nari wapok sweref vino ve romawa ayedi Ishak i ro fandu snonkaku Kanaan sineva. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Imboi kwaver ve sup marin ayedi ma swewar vino ro fandu kawasa ayesi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Mura Manfamyan ani ifuken yov Abraham i, “Rariso, inai inkbor anya imewer iso aya ve dine ido? Nari yun romawa sinan banine ve sup marin baniwa ke?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Abraham kyarem, “Waswarepen kaku! Wapok wun romawa ayanine mura vaveri!” <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" /><char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char>, Allah veveknam papoik ro nanki, Dun aya kwar fa yasasyar bur rum kamam vyedi ma sup naek srar ayesi, ma Fyores ve aya kwar fa nari Vyuk sup ine faro up ayesi. Inja nari iwan manakya Vyesi fa sifnovek au, insa wasmai vino ro diwa ve romawa ayedi. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Imboi inai inkbor anya imewer iso au ido, sowar ine inyanem au va. Rariryano wapok wun romawa ayanine mura va. <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Romura manfamyan ani ryir vramin vyesu ro Abraham weswaf vyesuya ma fyores fa nari ifrur raris Abraham wawos vyena faro i.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Mamfamyan ani dun unta samfur warpu arasai vefarawriwek. Imbran ve kota mov ras nawara Nahor ikenem ro, kota anine ryo var wambrur Padan-Aram. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Ryaro mov anya kwar ido, vye unta ansyafa simnaisu fanam war veyer ro kotaya vandiri. Mandira kwar, irya fafisu var vin sya srama ro war veyer anya fa spos ware. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Mura manfyan ani vyenadi, “<char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char>, Allah amber ayedi Abraham, wafnovek aya, insa fararur ayedine imawes ro ras ine, Fasnai syowi saswar Bena faro amber ayedi Abraham i. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Mam mufres, yores ro ris war veyer ine. Kero nari inai vinkbor vero kota ine srama spos ware. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Nari yawos faro vinkbor ansya oso radine, ‘Wafnovek aya, wasabu rosaser veyun war bediya ma buk warkeno ma yinem,’ Rao kyarem vo dove, ‘Winem mura kwar ma unta kamam besineno, nari yavuk kako vesi fa sakinem’ irya vin <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> kwinfir faro manfamyan bedi Ishak. Ryadirya kaku ido, irya yafawi kaku <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> fasnai frur pyum Bedi faro amber ayedi Abraham.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15-16" />Fafisu vye nadi anya, Ribka, inai vinkbor bepduk kaku ma snono ikyaren i vaim, ryama ro war veyer anya, dun rosaser veser warya ro erdai vyedi. Betuel inai vyediri, ma Betuel sinan vyesuiso Nahor ma Milka; Nahor inido Abraham vedar vyedirya. Ribka imbran yov war veyer anya, ma iser rosaser vyani, ma imbran kaver. <verse eid="GEN 24:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Abraham manfamyan vyanya ifrar fa fyanam i, ma ikofen faro i, “Insos wafnovek aya, buk fa yinem ro rosaser wun iya.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Vinkbor anya kyarem, “Kamam, Winem,” posa inai anya isabu rosaser dun anya ma ikif epen vo manfamyan anya dinem. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Manfamyan anya dinem ra posa; vinkbor anya dawos faro i, “Nari yapos war no ve kamam unta-unta bansine kako, insa rofanfan ansiya sakinem ra sisyopen kaku.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Raimnaido fasaudam monda war vero rosaser anya isbaweri ro rosaser beser war unta ansya sinem roya, ramnai ifrar kaver wer ve war veyer anya fa pyos war nara nabor syadi wer isof rofanfan ansya sinem rawo sisyopen kaku. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Fafisuya manfamyan Abraham vyanya dawos wos kermkunno vaveri imbo myampum monda. Manfamyan anya ive ifawi kaku <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> vyuk fa fararur vyeja imbran pyum ke orova.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Unta ansya sinem war anna ra sisyopen kaku, insape manfamyan Abraham vyanya dun afyamankor brawen vekakur kaku, ma syawersi ro vinkbor anya snonisi. Ma ro vrado vyeja pyanai sarak brawen ri suru. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Posa manfamyan anya ikofen, “Indo wakofen vadir kmam snoriso. Mov anenefo isya ro rum byeja fa aya kuker snonkaku ayesine na nko veryar ro?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Vinkbor anya kyarem faro i, “Kamam snori Betuel i, Nahor ma Milka romawa suvediri.” <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />“Ro rum inkoveja mov anenef naisya ve kamam au ma kako avris ma rovean rofanfan.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Mura manfamyan anya vyan suba ve <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I. <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />Ma ikofen, “Sanandik ve <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char>, Allah amber ayedi Abraham. <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> ve asuser ma wapyum fafayava faro amber ayedi Abraham i. Vefarkin pdef aya ve rum naek karyer vyesi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Posa inai vinkbor anya ifrar ve rum ma ikofen vadir ve snari ma fyawar rosai isrow kwar anna. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29-30" />Ribka srar vyedi snori Laban i. Ryower fawar Ribka vyanya vekur manfamyan anya roi dawosna. Myam kako roi vefamankor ro snonisi ma samfar vero vrado srar vyani. Mura Laban syae fa ifrar ra isrow kuker manfamyan Abraham vyanya snar isya dores kaker kuker unta ansya fanam war veyer anya. <verse eid="GEN 24:29-30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Laban ikofen, “Kamam au snonkaku vesmai vok ro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I. Wores ro vandi awer. Rwama kora ve rum. Nkofasos simya kwar ve kamam au ma kako mov nanan faro unta-unta kamam bansine.”<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Posa manfamyan anya iso ma syun be rumya do. Laban isabu roi vebor unta ansya sun na, ma fyansi kuker avris ma rovean. Raimnaido dun war na fa Abraham manfamyan vyansya ma snonkaku veso insya svuki vyan wemin sena. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Fafisu rovean na nfasos kwar, manfamyan anya ikofen, “Yapok yananva, vepon ro yavadir ananun yun na vaim.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Mura Laban ikofen, “Indo wawos mura.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Insape Abraham manfamyan vyani ikofen, “Ayaine Abraham manfamyan vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" /><char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vye vok kaku amber ayedi ma vyuk ve i nana vebor kaku. <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vyuk kwar faro i domba, kambing, sapi, unta, keledai, ma kako sarak, brawen, warpu manfamyan ma infamyan. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Ro ras kenem mun vave vinsarya, amber ayedi swa vye Sara, daven rumkun snon oso, ma amber ayani ryovor nana vebor vyannakam faro romawa vyani. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Iwan fa yave syasi kuker fafores insa yuf nako sasoser vyena. Ikofen ra dine, ‘Wapok sweref vino ro fandu kankain sup Kanaan ine fa romawa ayani vyuk va, <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />imboi sweref vino ro fandu naek-srar kamam vyesi. Inja rwamura fasaw veri.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Mura yafuken faro I vo yove, ‘Imbo nari inai inkbor anya imewer iso ayanido, na rariso?’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Muraido kyarem, ‘<char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> yaso asuser vesyakwar anya nari Iwan manakya Vyedi fa ifnovek au insa sasewar bedi vye fromova. Nari wasrow vino ve romawa ayedi ro fandu kawasa ayesi, isoine naek srar kamam vyesi. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Wasmai kurpum ido, insape sowar anine inyanem au va.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />Ma fafis ayaisya ro war veyer ani risya, yanadi ro sneri do vo yove, ‘<char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char>, amber ayedi Abraham Allah vyedi Au, ivyekada <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> buk fa sasewar ayedine imawes. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Nari yores pdef ro war veyer ine risya, rawo inai inkboro ryama dun ware, ma nari yor yov i insa vyuk war keno ma yinem. <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />Inja inai inkbor ani ifrur radirya ma vyuk aninem kako faro unta ayesine ido, inai inkbor <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> kyinfir fa nari amber ayedi Abraham romawa vyani nya ve swaya irya.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Kur anya nadi famyun ro sneri do imnai vaim, Ribka ikamar rosaserya ro erdaiya ma ryama pyos ware ro war veyer ani. Mura yawos yov i, ‘Wafnovek aya fa buk war keno ma yinem.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Fasaudam monda ryir rosaser anya vo ikofen, ‘Winem mura kwar, ma unta bansine kako nari yun war no fa sakinem.’ Rarirya yinem ma unta ayansya kako vye fa sakinem. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Posa ido yafuken i, ‘Kmami nido mansei rya?’ Kyarem bo dove, ‘Kamami inido Betuel i, Nahor ma Milka romawa suvediri.’ Mura yun afyamankor brawen sya fa yasawer ro snonisi ma yapanai samfar suya ro vrado vyesuya. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Yavan suba ma yasyom yasandik <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char>, Abraham Allah vyedi. I vefarkin aya kwar ma ro dine, faro amber ayani kawasa vyesi isof yasmai inai vinkbor ine faro romawa vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Inja fafis ine mkove syowi amber ayanya snar karyer mkovedirya ma mko ve imnis fandun vyeja ido, mkawos woso ve aya, mkomarisen orova vo mkomewer ido mkokofen isnai. Insa yafawi rosai ive yafrurya.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Laban ma Betuel sukarem, “Snar mnuk ine ryama ro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I, inja nkopok nkawos yaye va. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Ribka isine; ivye iso sinan au mura kwar insa vye swa faro amber bani romawa vyedi; raris <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> mankundi dawos kwar.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Fafisu Abraham manfamyan vyanya ryower wawos sena, mura kyunem vyan suba ve <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Ramnai ido isasyar sansun, famankor sarak ma brawen, ma vyuknakam faro Ribka i. Vyuk roi vekakur na ve srar vyeja ma snari kako.<verse eid="GEN 24:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Posa rodiya, manfamyan Abraham vyanya ma snonkaku veso i ansya sanan sinem raimnaido senef ro diya. Arwo baboya, Abraham manfamyan vyanya ikofen, “Yor syowi ro mko vo mkorir fa yabur kaver ve amber ayani.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Imbape Ribka srar vyeja ma snari sukofen, “Ivye kada Ribka vyarek us inko ras samfur wer resari, posa ido insape rya mufa.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Manfamyan anya kyarem faro sko, “Mkokarwarek awer aya. <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char>, ifrur fa maran ayedi ne imyone; mkorir fa yabur fasaw ve amber ayani.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Skawos faro i, “Rarirya ido kor Ribka i ma kofuken i.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Posa skor Ribka i ma skofuken i, “Wamarisen waso snonkaku ine?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Mura Ribka kyarem, “Imbo yamarisen.”<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59-60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59-60" />Rarirya skomarisen fa Ribka iso ma kako infamyan vefaduru i ro fafisu vye kapira, skoso manfamyan Abraham vyanya kuker snonkaku veso insya. Insape skove vok Ribka i kuker wos nane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:59-60">“Ribka, ivyekada nari wakapar ra kpu besya sve syaran-syaran!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:59-60">Ivyekada kpu besya na simerkar kota-kota mbrov sesya sena!”<verse eid="GEN 24:59-60" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Mura Ribka syanson kuker vinkbor veyuf farmyan insya, insape skek unta ma skora skoso Abraham manfamyan vyani.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Fafisu anya kako Ishak ryaker<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fasfas bekwar kaku na: ryamuma ve.</char></note> sup ve ursva, dunuk ro war veyer sor ve Lahai-Roi ma syoyai ro Kanaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kanaan isya ro sup Negeb var wamiresya.</char></note> var wamiresya. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Fafisu orya iwai murvav Ishak isasyar fa imbran ro maper, myam ido unta sya simbran muma. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Fafisu Ribka myam Ishak i, mura isabu ro unta dekya, <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />ma ifuken ve Abraham manfamyan vyani, dove, “Snon vembran ro maper iyama nido manseiri?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Manfamyan ani kyarem ve i, “Amber ayedi irya.” Mura Ribka dun kruben kerya fa vyuki dwarek varpon vyedi.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Insape manfamyan ani fyawar ve Ishak i roi vebor ifrur kwar anna. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Posa rodiya Ishak dun Ribka i fa susun ro soyai snar Sara vyani, ma fyarvuk kuker Ribka i. Ishak iswar vye syowi Ribka i; mura sneri iprei snar iswar kaker sna vyedi vemar buri kwar ani.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s1">Abraham up vyesi ro swa vye Ketura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Abraham vyuk vin oso-wer snoriso Ketura. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Swa vyanine ikapar romawasya ve i siso ine: Simran, Yoksan, Medan, Midian, Isyibak, ma Suah. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yoksan dakkapar Syeba i ma Dedan ma kpu Dedan vyesiso kawasa Asyur, kawasa Lethus, ma kawasa Leum ansi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Romawa Midian vyesiso ine Efa, Efer, Henokh, Abida, ma Eldaa. Sine kam Ketura kpu vye si rya.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Abraham vyuk nana vyena kam faro Ishak i, <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Fafisu ivye kaker kya vyesi romawa se si kako saksmai rarwas. Insape iwan si fa sibur ve sup Kanaan var wamuremya, insamaido svinkwan bur romawa vye Ishak i.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abraham imar ma sikriri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7-8" />Abraham imar ro fafis ras kenem vyedi vye pasibarek usin oser samfur di fik seser di rim. <verse eid="GEN 25:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Romawa vyansuya isoine Ishak ma Ismael sukrir i ro avyav Makhpela vero var wamurem Mamre. Kur iwara saprop mnuk Efron, rumkun Sohar, up Het vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Imboi Abraham kyoves i kwar fa sikrir insar swar Sara i ro.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">SaR. 23:3-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Posa ro Abraham marmar vyedi, Allah vye vok romawa vyedi Ishak. Fafis anya Ishak vyarek fanam be war veyer, “Lahai-Roi” sap kako ve, “I vefaduru Aya.”<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ismael up vyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Ismael inido Abraham ma Hagar vin Mesir anya romawa suvediri, Hagar inido Sara infyan vyedirya. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13-16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13-16" />Ismael ismai romawa samfur seser disuru se-veyap raris vave mambekanaek sedi, sisoine: Nebayot, Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsan, Misyma, Duma, Masa, Hadad, Tema, Yetur, Nafis ma Kedma. Romawa sine siso eve up faro er veba samfur seser disuru, rarirya mnu, ma soyai sena sap na raris snonsnon sena. <verse eid="GEN 25:13-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Ras kenem Ismael vyena ne pasibarek usin oser samfur dikyor seser difik insape imar. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />kpu vyesya svarek ro fandu Hawila ma Syur ro var wamurem vekar ve Asyur. Sikenem vese bur kpu min vese Abraham vyesi.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau ma Yakub suve veyaven</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Ine kada fawar vevadir Ishak, Abraham romawa vyani. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Ishak ikenem pasivarek samfur di fyak fafisu fyarvuk kuker Ribka, Laban srar kasun vyedi, Betuel romawa vyanya, snonkaku Aram veraker Padan-Aram.<verse eid="GEN 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Ishak vyenadi dor faro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> I, snar swar Ribka nya romawa va. Rarirya<char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> imnaf Ishak nadi vyedi, inja Ribka fyadores. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Ribka fyadores romawa vesaper, ma vepon ro romawa ansuya daven su vaim, romawa ansuya sufanfavri ro kaparya dori. Ribka ikofen, “Rosai vefnaifa yave radinenya?” Posa dor fasasnai ro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />
    <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> dawos faro Ribka i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">“Er di suru suisya ro kapar bedi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">nari waven er ri suru eve mrov yaye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">veknikya syambrav syadi vedar ebaya ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">vedar ebaya nari vye manfyan faro kasunya.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Fafisuya imnis kwar fa Ribka ive daven romawa, inja Ribka daven romawa snon vesaper ri suru. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Romawa rakya syamyar, ma kif vyeja imnis syatu eve bur-bur. Ryani romawa anya nyir ve Esau.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine skara vo sove kyur yov Seir, isoine sup fyor ras varpurya ido Esau up vyesi sikenem ro; Seir rakrok vyedi ro wos Ibrani isoine “eve bur”.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Fafisu Ribka daven romawa eve suruya, vramin vyeja iser epen Esau wekuver vyedi. Inja nyir ive Yakub.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yakub: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine raris wos Ibrani isoine “wekuver”.</char></note> Ishak ras kenem vyeja pasivarek samfur di wonem ro fafisu romawa ansuya suve veyaven.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau vyov nasan romawa rak vyedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Romawa ansuya susur suba. Esau vye mansamnaf veve kir kaku ma imarisen ikenem ro maper, imboi Yakub iknon ma imarisen syadi kyain ro rum. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Ishak iswar syadi Esau i, snar Ishak imarisen dan aiwan kraf Esau myun sya. Imboi Ribka i iswar syadi faro Yakub i.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Ras oso fafisu Yakub ifnav avrui verik sya, fyoro va ido Esau syamnaf ra ibur. Ibiser bos kaku. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Ikofen faro Yakub i, “Yabiser kaku. Yor avrui verik siya kermkun no.” Efnai vedar fa Esau sor i ve Edom.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Edom: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya isoine “verik”.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yakub kyarem ve i “Ipyum, imboi buk nasan romawa rak banya ve aya.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Esau ikofen, “Fanduno ro nasan romawa rakya ve ayava. Ine yabiser bos kaku!”<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Yakub ikofen wer, “Fores vepon ve aya, na buk nasan romawa rak banya ve aya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:33">Esau fyores ma vyuk nasan vyanya faro Yakub i.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:16">Ibr. 12:16</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Posa ro diya Yakub vyuk mamami ma avrui verik ansi. Esau dan ma dinem ra posa rya ibur. Rarirya Esau kyor wef nasan vave romawa rak vyedi.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Ishak Vyarek ro Gerar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Fafisu Ishak isya syoyai kaker fanam war veyer Lahai-Roi, basbiser vebaya myun ro sup anya imnis raris basbiser veba vemun ro fafisu Abraham ikenem kaker aniwara. Inja Ishak ryave Gerar, ve Abimelekh, wairek Filistin, ma dor fa kyain ve mandaman ro diya. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Inja <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> fyasnai Mankundi faro i ma Ikofen, “Rwa ve Mesir awer; barek monda kwar ro sup nari Yakur fasnai faro au. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Barek ro sup ine kwar ve mandaman, rarirya nari Yakadaun ma Yave vok au. Sup mnuk ine kasiper nari Yavuki ve au ma kpu besya. Nari Yave imnis sowar Yavuk kwar faro Abraham kma bani. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Nari Yavuk fa kpu besya sibor simnis mak vero nank iyaswa, ma sup mnuk ine kasiper nari Yavuki faro si. Er vebor vero supswan ine sya nari sor ve Aya insa Yave vok si raris mov Yave vok kpu besya raya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-18">SaR. 22:16-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Nari Yave vok au, snar Abraham iso asuser ma fyaduru sasoser ma parensa Ayena.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Inja Ishak vyarek ro Gerar. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Fafisu snonkaku vero diyansya sifuken ve i vo sove Ribka inido, Ishak kyarem ve si vo dove Ribka inido srar vyediri, imboi swa vyedisyava. Ishak imkak warek snonkaku ansya smun i vo sun Ribka indi, snar ipyum fafayava.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:13">SaR. 12:13</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 20:2">20:2</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Ishak vyarek ro mov anya ra fafisu ri veso nawas ido, ras oso wairek Abimelekh ikirwai ro varareya, ma myam Ishak isya ryafnak kuker Ribka i. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Mura dor Ishak i ma ikofen ve i, “Vin aniya swa bedirya ke? Rosai evedar wove srar bedirya ni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Ishak kyarem be i vo dove, “Yakara vo yove na mkomun aya snar yakofen vo yove swa ayediri.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Imbape Abimelekh ikofen ve i, “Rosai evedar wafrur ra dine yov inko? Snon oso ro kawasa ayesine nari denef kuker swambri ido, auso nari vekamar sasar nkofrur ineni.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Insape Abimelekh vyuk sasoser faro kawasa vyesi radine, “Mansei vefrur mnisva yov snonkaku ine rova swari, nari vye vemun ra imar.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Ishak ifrur yaf ro saprop kyain ro anya, ma ro pasivarek anya ismai kraf ro yaf vyanna apaper rarwan usin oser, snar <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> vye vok i. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Nana vyena nfanfanfon isof nyana fafayava. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Snonkaku Filistin sya sisnesna namarisen i va snar nya manfamyan, domba ma sapi sibor kaku. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Mura skuvepen war veyer vebor manfamyan Abraham vyesi svai ro fafisu Abraham ikenem kaker iwara.<verse eid="GEN 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Mura Abimelekh ikofen ve Ishak i, “Rwa wabur sup inkovedi. Snar fafis ine wasmai papoik veba syadi ro inko.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Inja Ishak isasyar ibur ma syoyai ro dwas Gerar. Fafisu ri fumo vyarek ro diya. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Insape vyai kaver war veyer svai kwar ro fafisu Abraham i ma kawasa Filistin sya skuv epen kuker saprop anna. Vyuk snonsnon ro war veyer anna raris snonsnon kmar Abraham vyuk vepon kwar anna.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Manfamyan Ishak vyesya ser war veyer ro dwas Gerar ma sisrow war nabor kaku. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Imbape manfarandous ro Gerar sfanvavri kuker manfarandous Ishak vyesya. Sawos vo sove, “war ine war nkovedirya.” Mura ido, Ishak nyir war anya ve war “sfanvavri.”<verse eid="GEN 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Manfamyan Ishak vyansya ser war veyer oso wer, imbape sfanvavri kuker war veyer anya wer. Rarirya Ishak nyir war anya ve “mbrov yaye.” <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Ramnai ido, Ishak ibur mov anya ma vyai war veyer veve kyorya. Fafisu anya mbrovo wer va. Rarirya Ishak nyir war anya ve “Rehobot” Isoine “Vave mkei.” Ikofen, “Kur ine <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vyuk ve ko fa kokain ro saprop ine, ma na kokenem kuker aski ma payamyum ro dine.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Posa Ishak isasyar ma rya ro Bersyeba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Ro mun rovya <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> fyasnai mankundi faro Ishak ma ikofen, “Ayaine kmam Abraham Allah vyedi. Wamkak awer, Yafaduru au, nari Yave vok au ma Yavuk ve au kpu sibor kaku snar fes eren Ayedi faro manfamyan ayedi Abraham i.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Ishak vyaus apen farsarser fa vyuki syom <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I ro mov ani. Ishak vye ryar ro diya ma manfamyan vyan sya ser war veyer ono wer.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fes eren fandu Ishak ma Abimelekh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Ras oso Abimelekh ryaker Gerar, kuker Ahusat, man wawos vyedi, ma Pikhol mambri ro snon mamun vyesi, fa sisrou kuker Ishak i.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:22">SaR. 21:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Mura Ishak ifuken, “Rosai evedar fafis ine mkorama mkosrou kuker ayanya? Fafisu aniyafa mkove mbrov ma mkoyau aya bur sup mkovani?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Inja skokarem, “Kur ine nkofawi kaku <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> fyadiren au inja nkokara fa ipyum syadi kofes eren. Fores ve inko <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />nari wafrur roi vevyeva yov inkova, rarirya kako nko kako nari nkofrur roi vevyeva faro auva. Rari inkovena napyum yov au inja nkorir fa wabur kuker aski. Inja nkofawi kaku <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vye vok au.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Insape Ishak fyasos anan ma aninem na fa vyuki fyansi. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Meser ndamyasi mun arwoya ido sfes eren kuker sowar. Snar sve manivov kwar, mura Ishak ikofen marandan vevye ve si ma sibur vesisye.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Ro ras anya kako manfamyan Ishak vyansi srama sikofen vadir ve i war veyer skovai kwar anya. Skove, “nkosmai warya kwar.” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Mura Ishak nyir war veyer anya ve “Syeba.” Irya randak kaku kota anya snir ive Bersyeba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya ido “war veyer sowar,” war veyer fafores, rovaido “war veyer veve fik” komam 21:31. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau swa vyesya ro er vese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Fafisu Esau ras kenem vyedi vye pasivarek samfur di fyak, fyarvuk kuker vinkbor ri suru ro er Het, susoine Beri inai vye Yudit i ma Elon inai vye Basmat i. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Vin ansuine sufrur sne fafardun kaku Ishak ma Ribka su.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Ishak vye vok Yakub i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Ro ras oso, fafisu Ishak vye mansar ma mkasi pyampan, inja myam werva, mura dor romawa rak vye Esau i, ma ikofen be i, “Romawa yedi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">Esau kyarem be kmari, “Ayaisine, kamam.”<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Ishak ikofen, “Wafawi yave mansar kwar ma nari yakenem kawan werva. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Inja wun maryai ma ikoi bansya, rwa swamnaf sewar aiwano ro sup marires. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Wakuni fa imafen kaku raris marisen ayedi, raimnaido wun muma ve aya. Insa yanna ra posa, nari yave vok au, vepon ro yamar vaim.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Rofior Ishak ikofen faro Esau i anya, Ribka ryower. Muraido fafisu Esau ryakwar fa syamnaf ido, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Ribka ikofen faro Yakub i, “Insanja yarower kmam ikofen faro Esau i radine, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />‘Swamnaf aiwano ma wakuni fa imafen kaku insape wuni ma yan. Fafisu yan ra yamnai, nari yavuk vok ve au ro varpon <char style="nd">Manseren</char> i, fafis yamar vaim.’” <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Ribka ikofen wer, “Inja, romawa yedi rwower ma wafrur roi yakofen nane. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Rwa fanfir kambing kuv babo ri suruyo ro rofanfan kovansi, raimnai wun ma insa yakun rovean vemafen kmam indo imarisen dan anna. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Posa ido wun faro i, insama dan na ra posa ido vyevok au, fafisu imar vaim.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Imbape Yakub ikofen be snari, “Awine, Esau baken vyedi vye bur-bur, imboi ayama baken ayedi dakve bur va. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Imbude kamam pyan baken ayedine mura ifawi yankar indi; nari vyuk vok va imboi vyuk fras ve aya.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Snar kyarem ve i, “Romawa ayedi, be virvar awer, fras vebor nane ivye kada nanyanem aya monda. Wafrur monda rosai yakofen nane, rwamura wun kambing ansuya muma.” <verse eid="GEN 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Muraido Yakub rya dun kambing kuv babo ansuya faro snari. Insape Ribka ikun su raris Ishak marisen vyena. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Raimnai Ribka dun Esau sansun vepduk kaku vyedi ikram ro rumya fa Yakub syansun. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Dun kambing kif sya fa sidwarek Yakub vramin vyesuya ma sasukor vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Insape vyuk manfnai ma mamami fyasos kwar anna faro Yakub i.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Ra posa Yakub dun na faro kmari ma ikofen, “Kamam!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Ishak kyarem, “Ayaisine,” “au ido, Esau ke Yakub?”<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yakub kyarem, “Ayaine Esau, romawa rak bani; kamam roi wakofen be aya anna yafrur na kwar, wakvok ma kwain, wan manfnai yamun ma yun kwar nane, insama kamam be vok aya.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Ishak ikofen. “Romawa ayedi waspak fafayava fa wun manfnai sine.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Yakub kyarem, “Snar <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> kamam wasyom ani vefnovek ayani.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Mura Ishak ikofen faro Yakub i, “Rwama wasnefer insama yapanbir au. Kaku Esau aurya?” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Yakub isnefer kmari, mura kmar pyanbir vrado vyesuya ma ikofen, “Mkarem beja imnis mkarem Yakub, imboi vrado besuya suve bur imnis Esau i.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Ishak ifawi mnis Yakub iva, snar vradoya vye bur-bur imnis raris Esau vradoya. Fafisu Ishak imbe vye vok Yakub i anya, <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />ifuken nanaps kaku wer. “Kaku Esau aurya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">“Kaku,” Yakub kyarem faro kmari.<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Posa Ishak ikofen, “Buk manfnai kraf siya muma. Yan ra posa ido nari yave vok au.” Yakub vyuk manfnai kraf ansya faro kmari, ma kako anggur ken sya fa dinem. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Posa kmari ikofen faro i, “Rwama wasnefer kaku ma wasyum aya.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Fafisu Yakub isnefer kmari fa isyumi nanya, Ishak nyas vavir diref sansun Esau vyena, mura vyuk vok faro i. Ishak ikofen, “Diref vepyum romawa ayedi isnarem raris diref vero maper, vesmai kwar vok ro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> I.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:27-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Ibr. 11:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Ivye kada Allah vyuk faro au wawur vepnunek ro nanki ma Vye vok yaf bena fa nasur pyum! Ivye kada Vyuk faro au pokem ma anggur vesararir. <verse eid="GEN 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Er vebor nakam ne manfyan ve au, ma siraryof au. Inari au vesmai nasan veba ro fandu naek besyakam, ma kpu vero snami sya kam skunem ro varpon bedi. Inari frasya isya faro snonkaku vefras au sya, ma vokya isya faro eve vok au sya.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">SaR. 12:3</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau dor insa Ishak vye Vok i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Ishak vye vok Yakub i ra posa Yakub ibur, Yakub eba vye Esau i ikako ibur ro samnaf vyena. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Esau i kako ikun rovean vemafen na raimnaido dun na faro kmari. Ikofen, “Kamam, kwain ma wan manfnai kraf yun be kamam au nane, insa kamam be vok aya.”<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Ishak ifuken, “Au ido?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Esau kyarem, “Aya Esau, kamam romawa rak bani.”<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Kur anya veri Ishak baken vyeja kam ryadadai, raimnaido Ishak ifuken wer, “Rarirya ido mansei insanja vemun manfnai vo veyun ma ve ayanya? Fafisu rwama vaim, yanan kwar. Ramnai yavuk vok vepupes ayeja faro i kwar, ma kurine vok anya vye knam faro i, ro fyoro ve fyoro.”<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Rofyor Esau imnaf kmar ikofen radirya mura kyanes naba kaku, kuker fafafko, posa ikofen, “Kamam, Wakve vok aya kako!”<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Ishak ikofen, “Veknik banya ryama dankar aya vo dun vok ive yavuk ve au anya.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Esau ikofen wer, “Ine rarwan eve suru dankar aya. Ebedar nyir ve Yakub.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yakub: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ryok imnis wos ibrani isoine “ankar”.</char></note> Dun vepon nasan romawa rakya bur aya kwar, ramnai dun vok ayeja wer. Kamam wasmai vok no vese wer ve aya va ke?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">SaR. 25:29-34</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Ishak kyarem, “Yave i fa vye konor ve au, ma naek vyesya kam yave si fa sve manfamyan be i. Yavuk faro i pokem ma anggur. Fafisu ine roino naisya wer fa yavuk ve au va romawa yedi!”<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Esau dor vesyakwar faro kmari, “Kamam wasmai vok oser monda? Kamam ve vok aya kako!” Insape kyanes naba syadi wer.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:17">Ibr. 12:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Muraido Ishak ikofen faro i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">“Nari wawur no nasabu ro nanki mufes ve au va,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">yaf bena kako nari nbuk sur pyum va ma nadufen ve au va.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Nari wakenem kuker sumber bedi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">imboi be manfyan faro veknik bani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">imbape bawes mbrov ido,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">nari wakfis bur papoik vyedi.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:39-40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Ibr. 11:20</ref></char></note><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:8">SaR. 36:8</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:20">2Raj. 8:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Rarirya Esau vye mbrov Yakub i snar kmar vyuk vok venapesya faro indi. Kyara vo dove, “Fioro va kamam nari imar rarirya kovarop i ra posa ido, nari yamun Yakub i fa imar!”<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ishak iwan Yakub i fa ibur ve Laban i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Fafisu Ribka ryower Esau roi dawos na mura, iwan fa sor Yakub i ma dawos faro i, “Rwower, Esau naek banya daw kwar fa ive myun au fa wamar. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Rarirya wafrur rosai yakofen nane. Wabur fasau ve mem Laban i ro Haran, <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />ma kwain so i ro diwa rawo naek banya masasor vyena nambror resari <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />ma vye farander rosai wafrur kwar faro i anna. Insape nari yawan fa sun kaver au fa wabur muma. Yamewer romawa ayesuya sudawer kam ro ras oser di.”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Raimnaido Ribka dawos wer faro Ishak i, “Yafafayaf kaku ma yamewer yamam vin ro er vese Esau vyuk ansuya ndi. Yakub dakvuk vinkbor Het o ido, ivye yamar mura kwar.”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Posa Ishak dor Yakub i, ma vye vok i vo ikofen, “Farvuk kuker vin Kanaan sine oso nawer. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Rwa ve Padan-Aram, faro Betuel, kpu banya, insa buk mem Laban inai vyesya oso. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Ivye kada Allah Vepoik Syadi Kaku Vye vok farvakvuk bedi ma Vyuk ve au romawa kpu sibor, rarirya nari be up faro er vebor! <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Ivye kada <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vye vok au ma kpu besya, imnis vok Abraham ismai kwar, ivyekada nwa saprop kwain ro ine ve sup mankun bedi, saprop Allah vyuk kwar faro Abraham i!”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-8">SaR. 17:4-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Rarirya Ishak ryir Yakub i fa ryabe Padan-Aram, faro Laban, Betuel snon Aram ani romawa vyedi. Laban i inido Yakub ma Esau sna suve Ribka srar vyedirya.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau fyarvuk wer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Esau ryower ma Ishak vye vok Yakub i kwar ramnai iwani fa ibur ve Padan-Aram insa syewar vino ro diwa. Kako ro fafisu Ishak vye vok Yakub i, Ishak danun pakrek kaku Yakub i insa ipok dun vinkbor Kanaan o fa vyuk va. <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Rarirya kako Esau ifawi Yakub isoyuser wos kmari ma snar suvena, inja rya ve Padan-Aram. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Fafisu anya insape Esau ifawi kaku kmar Ishak i, imewer kaku faro vin Kanaan sya, <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />muraido Esau ibur ve Abraham romawa vye Ismael i, ma vyuk Ismael vinkbor vyedi venir ve Mahalat i fa iwarpu swa vyansuya. Mahalat inido Nebayot srar kasun vyediri.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mafu Yakub ro Betel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Yakub ibur Bersyeba ma rya ve Haran. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Ro fafisu imbruk murvav, Yakub imbran raro mov oso,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ro mov </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rovaido ro mov vesren.</char></note> ma vyeryar ro mov ani. Fafisu ive denefya ido; dun karuiya fa nya ve afyak. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Rofyor denef anya ido myafu, myam kakar vekaki kakuya, kyaker ro sup ine ma kakar anya ikaki kaku ra pumya ryaryas kyer mandepi, manakya sya sek sisabu ro kakar ani.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:51">Yoh. 1:51</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Ma <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> dores ro ris<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ro ris vyedi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rovaido ro kakarya bo.</char></note> vyedi ma dawos yov i, “Aya <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> Abraham ma Ishak susyom ani, na yavuk ve au ma faro kpu besya saprop ine, mov wenef ro ine.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:14-15">SaR. 13:14-15</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Kpu besya nari sibor simnis oref vero sup swan ine. Kpu vesya nari siryer ma skain ro sup ine ve vandivar, snar au ma kpu besya evedar nari Yave vok er vebor<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fasfas eveseya ryok radine: er vebor syakam nari sfararyor ve Aya insa Yave vok si raris mov yave vok au ma up besya raya.</char></note> ro sup swan ine syakam.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">SaR. 12:3</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 22:18">22:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Waswarepen, Aya nari vefnovek au ma vefadiren au, ro marandan bedi ma nari Yun au fa kwaver ve sup mnuk ine. Ma nari yarir auva isof yave asuser roi vebor yave asas kwar faro au nane.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Fafisu Yakub ikvok ro anenef vyedi, ikofen: “Kaku veri <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> isya ro dine, imboi yafawi va.” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Imkak ma ikofen, “Mov ine ifrur kanandor kaku. Ine irya Allah rum Vyedi, ine irya kedwai nanki.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Meser fyase ro mun arwoya, Yakub dun karui nya ve afyak anya ma kyaker i fa dores fa vye karui swarapepen. Posa isar mani Saitun na ro bori fa vye som faro Allah i. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Yakub nyir mov anya ve Betel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibrani inido: Rum Allah.</char></note> (fyor iwara snoriso Lus.) <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Posa Yakub vye syasi, “<char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> fyaduru ma vye sano warek aya ro marandan ine, vyuk nanan ma sansun, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />isof yakaver ve kamam rum vyedi kuker payamyum ido, <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> irya Allah ayedi. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Ma nari yavuk faro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> I rarwas seser var samfur ro roi vebor <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vyuk faro aya anna. Karui swarapepen yavaus anine nari vye mov samsom faro <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> I.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s1">Yakub isya ro Laban rum vyedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Muraido Yakub imbran pdef ve var wamurem, ve sup mov kawasa karyer vyesya sisya roya. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Fafisu myam ve vandivar ido myam war veyer oso ro maper ani ma myam kako rofanfan indo veyaninem ro war anine som ri kyor sisya svarek fanam war ani. War veyer anine kerui vebaya isosef wareki. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Rofanfan vebor ansi siryur kam ro mov anya kwar ido, manfarandous ansi simiser kerui anya bur ma spos war na fa sinem. Rofanfan ansi sinem ra posa manfarandous ansi sisisen kaver war veyer ani.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Muraido Yakub ifuken faro manfarandous ansi, dove, “Ne naek, mko nido mkorakero?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Skarem be i, “nkoraker Haran,”<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Yakub ifuken wer, “Inja mko fawi Laban i, Nahor kpu vyani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Snon ansya skarem, “Imbo, nkofawi i.”<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Yakub ifuken wer, “Rum rido vyedi ryariso?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Skarem faro i, “Ra movo va.” “Mame, inai vye Rahel, i veyun rofanfan kmar vyesiyamani.”<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Yakub dove, “Meser kaker fafisuya imnis fa rofanfan sine sibur ve padwar vaim. Rosai vefnai fa mkove war fa sinem, posa mkorir si fa san avrisvaya?”<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Skarem yov i vo sove, “Nari rofanfan sine siryur kame insape karui veba ine vye vemiser vo nkove si fa sinem.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Fafisu Yakub fyawar kuker manfarandous ansya, Rahel dun rofanfan vyansya vo ryama kwar. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Fafisu Yakub myam Rahel dun domba ansya vo imbran muma, mura Yakub ryafa ikris kerui vesosef warek war veyer anya insape pyos war nafa vye fa domba ansya sinem. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Raimnaido isyum Rahel i vo kyanes. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Yakub ikofen faro Rahel i, “Ribka romawa vyedi so aya, kmam srar vyediri.” Muraido Rahel ifrar ve rum fa fyawar ve kmari rosai ryower kwar ro Yakub i. <verse eid="GEN 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Fafisu Laban ryower fawar vekur Yakub, fno vyanya, mura ifrar fa isrow kuker Yakub i, Laban dawrepen Yakub i vo isyumi ramnai dun Yakub I vo susun be rumya dori. Yakub fyawar asuser roi vebor nakam faro Laban i. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Laban ikofen, “Kaku, fno karyer ayediso au.” Yakub vyarek ro rum anya paek oser.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakub ifararur ve Laban i insa nya Rahel ma Lea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Ras oso Laban ikofen faro Yakub i, “Fno ayedi so au imboi, nari wapok wafararur monda ve ayava. Wakofen badir ve aya, rosai nari yavuki vyak au nya?” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Laban nya vinkbor di suru; vebaya snoriso Lea, ma vedar kasunya snori so Rahel. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Lea myam mayare,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">isnaipyum. </char></note> imboi Rahel baken vyeja idoser ma myam pduk kaku.<verse eid="GEN 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Yakub sneri imuk kaku faro Rahel i, muraido kyarem faro Laban i, “Yamarisen yafararur pasibarek ri fik, insa imem wamarisen ido yavuk Rahel i.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Laban dawos faro Yakub i, “Yavuk Rahel ive au ipyum syadi ro yavuki ve snonkakuyo vese; inja kwain so aya ro dine.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Mura Yakub ifararur pasivarek ri fik insa nya Rahel i, vape faro Yakub mankundi pasivarek nane, namnis raris karkor ras monda, snar snewar mun vyena faro Rahel i.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Posa ido, Yakub ikofen faro Laban i, “Pasivarek ri fik nasyonde kwar, inja imem wamarisen fa yavuk inai vinkbor bani.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Mura ido Laban ifrur munara farvakvukya, ma dor kawasa vero kota ansya kam. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Imbape Fafisu rov anya, Rahel iso Laban dun murayava, imboi dun sadwer Lea i faro Yakub i ma Yakub denef kuker i. (<verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Laban vyuk vinfamyan oso venir ve Silpa faro Lea i insa duf farmyan i.) <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Arwori fyas ido, insape Yakub ifawi Lea i vyukya. Mura ido Yakub ikofen faro Laban i, “Imem rosai evewar be aya radinenya? Yafararur snar yave yana Rahel i! Orova voi imem wafrowes aya?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Laban kyarem ve Yakub i, “Rari vero dinenya kasunya ipok fyarvuk vepon ebaya va. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Wawaf rao munara fakawawin ine isyonde ras ri fik ido insape na yavuk Rahel i ve au, imboi wafararur ve aya pasivarek ri fik wer.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Yakub isoyuser, inja munara farvakvuk anya ras ri fik nasyonde ido insape Laban vyuk Rahel i fa nya ve swa. (<verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Laban vyuk kako vinfyan vyedi venirve Bilha fa duf farmyan Rahel i.) <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Yakub denef kuker Rahel i kako, ma iswar syadi Rahel i bur Lea i. Rarirya Yakub ifararur pasivarek ri fik wer.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakub romawa vyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Fafisu <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> myam Yakub iswar mankun Lea i va, mura Vyuk fa Lea ikapar romawa, imboi Rahel i dakkapar va. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Lea fyadores ma daven romawa snonya. Inja ikofen, “<char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> myam kwar marindi venyanem aya, randak ro ras ine swa ayani nari iswar aya.” Inja nyir romawa anya ve Ruben.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ruben: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ryok imnis wos Ibrani isoine “Mame, romawa snon dirya” orovaido “myam kwar vave kandera ayena”. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Lea fyadores wer ma daven romawa snonya. Lea ikofen, “<char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vyuk romawa ine ve aya wer snar Myam ma yasmai syowi va.” Mura nyir romawa anya ve Simeon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Simeon: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ryok imnis wos Ibrani isoine “Imnaf, Ryower”</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Lea fyadores wer ma daven romawa snonya. Ikofen, “Fafisu ine swa ayani nari fyanam syadi ve aya snar yakapar romawa snon di kyor.” Inja nyir romawa anya ve Lewi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lewi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ryok imnis wos Ibrani isoine “fasfes epen”.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Posa Lea fyadores wer ma daven romawa snonya. Muraido ikofen, “Rarwan ine yasandik <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> I.” Inja nyir romawa anya ve Yehuda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yehuda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ryok imnis wos Ibrani “Sanandik”.</char></note> Posa ido Lea ikapar werva.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Fafisu anya Rahel ismai romawayo vaim. Inja myam fadir Lea i. Mura ikofen faro Yakub i, “Buk romawayo ve aya, imbo orovaido, ivye yamar mura.”<verse eid="GEN 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Yakub imsor Rahel i ma ikofen, “Ayaine Allah ri sayava. I vefrur fa wasmai romawa va i.”<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Mura Rahel ikofen, “Vinfyan yedi Bilha isoine. Wenef kuker i insa ikapar romawayo ve aya. Insa vyewar yakna kako kpu no.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Mura vyuk vinfyan vye Bilha i fa Yakub denef kuker i. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Bilha fyadores ma ikapar romawa snonya. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Rahel ikofen, “Allah Vyuk kakaku kwar ve aya. Imnaf nadi ayena, ma vyuk romawaya ve aya,” Romawa anya nyir ive Dan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ryok imnis wos Ibrani isoine “eve mankara”.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Bilha fyadores wer ma ikapar romawa oser wer. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Rahel ikofen wer, “Yafanfavri marsirva kuker eba yedi, ma yaryan ve bo.” Inja nyir romawa anya ve Naftali.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Naftali: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya isoine “syewar nasrawen kaku”.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Fafisu Lea vyavir nari ismai romawa wer va kwar, mura vyuk vinfyan vye Silpa i fa Yakub vyuk i. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Silpa ikapar romawa snonya. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Mura Lea ikofen, “Yasmai marisen veba”, inja nyir romawa anya ve Gad. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gad: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya isoine “marisen veba”. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Silpa daven romawa snon oser wer, <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Ma Lea ikofen, “Yasmai aski veba kaku! Fafisu ine vin syakam nari sikofen, aya vin vesmai aski.” Evedar nyir romawa anya ve Asyer.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Asyer: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya ido “aski”.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Fafisu aninek pokem, Ruben ryave maper ma ro diya isrow dudaim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dudaim: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ro wos Ibraniya “dodayim”. Rokaker ine sna fa svuki pap vinsya kapar sena.</char></note> bon na, mura dun na ve snar Lea i. Rahel ikofen ve Lea i, “Buk dudaim bon romawa banya dun anna bon ri veso ve aya.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Lea kyarem ve i, “Wun swa ayanya kwar, fafis ine ive wun aibon romawa ayedi isrow na wer?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Rahel ikofen, “Rarirya ido ivye Yakub denef kuker au ro rov ine sadwer aibon romawa bani dun anna.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Fafisu Yakub ibur ker yaf ve rum ro mun oriwaiya, Lea ryafa isrow kuker i ma ikofen, “Wenef kuker aya ro rov ine snar yavak kwar kuker aibon romawa ayani dun na.” Mura Yakub denef kuker i ro rov ani.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Allah imnaf nadi ro Lea i, isof fyadores ma daven romawa eve rimya. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Lea ikofen, “Allah vyuk sasuref ve aya snar yavuk Silpa i kwar ve swa ayani,” evedar nyir romawa anya ve Isakhar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Isakhar: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ryok imnis wos ibrani isoine “sasuref isya”.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Raimnai Lea fyadores wer ma daven romawa eve wonemya. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Ikofen, “Allah vyuk ve aya kwar roi eve maija kaku. Kur ine swa ayani nari vye manwinm aya, snar yakapar kwar romawa snon ri wonem,” evedar nyir romawa anya ve Sebulon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sebulon: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ryok imnis wos Ibrani isoine “vye manwinm”.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Posa ro diya Lea daven inai oso ma nyir i ve Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Allah iswarepen Rahel i, inja Allah imnaf nadi vyena ma vyuk insa dakkapar romawayo. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Inja Rahel fyadores ma daven romawa snonya. Rahel ikofen, “Allah ipyos savarar ayena kwar. <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Ivye ido <char style="nd">Manseren</char> vyuk romawa snon osero wer ve aya.” Inja evedar nyir romawa anya ve Yusuf.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yusuf: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ryok imnis wos Ibrani isoine “vyuk wer” ma “ipyos”.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakub fyanvavri kuker Laban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Rahel daven Yusuf i ra posa ido, Yakub ikofen ve Laban i, “Imem buk insa yabur ve sup rik yenadai ro. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Rwir fa yabur ma yun swa ayesuya ma romawa ayansi. Yasmai si kwar snar yafararur faro imem au. Imem wafawi, yafararur marvak kaku kwar.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Imbape Laban kyarem faro i, “Ivye kada benavye faro aya ma wakenem pdef so aya. Isnai kwar ve aya rariso <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vye vok aya kwar snar au. <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Wakofen monda, veso i wor ro ayani.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Yakub kyarem be i, “Imem wafawi kwar yafararur marvak kaku kwar, ma rofanfan Imem bansya sibor siryewen snar fadaduru ro aya. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Fyor yarama vaim, Imem nana bena nakraf va, imbape fafis ine Imem nana bena nabor kwar. <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vye vok au snar aya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Snar aya: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rovaido mov risai yara yov nakam.</char></note> Kur ine irya fafisuya fa yafararur faro kina ayesya monda.”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Laban ikofen, “Inja rosai nari yavuk ve aunya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Yakub kyarem be i, “Imem buk roino ve ayanawer. Nari yawaren rofanfan Imem bansya imboi wamarisen wos ayedine nido: <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Buk fa ro ras ine yambran ro fandu kambing ma domba Imem bansya, ma yun domba kuv vepaisemsya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fasfas vekwar kaku </char><char style="fq" closed="false">domba kuv vepaisemsya. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrani: domba mkun eve kop ma eve fak ma domba mkun vepaisemsya.</char></note> ma kako kambing kuv veve swaser ma eve faksya. Sirya monda sasuref ayedi. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Ro ras nayama ipyan ve Imem au fa wafawi, yawos kakuke rova. Fyor Imem rwama kwuvek vavyak ayedi, ma mam kambing eve fakva rovaido eve swaser va, orovaido vepaisemba sya ido, irya Imem wafawi rofanfan ansine ro yakaraw sirya.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Laban Ikofen, “Ipyum! Kufrur raris mov wakofen raya!” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Imbape ro ras anya Laban pyandwas kambing snoman eve faksya ma eve swaser sya ma kambing vin eve swasersya, eve faksya orovaido eve kop vepyoper syakam; pyandwas domba vebor vepaisem sya kako. Insape iwan fa romawa vyesya siwaren warek si. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Raimnai sun rofanfan ansya vo simbran vinkwan bur Yakub i, swafya marandan ras ri kyor.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:36">Kambing domba vedawersya siso Yakub fyaduru si.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Muraido Yakub kyaruk aisnaw vepek ri kyor ro aiknam eve sisye. Insape ikasip kif na fa ne kopkop. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Yakub ryir aisnaw eve kop anna ro rosaser beser war aninem rofanfan ansi, snar rofanfan ansi simarisen sfarvuk fafisu srama sinem. <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />Inja rofyor kambing ansya sfarvuk ro varpon aisnaw anna ido, mkun sesya nari sve fak, sve swaser rovaido sve kopkop.<verse eid="GEN 30:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Posa wer ido Yakub dun domba vin vefarvuksya fa sores ro varpon ma smam yov Kambing eve fak ma vepaisemsya. Kuker nyan ine Yakub ismai rofanfansya vardi ma pyandwas si bur Laban rofanfan vyesi.<verse eid="GEN 30:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Rofyor rofanfan ansi vesambrav sya sfarvuk ido, Yakub ryir aisnaw dak kif kwar anna ro varpon sedi ro do rosaser aninemya. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Imboi fafisu rofanfan vesambrav va sya srama, aisnaw anna ryir nava. Inja rofanfan vepyoper vesambrav va ansya kam Laban vye sirya, imboi rofanfan vepaisem, eve swaser ma eve kop vesambrav sya Yakub vye sirya. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Rarirya Yakub nana vyena nfanfanfon ra nabor kaku. Nya rofanfan kambing domba, unta, keledai ma manfyan infyan sibor kaku.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Yakub fyaryan bo ibur fasis Laban i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Ro ras oso Yakub imnaf Laban romawa vyesi sikofen ra dine, “Yakub dun pres nana vebor sinan kovani vyanna kam kwar. Nana vebor vyenakam nramuma ro kma kovani.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Yakub myam kako ma Laban vye navye i ra ras vepondi va. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Inja <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> ikofen ve Yakub i, “Kwaver ve sup rik bena nadai ro aniwa, ve kmam rum vyanya ma ve kawasa bansi. Nari Yafadiren au.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Posa ido Yakub iwan fa sikofen vadir ve Rahel ma Lea su insa susrow kuker i ro maper, mov rofanfan vyesya sisya roya. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Insape Yakub ikofen ve su, “Yamam kwar voi kma muvanya rari vyena ve aya namnis mankunba kwar; infama Allah kamam isyom anya fyadiren aya. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Mufawi ayaine yafararur marvak kaku kwar faro kma muvani. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Vesyavo dankar ma fyararwe ker vavyak ayedi rarwan samfur kwar. Imbape Allah myam monda i fa ifrur roi vevyeva yov ayava. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Fafisu kma muvani ikofen, ‘Kambing eve faksya nido vavyak bediri,’ inja rofanfan ansya sikaparkam mkun eve faksya. Rofyor ikofen wer, ‘Kambing eve swasersya sinido vavyak bediri,’ inja rofanfan ansya sikapar kam mkun eve swaser. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Rarirya Allah dun rofanfan kma muvanya vyansya fa vyuk ve aya.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />Fafisu rofanfan ansi sfarvuk, yamam ro mafafu, kambing snoman vefarvuk ansyakam, eve kop, fak ma swaser. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Ma manakya Allah dawos ve aya ro do mafafu, Dove, ‘Yakub!’ Inja yakarem, ‘Ayaisine’. <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Manakya ani ikofen wer, ‘mame, kambing snoman vebor vefarvuk siya eve kop, fak ma eve swaser siya. Yau kwar fa yave si radirya ve au snar Yamam kwar Laban frur vebor vyena faro au. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Aya Allah vefasnai mankun kwar faro au ro Betel. Ro diwa bawes karui swarapepen oso, ma kako wasar mani saitun ro bori kwar. Ro diwa be syasi ve Aya kwar. Inja knik ine veri fasos ma kwaver ve sup rik venadai ro aniwa.’”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-22">SaR. 28:18-22</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Mura Lea ma Rahel sukofen, “Nuine nuyaksmai var rarwas ro nana kma nuvanya vyenava. <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Nuine kyara nu ve mandaman. Vyov nu kwar ma vavyak ismai kwar ro nu, vye nara navro kwar. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Nana vebor Allah dun kwar ro kma nuvani, nana nuvenairya kuker romawa nuvesya kako. Wafrur kwar sasoser rosai Allah dawos kwar faro au.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17-18" />Inja Yakub syansanson fa ibur ve kmari ro sup Kanaan. Vin vyuk ansya ma romawa sesya vyesi fa sek unta, ma dun iwayan rofanfan vebor vyesi ma roi vebor ismai kwar ro Padan-Aram. <verse eid="GEN 31:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Ro fafis anya Laban isya ro maper fa kyaruk domba vyesya bur sesi, ma ro fafis anya kako Rahel dun fasis amfyanir vefadiren kina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Amfyanir vefadiren kina: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ro wos Ibraniya isoine Terafim, isoine amfyanir sifrur farari snonkaku ma sisyomi ve manfadiren kina.</char></note> kmar Laban vyesi. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Yakub ibur fasis Laban i ma ikofen vadir barbur vyeja va. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Dun nana vebor vyenakam vo rya sawsaw kaku. Dunuk marei veba Efrat ma imbran be bonvepampyan Gilead.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Laban iyom Yakub i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Ras ri kyor nasyonde ido insape sikofen vadir ve Laban i, abar vekur Yakub barbur vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Mura Laban iryur snonkaku vyesi ma insape siyom Yakub i ras ri fik isof sisrowi ro bonvepampyan Gilead. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Ro rovya ido Allah rya yov Laban i ro mafafu, ma ikofen ve i, “Waswarepen, wapok wawos wos rarmomen osero vaveri faro Yakub i.” <verse eid="GEN 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Fafisu anya Yakub vyawes Soyaiya kwar ro bonvepampyan Gilead. Fanam ro mov anya Laban ikako syoyai kuker kawasa veso insya.<verse eid="GEN 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Posa ido Laban ikofen faro Yakub i, “Rosai evewar wafrowes aya ma wun fasis inai ayesuyani, ryari women suirya? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Rosai evewar wafrowes aya ma wabur fasis vo wakofen vadirvaya? Wakofen vadir kada, nari yarir au fa wabur kuker marisen ma siyaker au kuker dow ma sirev kuker nevi.<figure style="fig" file="BK00184C.TIF" size="col" ref="31:27">Nevi</figure> <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Buk swaf ve aya va fa yasyum inai ayesuya ma kpu ayesi fa fyasnai vadir fafis kovesisyeya. Frur banine imnis mankun va! <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Yasamvrav kaker fa yafrur roi vevyeva yov au, imboi rovanja Allah kmam isyom anya vyuk swarepen ve aya insa yafrur roi vevyeva awer yov au. <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Yafawi wasasyar ine snar ive wabur kaku. Imboi rosai evewar kwarau anfyanir vewaren warek kina ayejani?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Mura Yakub kyarem, “Yasasyar yabur fasis snar yamkak imem nari kwarwarek inai bansuya ndi, <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Imboi anfyanir wakofenya, imem wasmai snonkaku vekarauya ro fandu inko ido, ivye vye vemun ra imar. Swepak kwar, roi vebor imem bena naisya ro dineke. Naisya ido, wun na. Ma snonkaku kuvansine kam smam epen.” Yakub ifawiva vo Rahel i veyun fasis anfyanir anyani.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Inja Laban rya ve Yakub soyai vyedi ma syepaki; posa rya ve Lea soyai vyedi ma soyai vinfyan vye suya, imbape amfyanir anya isrow iva. Pupesya syun ro Rahel soyai vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Fyor anya Rahel dun amfyanir anya fa ikram i ro inoken untaya, ma kyain epen i ro soyai vyanya dori. Laban syepak Rahel soyai vyanya kasiper, imbape ismai anfyanir anyava. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Mura Rahel ikofen ve kmari, “Kamam wamsor awer aya, yores fa yasom kamam au va snar yasmai mamas.” Laban syewar fafewa kaku infama ismai amfyanir anyava.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Muraido Yakub imsor bos kaku ma ifuken, “Vavyeva rosai yafrur kwarya, sasar rosai yafrur fa evedar imem wayamyom aya radinenya? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Swepak pres roi vebor ayanna kwar, imem wasmai roi swewarya kwar? Wasasyar i ma rwir i ro varpon ine insa snonkaku ayesya ma snonkaku besya smam ma skara user mansei vekaku ro fandu ku. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Pasivarek samfur di suru yakenem so imem au. Rofanfan domba ma kambing vin imem bansya sikapar siryewen, imboi mkun sikaparsya ono simar va, ma kambing snomansya yan osero vaveri. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Aiwan berafdisya smunsya raso fa yun si ve imem auva, imboi mankundaya yasadwer si. Skarau ro meser orovaido rov, imem wayau si ro aya fa yasadwer si. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Ras na ido daresya myun aya ro meserna ma pnunkya myun aya ro rov na. Swaf naso ido yenef mnisva. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Irya kenem ayedi fafisu yafararur ve imem au pasivarek samfur di suru. Pasivarek samfur oser seser di fyak yafararur insa yana imem inai bansuya ma pasivarek ri wonem wer infa yasmai rofanfan siya. Ma ro swaf anine imem fadadwer ker vavyak ayedi rarwan samfur. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Allah up ayedi, isoine Allah Abraham ma Ishak susyomya Fyadiren ayava kada nari imem wawan aya fa yabur beidi. Imbape Allah myam epen kwar marindi vekur aya ma fararur yafrur kwar na, ma rovanja Vyuk wos namuk kwar.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fes eren fandu Yakub ma Laban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Mura Laban kyarem be Yakub i, “Vin suiya inai ayesuirya; romawa suvesya kpu ayesirya, ma domba safsofer siya ro yana sirya. Kakudam, roi mam ro dine nakam roi yana nairya. Imbape nari yafrur royo fa yavuki dwarek romawa kpu ayansiya va. <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Inja ivye ku fes eren ma kuyaker karui no fa ne avyair fes eren ine.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Posa Yakub dun karui oso fa vyawes fa dores fa vye karui swarapepen. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Insape iwan kawasa veso insya fa siryur karui na ma sisofer na fa ne aker. Raimnai sanan kayam ro ris karui aker anna. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Laban nyir karui aker anya ve Yegar Sahaduta,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:47 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yegar Sahaduta: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Aramya ido “Karui aker eve swarapepen”. </char></note> imboi Yakub nyir ive Galed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:47 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Galed: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya ido “karui aker eve swarapepen”. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Laban ikofen ve Yakub i, “Karui aker ine nari vye swarapepen faro ku.” Evedar mov anya snir i ve Galed. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Laban ikofen wer, “Ivyekada <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> vye manfadwaren fandu au kuker aya fafisu kuvinkwan yaye.” Evedar mov anya snir i ve Mispa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:49 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mispa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ryok imnis wos Ibrani isoine “mov sbuki fyadwaren warek ku”.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Laban ikofen wer, “Rofyor wafrur evyeva yov inai ayesuya, rovaido farvuk kuker vin no vese, ono sifawi vayo, waswar epen Allah isya fyadwaren warek ku. <verse eid="GEN 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Nane nairya karui yaker kwar, ma ine ido karui swarapepen. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Ivye karui aker ine ma karui swarapepen ine vyuk swarepen ve ku insa yunuk awer karui aker ine ma karui swarapepen ine fa yafarmun au, ma au kako wapok wunuk karui aker ine ma karui swarapepen ine fa farmun aya. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Allah Abraham ma Kma ayedi Nahor<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:53 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abraham ... Nahor: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abraham inido Yakub kpuri, ma Nahor inido Laban kmari.</char></note> susyomya nari vye mankakara fandu au ma aya.” Muraido yakub ifrur sowar kuker snonsnon Allah kmar Ishak isyom anya, fa nari vye imnis sowar vyani. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Kyaruk aiwanya fa fyarser ro urek anya bori. Insape dor kawasa sya fa sanan kayam. Sanan ra posa sveryar fa senef ro urek ani. <verse eid="GEN 31:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Meser fyas ro mun arwoya ido Laban isyum inai ma kpu vyesi ma vye vok si, insape ibur kaver ve mov vyedi.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s">Yakub fyasos fa isrow kuker Esau i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Yakub imbran pdef maran vyedi. Mura manakya ri veso srafa sisrow kuker i. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Fafisu Yakub myam si, mura ikofen, “Ine mov Allah rak vyesya syoyai ro,” inja nyir mov anya ve Mahanaim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mahanaim: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya ido “soyai ri suru”. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Posa ro diya Yakub iwan mampaf ri veso fa sra ve sup Edom fa sisrow kuker veba vyedi Esau i. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Yakub ikofen faro si, “Mkokofen faro veba ayani Esau i radine, ‘Aya Yakub, manfyan bedi. Swaf iyafa yavarek so Laban i. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Kur ine yana sapi, keledai, domba, kambing ma manfyan infyan si. Yafarem wos ayena ve amber ayanawi, yakyar amber na wamarisen.’”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Fafisu mampaf ansi skaver ve Yakub i, sikofen vadir, “Nkora nkosrow Esau, amber naek veba banya kwar ma fafisu ine isya ro marandan muma fa isrow kuker amber au. Isyama kuker snonkaku usin di fyak.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Yakub imkak kaku ma vye virvar fafisu imnaf wos anna. Muraido snonkaku veso i ansya irwas si fa sve safsofer ri suru, rarirya kako kuker domba, kambing, sapi ma unta vyansi. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Kyara ra dine, “Fafis Esau ryama fyarmun safsofer veponya ido, safsofer eve suruya nari sismai swaf fa sfaspar si.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Insape yakub vye nadi, “Sye Allah, up ayedi Abraham ma Allah kma ayedi Ishak susyom annawi, wamnaf aya! <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> wawan aya kwar fa yabur kaver ve sup ayedi ma kawasa ayesi. Ma <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> wawos ve aya kwar fa nari fasos roi vebor fa napyum ve aya. <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Yasyus vaveri fa yasmai saswar vebor ma vave asuser <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> fasnai kwar ve aya nane. Fafisu yasasyar ma yunuk war veba Yordan, yun royova imbo ankyon ine monda. Fafis ine yakaver muma kuker safsofer ri suru suine. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Yor samsom kaku, faspar aya bur veba ayedi Esau i. Imbude ryama ido fyarmun ma myun pres inko, kako vin ma romawa inai sine ndi. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Waswarepen, snar <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> wawos soser kwar ve aya nari be imnis roi vebor nakam fa napyum be aya ma buk fa kpu ayesya sibor kaku. Snonkaku osofa nari kyor napok si va snar sibor simnis yen morem ro swan andir.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">SaR. 22:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13-15" />Vye ryar ro mov anya ro rov ani, posa Yakub dun rofanfan vyansya var di fa nya si ve faferes faro Esau i. Faferes anna isoine: Kambing vinsya utin di suru, kambing snomansya samfur di suru, unta vin vesasus kaker kuker mkun sesya samfur di kyor, sapi vinsya samfur di fyak, sapi snomansya samfur, keledai vinsya samfur di suru ma keledai snomansya samfur. <verse eid="GEN 32:13-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Irwas rofanfan ansya fa sve safsofer ri veso posa ryir si fa ve manfyan vyansi oser-oser. Ikofen faro si, “Mkombran vepon aya, ma mkomam warek insa swafo isya fandu safsofer veponya ma vero varpurya.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Yakub vyuk sasoser faro manfamyan veponya, “Rofyor Esau isrow kuker au ma ifuken, Amber bedi snoriso? Ive rwave? Mansei vena rofanfan wun siyanya? <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Kwarem ve i radine, ‘Manfyan vedi Yakub i rofanfan vye sirya. Fyarem si ve faferes faro amber vyedi Esau i. Manfyan bedi Yakub isyama iyom user.’” <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19-20" />Vyuk sasoser radirya kako faro manfyan vyesi eve suru, kyor ma snonkaku vemam warek rofanfan ansi. Snar Yakub kyara ro sneri, faferes nane nari nafrur sneprei Esau i, inja fafis susrow su nido nari Esau vyuk fakman ve i. <verse eid="GEN 32:19-20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Inja fyarem vepon faferes anna, imboi mankundi vye ryar ma denef ro soyai vyedi.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakub ryapapik kuker snon oso ro Pniel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Ro rov anya veri Yakub syanson ma dun swa vyansuya, kya vyansuya ma romawa samfur seser oser vyansya, ma sunuk war Yabok. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Sunuk kam kwar raposa kyaver ma iwan fa manfamyan vyansi sfaryan nana vyannakam ve warya var ivarwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Imboi mankundi derer vo vyarek.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:24">Fyorova ido snon oso ryama iserepen Yakub i, mura Yakub i kuker snon ani sufafor ma suvesewar insa sumindi isapi, ro rov anya ra vyavir meser. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Fafisu snon ani kyara ma nari imerkar Yakub i va mura, iprer Yakub i ro siferpum vyedi, isof sifer vyedi ikfis. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Raimnai snon ani ikofen, “Rwir aya; kniko monda vo ori sampir.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Yakub kyarem be i, “Na yarir au va rao ve vok aya resari.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:24-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:3-4">Hos. 12:3-4</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Snonkaku anya ifuken, “Snombri so?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Kyarem ve snon ani, “Yakub.”<verse eid="GEN 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Snon ani ikofen, “Snonsnon bedi Yakub wer va. Papik kuker Allah ma kuker snonkaku, ma au vesambrav syadiya; rarirya snonsnon bedi isoine Israel.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Israel: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ryok imnis wos Ibrani isoine “pyik kuker Allah”. </char></note> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:10">SaR. 35:10</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Yakub ifuken, “Wakofen vadir snonsnon bedi.” Imbape snon ani kyarem, “Fandun fa wafawi snonsnon ayejava!” Insape vye vok Yakub i.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 13:17-18">Hak. 13:17-18</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Muraido Yakub ikofen, “Yasrow Allah I kwar varpon kuker varpon, imboi ayaisne yakenem kaker,” Inja nyir mov anya ve Pniel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pniel: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ryok imnis wos Ibrani isoine “varpon Allah Vyedi”. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Fafisu ori dek, Yakub imbran bur Pniel, ma imbran isew snar sifer vyedi ikfis. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Isof ras ine kawasa Israel sya san kraf vero sifer pum aiwansya va, snar Yakub vye veprer ro sifer vyedi.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Yakub isrow kuker Esau i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Yakub myam ido Esau isyama kuker snonkaku vyesya usin di fyak. Inja irwas romawa vyansya fandu Lea, Rahel ma kya vyansuya. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Ryir kya vyansuya kuker romawa suvesya fa sro varpon, posa Lea i kuker romawa vyesya, insape Rahel ma Yusuf suro varpur kaku. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Yakub imbran ro varpon, ma fafisu imbran anya vyan suba rarwan ri fik isof fyanam eba vyani. <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Imbape Esau ifrar fa isrow kuker Yakub i, insape fyori ma isyumi. Ma sukanes yaye su. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Fafisu Esau myam vin ma romawa ansya mura ifuken, “Veso au sinenido mansesirya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yakub kyarem be i “Sinido romawa ayesirya, Allah vyuk kwar romawa sine ve aya.” <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Raimnai kya vyansuya kuker romawa suvesya simbran ve varpon insape skunem ma svan suba. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Posa Lea kuker romawa vyesya, ma varpur Yusuf ma Rahel simbran fanam fa svan suba kako ve Esau i.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Esau ifuken, “Snonkaku safsofer vembran vesisye insanja yasrow ansya ido rosai evedar warwas si ra diryani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Yakub kyarem, “Yafarem si fa spon mufa insa sifrur sneprei naek au.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Imbape Esau ikofen, “Nana ayena nabor kwar, inja buk awer faferes ve aya.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Yakub ikofen wer, “Wamewer awer! Yafrur sneprei snembri kwar ido, wun faferes yavuk nane. Snar fafisu yamam varpon naek bedi irya imnis yamam varpon Allah vyedi, snar naek benavye aya kwar. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Yor samsom kaku, ivyekada wun faferes yavuk kwar nane. Snar Allah vye navye aya kwar ma vyuk ve aya roi vebor yave fandun na.” Yakub dor vesyakwar isof varpurya Esau dun faferes vyuk anna.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Insape Esau ikofen, “Indo mkosanson insa kombran pdef, nari yambran so au ro varpon.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Imbape Yakub kyarem be i: “Naek mam kada romawa sine ssambrav mankunba, ma kako na yave fawas kaku snar rofanfan sine siya ssasus kaker, kombran sawsaw ido nari rofanfan sine simarkam. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Naek wambran vepon mura, nari yambran fawas kuker rofanfan ma romawa ayesine ra varpur isof yasrow kuker naek au ro Edom.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Mura Esau ikofen, “Rarirya ido yarir snonkaku ayansine veso fa simbranso au.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Imbape Yakub ikofen wer, “Bekandera awer, ivye yasmai syowi monda ro au.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Rarirya ro ras anya Esau ibur kaver ve Edom. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Imbape Yakub imbran be Sukot, rodiwa vyawes rumya ve i ma avdares kadaun faro rofanfan vyesi. Evedar mov anya snir i ve Sukot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sukot: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya isoine “mov afyadiren”. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Fafisu ri veso nawas ido, Yakub isasyar bur Sukot ma imbran be sup Kanaan. Syuver ro kota Sikhem kuker payamyum ma vyawes soyai vyedi ro maper fanam kota anya. Irya marandan Yakub vyedi vekaver ker Padan Aram. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Maper mov syoyai ro anya kyoves i ro Hemor romawa vyesi, isoine Sikhem kmari, kuker kumpan sarak usin oser.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yos. 24:32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:5">Yoh. 4:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Posa ido vyawes apen farsarser oso ro diya ma nyir mov anya ve “El, isoine, Allah irya Allah Israel.”<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s1">Dina ma Sikhem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Ras oso, Yakub ma Lea inai suve Dina i rya fa vye dakam vin Kanaan sya.<verse eid="GEN 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Wairek ro sup mnuk ani isoine Hemor snon Hewi anya. Fafisu romawa vye Sikhem myam Dina i mura ismeri ma duni fa vye sonei i. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Snerimuk kaku faro Dina i, isof dembuk i insa imarisen faro i. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Sikhem ikofen ve kmari, “Kamam vesewar kaku insa wun vinkbor anya ve aya fa yana ve swa.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Yakub ryower inai inkbor vyanya Sikhem vye mamas i kwar, imboi snar romawa vyesya sisya smamwarek rofanfan kaker ro maper, inja vyefasis monda isof sibur kaver.<verse eid="GEN 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Sikhem kmar Hemor i rya yov Yakub i fa dawawos yov i. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Rofafisu anya kako Yakub romawa vyansya sibur ker maper. Simnaf frur vevyeva anya inja sikandor ma simsor bos kaku. Snar frur mamas faro Yakub inai vyani, irya anonef Sikhem ifrur faro kawasa Israel syakam. Snar frur vera dine sipok sifrur i vaveri. <verse eid="GEN 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Hemor ikofen ve Yakub i, “Romawa ayani Sikhem i sneri ryo naek inai bani; yor syowi ro au, ivye ido wamarisen fa romawa ayani fyarvuk kuker i. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Ivye kona wos oser infa romawa snon inkovesya sfarvuk kuker inai mkovesi ma romawa snon mkovesya sfarvuk kuker inai nkovesi. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Mkokenem so inko ro dine; ro mov risai mkomarisenya. Mkosma mkei kako fa mkora mura muma kuker rofanfan mkovesya ro sup ine. Mko kako na mkakna saprop ro dine.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Posa ido Sikhem ikofen ve Dina kmari ma srar vyesi, “Mkokarem fararyor ayedine nido, rosai mkor na nari yavukna. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Mkokofen rosai mkomarisenya, ma mkap kako ararem i. Nari yavuk rosai mkor na, imboi mkomarisen fa yavuk vin ani.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Romawa yakub vyansi siwasen mura ro frur vevyeva Sikhem ifrur faro srar skove Dina i, inja skara fa skankar frowes Sikhem ma kmar Hemor su. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Skokofen ve mambekma ansuya, “Nkovuk srar nkovanya fa fyarvuk kuker snon eve sunat va ido mnuk anya nari ifrur mamyai inko. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Roi oser monda eve fandun kaku ine, mkofrur veponi resari, isoine snon vebor ro fandu mko ivyekada sve sunat kam raris inko. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Posa kwar ido insape nari nkove user wos mkovani fa mkofarvuk kuker inai nkovesya ma nkofarvuk kuker inai mkovesi; nari nkokenem ro fandu mko ma nkove er oser kuker mko. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Imboi mkoveyuser fararyor nkovedine va, ma mkomewer mkove sunat ri, nari nkun inai nkovanine ma nkobur.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Hemor ma Sikhem suveyuser fararyor ani. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Sikhem fyasos fa vye asuser fararyor ani snar snerimuk kaku faro Dina i. Sikhem i irya snopor sve syowi ro fandu er ma kina vyesi.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Rarirya Hemor ma Sikhem sura ve mov fananjur ro kedwai veba kota anya ma suyawos faro kawasa vero kota anyansya radine, <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />“Snonkaku Israel ansiwa manivov kovesirya. Inja korir fa skain so ko ro sup fyor anine ma semkei fa sra mura muma ve mov risai simarisenya. Sup ine imkei faro si kako. Nari kofarvuk kuker inai sesya ma sikako sfarvuk kuker inai kovansi. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Imboi roi oser monda i sor ro ko insa kofrurya insa simarisen fa sikenemso ko ro dine isoine: snon vebor vero er kovaninensya ivyekada kakve sunat imnis raris mov sve sunat raya. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Rofanfan sesya ma nana vebor sena kam nari kona na kako. Inja ivye kove user fararyor sedi insa sikenemso ko,” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Kankain kota anya veryur syakam simarisen ma sve user wawos ro Hemor ma Sikhem su, mura snon vero kota anya sve sunat si.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Ras ri kyor nawas ido, fafis snon ansya siduf kaker snar sve sunat, Yakub romawa vyesuya isoine Dina srar vye venirve Simeon ma Lewi, suyun rorabi suvena vo susun fasis ve kota anya dori. Insape sumun pres snon vebor vero kota anya nsi, <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Hemor ma Sikhem sukako. Insape suyun Dina i ro Sikhem rumya vo skobur. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Posa ro mamun anya ido Yakub romawa vyansya srama sfasyar pres nana vebor vekakur ro kota ani. Sifrur radirya fa smunsu sasar veba Sikhem ifrur kwar yov srar sedi Dina i. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Sun rofanfan kambing domba, sapi, keledai roi vebor vero kota anya dori ma vandiri. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Sun pres roi vekakur, vin ma romawa sesya ma sfasyar pres nana vebor ro rum sena vero kota ani.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Yakub ikofen ve Simeon ma Lewi su, “Mufrur fa yasrosen. Kur ine kawasa Kanaan ma kawasa Feris ma kawasa vebor ro sup ine nari sembrov aya. Koine koborva; inja siryur vo srama smun ko ido nari komindi ikenem va.”<verse eid="GEN 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Imbape sukarem ve i, “Nari nkomam monda vo srar inkovedi sifrur mamas i ve vin vekakuva?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Allah iwan Yakub kuker kina vyesi fa sra ve Betel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Ro ras oso Allah ikofen ve Yakub i, “Aya Allah vefasnai Mankunkwar faro au fafisu wafrar wabur naek bedi Esau i. Fasos ma rwa ve Betel. Barek ro diya ma bawes apen farsarsero ve Aya.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:11-17">SaR. 28:11-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2-3" />Mura Yakub ikofen be kina vyansi ma snonkaku vekainso insya, “Ive kora ve Betel. Ro diwa nari yavawes apen farsarsero faro Allah vefnovek ayakwar fafisu ayaisya ro ananjar ma Vefadiren ayakwar ro nyan marandan ayena. Inja mkosawen pres amfyanir mkokramsya; mkofasren mankun mko ma mkosansun sansun vesren.” <verse eid="GEN 35:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Mura siryur amfyanir vebor sikramsya ma kako rofafyai sesya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rofafyai sine sna si kako ve boryas rovaido afis.</char></note>. Roi vebor annanekam Yakub derak na ro ai vebaya fuarya fanam kota Sikhem.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Fafisu Yakub kuker kina ma kawasa vyansi sisasyarya, Allah ikawef kawasa vero kota vebor vero diyanna kuker makakak veba isof siyom Yakub i kuker kawasa vyansyava. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Rarirya Yakub ma kawasa vyansya simbran ra ssuver ro sup Kanaan ro kota Betel kur iwara venirve Lus. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Ro mov anya Yakub vyawes apen farsarserya ma nyir mov anya ve “El-Betel”, snar Allah fyasnai mankundi kwar faro i ro mov anya fafisu ifrar ibur naek vyani. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Ro mov anya kako Debora, vin veyuf farmyan Ribka imar ma sikrir i ro ai vebaya fuarya ro var wamires ro kota ani. Evedar aiknam ani snir i ve “Aiknam Kankanes”.<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Allah vye vok Yakub i ro Betel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Fafisu Yakub kyaver ker Padan-Aram ma rya ve Betel, Allah fyasnai mankundi wer faro i ma vye vok i. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Allah ikofen faro i, “Nari sap au ve Yakub wer va, imboi Israel.” Rarirya Allah nyir i ve Israel.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">SaR. 32:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Insape Allah ikofen wer, “Aya Allah Vepoik Syadi. Ivyekada wakapar insa kpu besya sibor kaku! Romawa besya nari sikapar er sibor kaku, ma kpu besya nari ono sve wairek.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-8">SaR. 17:4-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Sup yavuk kwar faro Abraham ma Ishak, nari yavuki ve au ma kpu besya.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Posa ido Allah ibur Yakub i. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Ro mov Allah dawos faro i anya, Yakub vyawes karui swarapepenya. Karui anya fyarser i faro Allah i inja isar maniy saitun ma war anggur ro bori.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-19">SaR. 28:18-19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Mov anya nyir i ve “Betel”.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rahel imar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Posa rodiya Yakub kuker kawasa vyansi sisasyar bur Betel. Fafisu sfanam be Efrata vaim, Rahel ras vyena namnis fa daven romawa. Imbape nana romawa anya syamswen kaku. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Dafduf nana romawa anya isyun bos kaku i, vin vesaramper kapapar anya ikofen ve i, “Rahel, snembri idworem, romawa wavenya snon dirya wer.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Rahel fanam kwar fa imar, ma ro fafisu mananai papupes vyena, nyir romawa vyanya ve Ben-Oni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ben-Oni: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya isoine “romawa kandera ayedi”. </char></note> imbape kmar nyir i ve Benyamin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:18: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Benyamin: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya isoine romawa nari vekenem pyum.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Irya Rahel marmar vyedi, inja sikrir i ro ris nyan vesoyov Efrata, mov fafis ine venirve Betlehem. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Yakub vyawes karui swarapepenya ro mov ani, ma isof ras ine karui kakop ani isya kaker ro rus Rahel vyani. <verse eid="GEN 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Posa rodiya maran Yakub vyani simbran pdef, insape vyawes soyai vyedi fanam Migdal-Eder.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Migdal-Eder ido wos Ibrani rirya, inido kaderen svawes fa svuki myamwarek rofanfan kambing ma domba. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Fafisu sisya kaker ro mov anya, Ruben denef kuker Bilha, kmar kya vyani. Yakub imnaf frur anine mura imsor bos kaku.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:4">SaR. 49:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakub Romawa vyesi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="GEN 35:22">(<ref loc="1CH 2:1-2">1Taw. 2:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakub nya romawa samfur seser ri suru. <verse eid="GEN 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Lea romawa vyesi sisoine Ruben (Yakub romawa rakya), Simeon, Lewi, Yehuda, Isakhar ma Sebulon. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Rahel romawa vyesuya susoine Yusuf ma Benyamin. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Rahel vinfyan vye Bilha i romawa vyesi sisoine Dan ma Naftali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Lea vinfyan vye Silpa i romawa vyesuya susoine Gad ma Asyer. Romawa ansine sikaparsi ro Padan-Aram.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ishak imar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Yakub ibur kaver ve kmar Ishak i ro mov vyarek ro isoine Mamre fanam Hebron. (Fyor iwara up vyedi Abraham vyarek ro mov anya kako).<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:18">SaR. 13:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28-29" />Fafisu vye mansar bos kaku, ras kenem vyedi vye pasivarek usin oser samfur di war, Ishak imar, muraido romawa vyansuya isoine Esau ma Yakub sukrir i.<verse eid="GEN 35:28-29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s1">Esau kpu vyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Ine irya Esau kpu vyesi, Esau sap i kako ve Edom. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Esau fyarvuk kuker vin Kanaan ri kyor, sisoine: Ada, Elon snonkaku Het inai vyediri; Oholibama, Ana inai vyedi ma Sibeon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fasfas vekwar ri veso: “Sibeon romawa vyedi.”</char></note> snon Hewi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:34">SaR. 26:34</ref></char></note> kpu vyediri; <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />Basmat Ismael inai vyedi ma Nebayot srar vyedirya.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:9">SaR. 28:9</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada ikapar Elifas, Basmat ikapar Rehuel, <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Oholibama ikapar Yeus, Yaelam ma Korah. Romawa sinekam sikapar si ro sup Kanaan.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Esau ibur Yakub i ma ryave sup vese ma dun swa vyansya, romawa vyesya ma snonkaku vero rum vyejansyakam, kuker rofanfan ma nana vebor vyena ismai kwar ro Kanaan. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Esau ma Yakub sukain kayamba snar nana suvena nabor rape, vesyawer ido saprop mov sukain ro anya maper avris no namkei mankun faro rofanfan suvansyava snar sibor mankenem. Inja ipyum syadi suve sisye. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Inja Esau sap kako ve Edom kyain ro bonvepampyam Seir.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Esau irya up ro er Edom vekain ro bonvepampyam Seir. Ine irya snonsnon ro kpu vyesi. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10-13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10-13" />Esau swa vyedi venir ve Ada ikapar romawa snonya snori Elifas. Ma Elifas ikapar romawa snon di rim, sisoine: Teman, Omar, Sefo, Gaetam ma Kenas. Elifas vye kya vin oso snori Timna. Ikapar romawa snonya snori Amalek.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 36:10-13">Esau swa vye venir ve Basmat ikapar romawa snon oser snori Rehuel. Rehuel ikapar romawa snon di fyak, sisoine: Naha, Serah, Syama ma Misa.<verse eid="GEN 36:10-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Esau swa vye Oholibama ikapar romawa snon di kyor, sisoine: Yeus, Yaelam ma Korah. Oholibama inido Ana inai vyedi ma Sibeon kpu vyedirya.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Sine sirya sinan eve vukor ro er vebor ro Esau kpu vyesi: Elifas, Esau romawa rakya irya up ro er vebor sine, sisoine: Teman, Omar, Sefo, Kenas, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />Korah, Gaetam ma Amalek. Sinekam sve up ro Ada ma Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Rehuel, Esau ma Basmat romawa suvedi, vye up faro er min sine wer, sisoine: Nahat, Serah, Syama ma Misa. Er vebor ansinekam Esau swa vye Basmat kpu vyesiri.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Er min sine wer sirya Esau kpu vyesi ro swa vyedi venirve Oholibama, Ana inai vyedi, sisoine: Yeus, Yaelam ma Korah. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Er vebor ansine kam sirya Esau kpu vyesiri.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Seir kpu vyesi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:38-42">1Taw. 1:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20-21" />Kawasa supri mankun vekain ro sup Edom,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:20-21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seir inido snonsnon vepon ro sup mnuk Edom.</char></note> sinido Seir snon Hori kpu vyesirya. Er ansine sisoine: Lotan, Syobal, Sibeon, Ana, Disyon, Eser ma Disyon. Sinido snonvukor ro er ansine.<verse eid="GEN 36:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Lotan irya up ro er Hori ma Heman. (Lotan srar vyedi isoine Timna.)<verse eid="GEN 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Syobal inido up ro er sine, sisoine: Alwan, Manaha, Ebal, Syefo ma Onam.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Sibeon ismai romawa snon ri suru, susoine, Aya ma Ana. (Ana iso vesrow war mkamor vesam na ro maper, fafisu myam warek keledai kmar vyesi.) <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Ana romawa vyedi isoine: Disyon ma inaiya isoine Oholibama. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Disyon romawa vyesi sisoine Hemdan, Esyban, Yitran ma Keran.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Eser romawa vyesi sisoine: Bilhan, Saawan ma Akan.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Disyon romawa vyesuya suiso suine, Us ma Aran<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29-30" />Sine sirya er vebor Hori ro sup Seir, sisoine: Lotan, Syobal, Sibeon, Ana, Disyon, Eser ma Disyon.<verse eid="GEN 36:29-30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wairek vero Seirsya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:43-54">1Taw. 1:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31-39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31-39" />Sine sirya Wairek vekif vave sasoser ro sup Seir ro fafisu wairek no sikif vave sasoser ro Israel vaim, sisoine:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 36:31-39">Bela, Beor romawa vyedi veraker Dinhaba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 36:31-39">Yobab, Sera romawa vyedi veraker Bosra</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 36:31-39">Husyam veraker Teman.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 36:31-39">Hadad, Bedad romawa vyedi veraker Awit (Iso Vemerkar snonkaku Midian sya ro farmamun veba ro sup Moab).</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 36:31-39">Samla veraker Masreka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 36:31-39">Saul veraker Rehobot vero kar marei vebaya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 36:31-39">Baal-Hanan, Akhbor romawa vyedi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 36:31-39">Hadar veraker Pahu (swa vyedi snori Mehetabeel, Matred inai vyedi ma Mesahab kpu vyedi).<verse eid="GEN 36:31-39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40-43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40-43" />Esau irya up ro er vebor Edom, sisoine: Timna, Alwa, Yetet, Oholibama, Ela, Pinon, Kenas, Teman, Mibsar, Magdiel, ma Iram. Er ansine svuk snonsnon sena nap sup fyor skain ro na.<verse eid="GEN 36:40-43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s1">Yusuf ma naek vyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yakub ikenem ro sup Kanaan mov kmar Ishak ikenem ro, <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />ma ine irya fawar vekur Yakub kina vyesi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Fafisu Yusuf, Yakub romawa vyani vye pasibarek samfur eser seser di fik, iwaren kambing domba warpu naek veba vyesi, sisoine Bilha ma Silpa romawa suvesi, Yakub kya vyansuya. Yusuf ikofen vadir ve kmari, naek veba vyansya roi vevyeva sifrur na.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Yakub iswar syadi Yusuf i ro naek min vyesi, snar vye veyaven ro fafisu vye mansar kwar. Ras oso yakub iwan fa sisip syatu vepyum kaku yave Yusuf i.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">orovaido syatu vramin vekwan.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Rofyor naek veba vyansya smam ma Yakub iswar syadi Yusuf i mura simarisen i va ma simewer sakawos pyum yov indi.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Rov oso Yusuf myafu, ma fafis fyawar mafafu anya faro naek veba vyansi, mura naek veba vyansi sembrov nakraf kaku i. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Snar Yusuf fyawar ve si radine, “Indo mkorower! <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Yamafu koisya ri yaf fa kororvos pokem, kniko ido pokem bos ayeja dores avyover. Pokem bos mkovesya sores padadwar pokem bos ayedi ma skunem yov i.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Mura naek veba vyansya sikofen ve i, “Kwara vo wove nari ve wairek ve inko ma nkove manfamyan ve au?” Inja naek veba vyansi sembrov syadi kaku i snar mafafu vyena ma kako wos ikofen na.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Swafo wer ido Yusuf myafu wer, ma fyawar wer ve naek veba vyansi, “Yamafu wer, yamam ori, paeki ma mak samfur seser oser skunem ma svan suba ve aya.”<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Mafu anya fyawari kako ve kmari, inja kmar ikofen ve i, dove, “Mafu risai vera diryani? Kwara vo wove, aya, snami ma naek bansine nkorafa nkokunem nkovan suba ve au?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Yusuf naek veba vyansya sisnesna naduf kaku faro i, imbape kmar ikram ma kyara mafafu anna ro snerido.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Kis. 7:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yusuf vye vevov ma sun i ve Mesir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Ras oso Yusuf naek veba vyansi srave Sikhem fa siwaren sinan kma skovanya kambing ma domba vyesi, <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />inja Yakub ikofen ve Yusuf i, “Rwa ve Sikhem, ve mov naek veba bansya siwaren kambing domba kovansya ro iwa.” Yusuf kyarem, “Kamam na yara.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Kmar dove, “Rwa mam kara pan naek veba bansya kuker kambing domba ansya sisya kuker payamyumke, posa kwaver ma insa wakofen vadir ve aya.” Mura ryir fa Yusuf imbran ro dwas Hebron ryave Sikhem.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Fyoro va ido syuver ro Sikhem. <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />Fafis Yusuf imbran syewar naek veba vyansya mura muma ro maper, isrow kuker snon oso vefuken ve i, “Rosai swewarya?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Yusuf kyarem bei “Naek veba ayesya sisya siwaren kambing ma domba, sinan wafawi mov sisya roya?”<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Snon ani kyarem ve i, “Sibur mov ine kwar. Yamnaf sikofen vo sove ive srave Dotan.” Mura Yusuf iyom naek veba vyansi ra isrow si ro Dotan.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Vyinkwan kaker vo naek veba vyansya smami kwar, inja rya fyanam si vaim, sna wos oser fa smun i ra imar. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Sikofen yaye ve si, “Mkomame,” “Romos vemafafu anya isiyama. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Indo komuni ma kosawen baken vyeja ro war veyer eve warva ine. Nari kokofen vo kove aiwan verafdisya smuni. Komam kara pan rosai nari evesya kuker mafafu vyannani.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Ruben ryower wawos anna, mura vyesewar infa fyaspar Yusuf i. Inja ikofen, “Komun awer i.” <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />“Kosawen monda i ro der war veyer vero maper ine, imboi koprer awer rova komer par awer i.” Ikofen ra dirya snar kyara fasis fa ive fyaspar Yusuf i ma iwan i fa ibur ve rum. <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Fafis Yusuf rya isrow kuker naek veba vyansya kwar ido, naek vyansya sper syatu vepyum kaku vyanya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Syatu vepyum kaku rovaido syatu vramin vekwan.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Insape sismer i ra sisawen i ro der war veyer vesyorya.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Posa skain sanan, fyoro va ido smam kawasa Ismaelsya sisya ro marandan veraker Gilead ma unta sesya sivyawen rampa-rampa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rampa-rampa ido imnisra, ampui, pandemor ma papus rova aikif vediref pyum sna ve aryawin.</char></note> mampasa kif, ma kesi vo ive sra ve Mesir.<figure style="fig" file="HK00037C.TIF" size="col" ref="37:25">Unta vevyawen rampa-rampa</figure> <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Muraido Yehuda ikofen ve naek min vyansya vo dove, “Fainda rosai kosmaiya fyor komun veknik kovanya ma koyofek mamun inenya? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Mkorama kovov i ve kawasa Ismael siya. Kove i ra movo nawer. Snar veknik karyer kovedirya.” Naek vyansya siso wos vyani, <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />ma fafis manfarvyan Ismael sya sunuk, Yusuf veba vyansya sisasyar i ro war veyer vesyor anya ma svov i ve kawasa Ismael ansya kuker kumpan sarak samfur di suru. Muraido snonkaku vefarvyan ansya sun i ve Mesir.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Kis. 7:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Fafis Ruben kyaver ve der war veyer ani ma myam Yusuf isya ro diya va mura pyansawek sansun vyena snar fyafko. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Kyaver ve naek vyansya ma ikofen, “Romawa anya isya ro diwa va! Rosai ive yafrur ro fafis inenya?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Mura skokaruk kambingya posa skosowen Yusuf syatu vyanya ro rik na do. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Insape skun syatu anya ve kma skovanya ma skokofen: “Syatu ine nkosrowi, kamam mamkarapan imbude romawa banya syatu vyediryandi?”<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Yakub myam bavir syatu anya, inja ikofen, “Kaku, ine syatu romawa ayanya vyediri! Aiwan verafdino smuni kwar. Sye, romawa yedi Yusuf imar kwar snar aiwan verafdisya sarek akuki kwar!” <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Yakub pyansawek syatu vyeja ma syansun sansun farbabe. Ras ve ras kyain fyarswar ma myandak romawa vyani. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Romawa vyansya, snon sya ma vin sya srama svuk wos sneprei ve i, fama imnaf siva. Ikofen ra dine, “Nari yafarswar ma yamandak romawa ayedi isof yamar.” Rarirya Yakub vye varop romawa vye Yusuf i vesyakwar.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Swaf anya, ro Mesir, snonkaku Ismael ansya svov Yusuf i faro Potifar i, inido Snon mamun eve vukor ve manfadwaren ro aidoran Firaun vyedi.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s1">Yehuda ma Tamar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Ro fafis anya Yehuda ibur naek vyesya ma vyarek so Hira, snon oso veraker kota Adulam. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Rodiwa sneri pyoser bos kaku faro vinkbor Kanaan oso, kmar snori Sua, inja sufarvuk. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Romawa rak suveja snon dirya, inja kmar nyir i ve Er. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Romawa eve suruya snon dirya kako, inja nyir i ve Onan. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Romawa eve kyorya snon dirya wer, ma snar nyir i ve Syela. Fafis Syela vye veyaven Yehuda isya ro Kesib.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Varpur muma ido Yehuda dun vin oso fa romawa rak vye Er vyuk, vin anya snoriso Tamar. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Er rari vyedi ivarvor fafayava, isof <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> imsor i ma myuni fa imar. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Mura Yehuda ikofen ve Onan i, “Rwamura wun vin kabom veba bedi imar bur ani, ma farvuk kuker i. Wafrur ra dirya yov i, snar swa vyani veknik vyediso au; rarirya nari romawano sisya ve veba bani.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Irya rari vero kawasa Israel sya.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Imbape Onan ifawi nari romawa ansya ido romawa vyesisyava. Inja, rofyor denef kuker vin kabom anya ido isawen dur vyena ra vondi insa nve romawa awer. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Frur evesya anna newar fa <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> imsor kaku, ma myuni kako. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Insape Yehuda ikofen ve imbikin vye Tamar i, dove, “Wabur kaver ve sinan bansya ma wakenem so si rawo romawa yedi Syela iba resari.” Ikofen radirya kuker imkak bude <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> dakmun Syela i ra naek veba vyansuya werdi. Inja Tamar ibur ra ikenem so sinan vyesuya.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Fafis ri veso nande ido, Yehuda swar imar. Fafisu mandak nande kwar Yehuda idif manivov vye Hira i vero Adulam ani fa sura ve Timna, mov domba vyesya skaruk bur sesya ro. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Tamar imnaf abar veyove mambanyor Yehuda ive rya ve Timna fa kyaruk domba vyesya bur sesi. <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />Mura syadwer mar farbabe vyena vo syansun sansun evese na. Ikawef vruri ma varpon vyeja kuker kruven, ma kyain ro kedwai veba ro kota Enaim ro nyan mor veso yov Timna. Tamar ifawi kaku Syela, Yehuda mandaven vefes kawek vyani iba kwar, vesyavo sun i fa vyuk i va kaker.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Fafisu Yehuda myam Tamar i, kyara vo dove vin vevov vinkun dirya, snar ikawef vruri ma varpon vyedi kuker kruven. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Yehuda isnefer i ma ikofen, “Rwama. Ive yenef kuker au,” imboi ifawiva imbikin vyanya irya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Vin anya ifuken, “Rosai nari yasmai ve sasurefya?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Yehuda ikofen wer, “Nari yavuk kambing osero ve au.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Yamarisen, imboi buk royo ma vye avyair vevuk snekyar ve aya isof amber farem kambing wakofenya.<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Yehuda ifuken wer, “Rosai nari yavuk fa vevuk snekyar ve auya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Vin ani kyarem, “Buk muma ve aya, kakop veve irai wasron iya ma ankyon wuf iya.” Muraido Yehuda vyukna raris fararyor vyedi. Insape Yehuda denef kuker i, mura vin ani fyadores. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Tamar ibur ve rum vyeja ma pyer sansun ma kruven vekawef vruri posa syansun mar farbabe vyanna wer.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Fafis ri veso nasyonde, Yehuda iwan manivov vye Hira i fa dun kambing anya mura ve vin ani ma dun kaver roi vebor vyuk kwar fa eve avyair anna, imbape Hira isrow vin anyava. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Hira ifuken ve kawasa Enaimsya, “Mov risai vin vevov vinkundi vovekain ro nyan andir anya ryoroya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Skarem be i, “Vin vevov vinkuno dakro dineva.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Mura Hira ibur kaver ma ikofen faro Yehuda i, “Yasrow vin anyava. Kawasa ansiwa sove, vin vevov vinkunsya oso isya ro diwa vaveri.” <verse eid="GEN 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Inja Yehuda ikofen, “Rarirya ido roi vebor anna nyana mura kwar, imboi insa kosmai wos mamyai awer. Yavesewar fa ive yavak i, fama wasrow vin anyava.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Paek ri kyor nawas ido Yehuda ismai ankinem vekur imbikin vye Tamar i, veyove vyov vinkundi ra fyadores kwar.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Inja Yehuda ikofen, “Mkora mkun vin anya ma mkorap i kuker for ra imar.”<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Rofyor sun ive vandi, Tamar fyarem wos ankinem ve mambanyori radine, “Snonkaku vena roi vebor nane iso vefrur fa yafadoresya. Mkokuvek sewar mansei vena kakop irai sine ma ankyon ine nya.”<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yehuda myambir roi vebor anna mura ikofen, “Vin ani kyaku, snar yave i fa romawa kasun ayani Syela vyukiva.” Inja Yehuda denef kuker Tamar i werva.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Fafisu ive daven romawaya imnis kwar ido insape sifawi romawa vesaper suirya. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Fafisu daven anya ido romawa iya isu vramin vyeja ve vondi, vin veyuf farmyan kapapar anya iserepen vraminya ma fyes kavrai bines verikya ro i. Ma ikofen, “Romawa ine i nari vesasyar veponya.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Imbape romawa anya iyer kaver vramin vyedi, ma romawa suminya iso daven veponya. Muraido vin veyuf farmyan kapapar ani ikofen, “Swamvrav fafayava fafis sweser fa wasasyarya!” Inja mkun vepon anya snir i ve Peres.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya isoine “syeser ve vondi”. </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Insape veknik vyedi vramin vefes kuker kavrai bines verik anya vye veyaven ra varpur. Snonsnon svuk ve i isoine Serah.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya isoine “Fyadameser imnis raris fafisu orisampir”.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s1">Yusuf ma Potifar swari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Fafisu snonkaku Ismaelsya sun Yusuf i ra ro Mesir; svov i faro Potifar, snon mamun eve vukor ve manfadwaren vero Firaun aidoran vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" /><char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> isaramper Yusuf i inja roi vebor ifrur nakam namawes pyum kaku. Vyarek ro amber vye snon Mesir ani rum vyedi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Kis. 7:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Amber ani myam ma <char style="nd">Manseren Allah </char> ifnovek Yusuf i inja fararur vebor Yusuf ifrur na namawes pyum kaku. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Potifar imarisen Yusuf i, inja ikanow i fa duf farmyan vardi i; insape vyuk fa Yusuf fyaduru rum rido ma nana vyenakam. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Fafisu anya veri, Yusuf vyewari <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> vye vok snon Mesir ani kina vyedi ma nana vebor vyenakam, ivye ro rum rido ma yaf vyena. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Roi vebor Potifar nyana ikyar nakam faro Yusuf i. Rarirya Potifar ipok fa kyara user rosai vero rum vyanya werva, iyer monda nanan vyena.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yusuf baken vyedi ipduk ma idoser kaku. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Fafisu ri veso nande ido, Potifar swari, sneri isararan kaku faro Yusuf i, inja dembuk i fa suyenef. <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Imbape Yusuf imewer bos kaku inja ikofen be vin ani, “Yor fakman ro vin amber au, amber Potifar ikyar aya kwar fa yafaduru nana vebor vyena. Ipok kyara royo wer va ro rum vyanine. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Ro rum ine oso fa isyadi Potifar iva, iyer monda aya. Rum ine ma nana vebor vyenakam ikyar na kam kwar faro aya, imboi vin amber auso orovaya snar swa vyediso au. Rariso yave yafrur roi vevyeva ine ma yave sasar faro Allah i?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Potifar swari, ras nakam dembuk Yusuf i vesya kwar, imbape Yusuf imewer bos kaku denef kuker indi.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Ras oso Yusuf syun be rumya dori fa ifrur fararur vyena, fafis anya snonkaku oso isya ro rum anya dori vaveri. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Potifar swar, pyaw Yusuf i ro sansun vyena ma ikofen, “Rwama kuyenef.” Yusuf pyups i posa ifrar ibur ve bondi, imbape sansun vyedi vin ani iserepeni. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Fafisu Potifar swar myam ma Yusuf ifrar ve bondi ma sansun vyani ibur i, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />muraido dor manfamyan vyansya vero vondi sya ve rumya dori ma ikofen, “Mkomam kada! Snon Ibrani swa ayani dun ma ro rum ine anya, ifrur fanor ko. Syun ro sim ayedi ma ive vye sasar aya, imbape yafyow naba i. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Fafisu ryower yafyow naba mura, ifrar ve vondi vo ibur sansun vyedine.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Muraido Potifar swar ikram sansun anya ra isof swar ibur. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Fafis swa vyani ryama kwar, fyawar ve i, ikofen radine, “Snon Ibrani wun ma ro rum ine anya, syun ro sim ayedi ma ive ifrur fanor aya. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Imbape fafis anya yafyow mura, ifrar ve vondi ma ibur sansun vyedine.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Potifar imnaf fawar swar vyena mura imsor fafayava. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Inja iwan fa sfor Yusuf i ma sve i fa syun ro rum sasisen, mov snonkaku wairek kyersisen sya sisya roya. <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Imbape <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> isaramper Yusuf i ma vye syowi pdef i vesya kwar, isof snon vukor ro rum sasisen anya imarisen i.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Kis. 7:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Ikyar snonkaku skersisen ansya faro Yusuf i, ma Yusuf iso vyuk fa vekif fararur vebor ro rum sasisen anyani. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Snon eve vukor ro rum sasisen anya myam warek Yusuf i ro fararur vyenava, snar<char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> isaramper i, isof roi vebor ifrur nakam namawes kuker payamyum.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s1">Yusuf pyer mafu ri suru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Fafisu ri veso nande ido, manfamyan ri suru veyuf farmyan wairek Mesir, susoine manfamyan vefasos aninem ma manfamyan vefasos mamami sufrur sasar ro fararur suvena faro wairek ani. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Muraido Firaun imsor su, <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />inja vye su fa susun ro sim sasisen vero rum snonvukor manfadwaren aidoran wairek vyedi, mov Yusuf sisisen i ro. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Sukain fyoro ro rum sasisen ani, ma snonvukor manfadwaren aidoran wairek anya iwan fa Yusuf duf farmyan su.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Rov oso manfamyan vefasos aninemya ma manfamyan vefasos mamamiya sumafu vesisye. Imbape mafafu suvannane namnis ra mov oserva. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Arwori fyas ido Yusuf ryakaki su, mboi myam ido sufafardun fafayava. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Inja ifuken, “Rosai evewar mumam saswar ro mun arwo inenya?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Sukarem be i, “Rovanja numafu, imboi snonkakuyo fa nari pyer mafafu annava.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Inja Yusuf ikofen, “Iyer monda Allah i nari vevuk fawawi faro snonkaku fa sper mafafu annane ni. Indo mufawar mafafu muvanna ve aya.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Manfamyan vefasos aninem anya ikofen, “Ro do mafu ayedi, yamam anggur knamya ro varpon ayedi. <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />Anggur knam anine vye snaw ri kyor. Ram vyena insape nkakyei babo, pampen vyena nkambreres ma ne bon veyapar kaku. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Fafisu anya yuf syobis aninem Firaun vyedi, inja yapauk anggur bon ansya fa yakafos ro syobis Firaun vyanya, posa yavuk syobis anya faro Firaun i.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Yusuf ikofen ve i, “Per vyedi ryadine: Snaw ri kyor anskoiya isoine ras ri kyor. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Ro ras ri kyor ine Firaun nari isasyar au bur rum sasisen, nari vyuk fakamaman ve au ma nari vyuk fa wakif kaver fararur bani. Nari wakif syobis aninem wairek vyani ma wuf farmyan i imnis ras vepondi. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Imboi waswarepen aya fyor wakenem pyum kwarya. Wakofen vadir ro venyanem aya ine ve Firaun i, insa fyaspar aya bur rum sasisen ine. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Snar, ras nawara sfor aya ma sun aya ve women ro sup Ibrani ma ro sup Mesir ine yafrur sasarova efnai vedar sve aya fa yasun ro rum sasisen ine.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Fafis manfamyan vefasos mamami anya imnaf per vero mafu anya ipyum kaku muraido, ikofen faro Yusuf i, “Yamafu kako radine, Yasor aram mamami ri kyor ro vruri. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Aram vero boya iser mamami syos min di veso faro Firaun i, vape man sya sirwai ma san mamami anna.”<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yusuf kyarem be i, “Ine irya per ro mafu bani: Aram ri kyor anya irya ras ri kyor. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Ras ri kyor wer Firaun nari iwan snonkakuno fa skaruk sasukor bedi insape skaf baken bedi ro adir oso, ma mansya nari san kraf bena.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Ras ri kyor ve varponya irya ras swarapepen Firaun vye veyavenya, inja ifrur munara veba kaku faro faker vyansi. Vyuk sasoser fa manfamyan vefasos aninem ma manfamyan vefasos mamami sisasyar su ro rum sasisen ma sun su ve varpon faker vyansi. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Manfamyan vefasos aninem anya vyuk fa duf kaver fararur vepon vyanya. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Imbape manfamyan vefasos mamami anya iwan fa smuni ra imar. Nane kam namnis raris mov Yusuf ikofen kwar raya. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Imbape Manfamyan vefasos aninem anya iwasen Yusuf i werva. Vye fnder bos kaku i.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s1">Yusuf pyer Firaun mafu vyena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Pasivarek ri suru suyande ido, Firaun myafu isya dores ro marei veba Nil andirya. <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />Kniko ido Sapi ri fik vedoser ma vepnok kaku ma kif sesya sisnaper, sisasyar ro marei veba anya dori ma san avris ro andirya. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Swafo wer ido sapi ri fik saksasyar kako; sapi ansine skakor ma kifsya sikpanepen korsya. Sapi vekakor ansine sores ro ris sapi bedoser ansya ro marei veba anya andirya. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Posa ido sapi vekakor ansya sanpres sapi vedoser ansi. Mura Firaun vyir ro anenef vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Raimnai denef kaver ma myafu wer. Ro mafu eve suru ine myam pokem mor ri fik vekraf ma vepnok kwar skur kam ro kapaw oser.<figure style="fig" file="HK00099C.TIF" size="col" ref="41:5">Pokem</figure> <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Myam wer ido pokem mor ri fik eve pis ma vemaryoi snar wamurem veso skur ro kapaw oser. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Pokem mor eve pis ansya soren pokem mor ri fik vepnok ansya. Firaun vyir ro anenef vyedi ma vyavir kaku, ine yamafu. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Arwo fyas ido Firaun vye virvar, inja iwan fa sor snonkaku vena aryawin bekinsasor ma vena mon vero sup Mesirsya. Insape fyawar mafu vyanya faro si, imbape oserova veri fa pyer mafu vyanna.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:2">Dan. 2:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Manfamyan vefasos aninem faro Firaun, ikofen faro i, “Amber yedi, rasine yakofen vadir yasasar snar yave fnder roi oser. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Fafisu veyande kwar amber warmomen fafayava faro manfamyan vefasos mamami ma kako faro women bedi aya, isof ro kwersisen nu ro rum sasisen snon eve vukor ro manfadwaren aidoran wairek rum vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Rov oso numafu ma mafafu nuvena roi nkurna nave sisye. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Romawa snonkbor Ibrani oso isya so nu ro diwa. Romawa snonkbor anine Potifar manfamyan vyedirya. Nufawar mafafu nuvena faro i, ma ikofen badir roi vekur mafafu anna ni. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Rarirya nakame namnis raris rosai ikofen na isoine: Amber kwaver aya ve fararur vepon ayani, imboi manfamyan vefasos mamami anya mun i fa imar.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Muraido Firaun iwan fa sun Yusuf i, ma fafisu anya veri sisasyar i ro rum sasisen. Yusuf ikapnik urvur ma fyarwe sansun vyena, insape rya ve varpon Firaun i. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Firaun dawos faro i, “Yamafu, imbape snonkakuyo fa pyer mafafu annava. Snonkaku sikofen vair ve aya, sove au kada nari per mafafu.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Yusuf kyarem, “Ayava, wairek ayedi, imboi Allah I nari vevuk kankarem vekaku faro wairek au.<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Posa Firaun ikofen,” Yamafu yores ro marei veba Nil andirya. <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />Sapi ri fik vepnok kaku ma kif vesnaper sisasyar ro marei veba anya, ma san avris ro andirya. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Fyoro va Sapi ri fik vekakor ma kif sesya sikpan epen kor sya saksasyar wer. Ro sup Mesir ine yakmam sapi vevyeva no fa sradisyava. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Sapi vekakor ansya san pres sapi ri fik vepnok ansi. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Imbape rariryano sapi vekakor ansya skakor pdef. Inja yavir ro anenef yedi. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Raimnaido yenef kaver ma yamafu wer, yamam pokem mor ri fik sikraf ma sipnok kaku sisur kam ro kapaw oser. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Pokem mor ri fik sisur kako ro kapaw oser imboi skafsos ma sve pis monda snar wamurem veso ifrur fa smaryoi. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Pokem mor ri fik eve pis ansya soren pres pokem mor ri fik bepnok ansi. Yafawar mafu ayesuine faro snonkaku vekinsasor sya imbape oserova veri fa pyer mafu ansuine.<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Yusuf ikofen faro Firaun i, “Mafu ansuya susmai kam wos oser; Allah ikofen badir faro wairek ayedi au, rosai nari Ifrurya. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Sapi ri fik vepnok ansya simnis pasibarek ri fik, ma pokem mor bepyum sya kako pasibarek ri fik; sumnis kame. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Sapi vekakor, vesasyar ma pokem mor vekafsos ma eve pis snar wam veso ro sup ve ursva fyasnai vadir fafisu basbiserya nari myun pasibarek ri fik. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Raris women bedi yakofen faro wairek ayedi au, Allah fyasnai vadir faro wairek ayedi au rosai nari Ifrurya. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Pasibarek ri fik vefo kuker anvepokem nari ryama ro sup Mesir. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Posa, pasivarek ri fik vefo kuker basbiser nari dakrama, ma fafisu vefo kuker anvepokem anya nari sve fnderi snar basbiserya ibakaku isof ro sup ine isyorpnas kaku ma myase. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Posa wer ido basbiser anya vyedar anvepokem ro sup Mesir anya naso naisya nvadirva snar basbiser anya imsinba. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Wairek ayedi mafu ve rarwan ri suru, irya vyadir roi evesya anna Allah vye asas na kwar ma rarirya fyoro va nari Allah Vye imnis na.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />Rarirya wairek ayedi ivye kada kwinfir snonkaku veswar nanem ma vefirnanemo raimnaido buk faro i papoik fa vyuki fyasos sup ine. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34-35" />Wairek ayedi wakanow manfamyan onower kako, ma buk farosi papoik fa siryur var rarwas rim ro aninek pokem ro pasibarek ri fik fafisu anya ipokem, posa sikram si ro kota-kota na ma siwaren warek si. <verse eid="GEN 41:34-35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Pokem ansya sirya fasasos anan ro fafisu basbiser nari vemun pasivarek ri fik ro sup Mesir. Rarirya kawasa veborsya nari simar snar basbiser anyava.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Firaun ikanow Yusuf i fa vye faker wairek ve i ro Mesir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Firaun ma faker vyansya kam simarisen Yusuf au vyanna. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Muraido ikofen faro faker vyansya, “Nari kosmai snonkaku veseyo va fa imnis Yusuf i, snar Rur Allah vyedi verfakin inya.” <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Inja Firaun ikofen faro Yusuf i, “Allah ikofen vadir roi vebor nane kam faro au, rarirya fawawi nanem ma kakara vepyum bena oso fa isyadi au va. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Nari yakanow au fa be faker wairek ve aya, ma kawasa sya kam nari skunem ma sisoyuser wos bena. Yemir monda ayaiso vekaki syadi auya.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:10">Kis. 7:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 41:40" /><verse number="41-42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41-42" />Posa ro diya Firaun pyanar bur vrapar vyedi sarak vrampin eve fasfas kakop vave sasoser Mesirya ma isyuni ro Yusuf vrapar vyeja vo ikofen, “Kuker sarak vrampin ine, yakanow au fa be faker wairek ve aya ro sup Mesir kasiper.” Vyuk kako syatu worem vemawai kakuya fa syansun, ma irai brawen sya fa isron ro sasukor vyedi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:41-42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:29">Dan. 5:29</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 41:41-42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Ramnai Firaun vyuk kereta wairek eve suruya fa kyain ro ma dun farma i, ma manfadwaren wairek vyesya simbran ro varpon kereta anya vo svaryas, “Are mkokanden! Mkovuk nyan! Mkovuk nyan!” Rarirya Yusuf vye ve kanow fa vye faker wairek be Firaun i ro sup Mesir kasiper. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Firaun ikofen faro Yusuf i, “Ayaiso eve wairek ma yavuk sasoser insa ro sup Mesir kasiper snonkaku osero vaveri fa ipok ifrur royo rofyor kwarem vaim.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45-46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45-46" />Posa Firaun vyuk snonsnon Mesirya faro Yusuf i, isoine Safnat-Paaneah. Vyuk kako Asnat, Potifera eve imam ro Heliopolis inai vyedi fa Yusuf nya ve swa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 41:45-46">Yusuf ras kenem vyeja vye pasibarek samfur di kyor ro fafisu ifararur faro wairek Mesir. Rarirya Yusuf isasyar ro aidoran Firaun vyeja ma iyar sup Mesir kasiper. <verse eid="GEN 41:45-46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Pasibarek ri fik fafisu anvepokem anya, sapropya idufen ma isasyar anvepokem. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Yusuf iryur pokem sya posa ikram si ro sar vero kota-kota na. Pokem sinek ro yaf vero kota anna vandivar na ikram si ro sar vyawes kwar ro kota anna. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Pokem iryur ansya sibor rape isof Yusuf kyor napok siva snar barborya imnis yenmorem ro yendisare.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Fafisu basbiserya myun vaim, Yusuf swa vye Asnat i ikapar romawa snon di suru. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Yusuf ikofen, “Allah ifrur fa yave farander marindi vebor venyanem aya, ma faro naek srar ayesi vero kamam rum vyedi.” Rarirya romawa rak vyanya nyir ive “Manasye”.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ro wos Ibraniya isoine “ifrur fa yavefnder”.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Ikofen wer Romawa, “Allah vyuk romawasya ve aya ro fafisu ayaisya ro awau ananjar.” Inja nyir i ve “Efraim.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">snonsnon ine ryok imnis wos Ibrani isoine “vyuk romawa”.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Pasibarek ri fik vefo kuker anvepokem ro sup Mesir anya isyonde. <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />Posa pasibarek ri fik basbiserya ifyafer, raris rosai Yusuf ikofen kwar. Basbiserya myun ro sup swan kasiper, imbape ro sup Mesir fasasos rovean naisya kaker.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:11">Kis. 7:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Fafisu kawasa Mesir sisya ro basbiser, sor rovean faro Firaun i. Mura Firaun iwan fa kawasa ansya sra ve Yusuf i ma sifrur rosai Yusuf nari ikofen faro si.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:5">Yoh. 2:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Fafisu basbiser anya iba kaku ma iryer sup anya kasiper, Yusuf vyas sayar veser pokem anna ma vyov pokem ansya faro kawasa Mesir ansya. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Kawasa vero sup swan kasiper srave Mesir fa skoves pokem ro Yusuf i, snar basbiser anya iba namsinba ma myun ro mov-mov nakame.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s1">Yusuf naek vyesi srave Mesir fa skoves pokem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Fafisu Yakub ryower pokemsya sisya ro Mesir, muraido dawos faro romawa vyansya. “Basbiserya myun kwar, inja mkokain awer! <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Yarower pokemsya sisya ro Mesir; Mkora mko koves pokem no insa komar kuker basbiserya nawer.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:12">Kis. 7:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Mura naek ri samfur Yusuf vyansya sra skoves pokem ro Mesir. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Imbape Yakub vyuk fa Benyamin, Yusuf veknik karyer vyanya daksova, snar imkak warek romawa vyanya royo kyur indi.<verse eid="GEN 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Snar basbiser ro sup Kanaan, Yakub romawa vyansya kuker snonkaku vesesya sra skoves pokem ro Mesir. <verse eid="GEN 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Vevov pokem faro kawasa vebor veraker sup nakam isoine Yusuf, faker wairek Mesir ani. Rarirya naek veba vyansya srafa skunem svan suba ro varpon vyedi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Skunem ra varpon sena nakyaren sapropya.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Fafisu Yusuf myam naek veba vyansya, ifawi si, imbape ifrur ve vefawi siva. Ifuken kuker samsam yov naek veba vyansya, “Mko nido snonkaku verakero?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Skarem faro Yusuf i, “Nkoine snonkaku Kanaan. Nkorama fa nkokoves rovean.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Yusuf ifawi naek veba vyansya imbape naek veba vyansya sifawi iva. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Mura Yusuf iswar kaver mafafu vyanna vekur naek veba vyansi. Inja ikofen, “Mkoine ma mampaf si mko; mkorama mkomam epen sup nkovedine mov siwaren warekvaya!”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:5-10">SaR. 37:5-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Skokarem faro i, “Orova veri, amber nkovedi au. Nkoine, amber manfyan besi verama vekoves rovean monda. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Nkoine nkove mambekanaek. Nkoine snonkaku vepyum ma veyawos kakaku, ma mampaf si nko va.” <verse eid="GEN 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Yusuf ikofen faro naek veba vyansya, “Mkankar! Mkorama mkomam epen sup nkovedine mov siwaren warekvaya.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Skarem wer, “Nkoine mambekanaek samfur seser di suru, nkonakam sinan kma oser ro sup Kanaan. Naek nkominya imar kwar imboi kasun vepupesya isya so sinan kma inkovedi.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Yusuf dawos wer, “Yakofen kaku, mkoine mampaf si mko. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Ive yasewar fa yafawi mkawos kakuke rova: Yafores kuker snonsnon wairek Mesir, yarir fa mkoburva rofyor vedar kasun vepupes mkovanya mkun i ma ro dine vaim. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Mkowan oso ro fandu mko fa kyaver ra dun i, evese mkoya sisisen mko ro rum sasisen insa yamamkara pan mkawos kaku ke rova, imboi orovaido, kuker snonsnon Firaun i, mkoine mampaf si mko!” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Posa naek Yusuf vyansya sun si ra skersisen si ro rum sasisen ras ri kyor.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Ras eve kyorya Yusuf ikofen faro si, “Ayaine snonkaku veyararyof Allah i. Inja mkofrur rosai nari yakofen faro mko insa mkokenem. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Insa fyasnai vadir mkoine snonkaku veyawos kaku, mkomindi osero nari ismai ro rum sasisen; imboi vesesya sun pokem mkokoves ansya vo sibur ve kina mkovansya kur ine vero basbiser. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Raimnaido mkun kaku vedar vepupes mkovanya ve aya. Irya fyasnai vadir wawos mkovanna nkaku, ma nari smun mko fa mkomarva.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:20">Yusuf naek vyansya sisoyuser wos faker wairek ani. <verse eid="GEN 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Mura skawos yaye ro mankunsko, “Irya vae, kur ine kosmai marindi snar sasar kofrur kwar faro veknik kovanya ro fafisu iwara; dor samsom kaku ve ko vesyavo kovefandun iva. Fafisu anya komam vye kandera ma ifrur saneso kaku. Irya fafis ine kosmai marindi.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Ruben ikofen, “Fafis anya yakofen bae, yove kove i ra movo nawer. Imbape mkorower ayava. Inja ras ine kosmai munsu ro veknik kovanya marmar vyedi.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:21-22">SaR. 37:21-22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Yusuf ifawi wawos skovena, imbape naek vyansya sifawiva, snar skawos yov Yusuf i insape manperwosya fyarwe wos skovanna faro Yusuf i. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Yusuf ryower wawos annakam raposa syun bur naek vyansya, ma kyanes. Fafisu sneri iko kwar, kyaver faro naek vyansya, ma iwan fa sun Simeon i fa siyavek i ro varpon naek vyesi.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yusuf naek vyansya skaver ve Kanaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Yusuf iwan fa manfamyan vyesya siser inoken naek veba vyansya sena kuker pokem fnovek kumpan vevak pokem ansya ro inoken sena oser ve oser. Yusuf iwan wer fa svaryam si kuker rovean ro marandan barbur sedi. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Inoken anna sikanow na fa nbarek ro keledai ansya bo ra posa, simbran sibur. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Mun rov yanido, ro mov seryar fa senef roya, Yusuf naek vyansya suminya vyas inoken vyeja ma ive fyan keledai vyedi. Fafisu vyas inoken vyanya, myam kumpan vevak pokem vyansya sisya svarek ro pokemsya bonsi. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Muraido ikofen faro naek min vyansya, “Mkomam kada, kumpan ayansya skaver! Sisya ro inoken ayanya dori!” Sikam sisyasen ma sve virvar, posa sawos yaye faro mankunsi, “Rosaiso Allah ifrur faro ko nine?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Fafisu skokaver ra ro Kanaan, skofawar roi vebor skosrow kwar anna faro sinan kma skovani. Skofawar radine, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Faker wairek Mesir dawos darmomen faro nko, ma dove nko ido mampaf vemam epen sup vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Nkokarem faro i, ‘Nkoine ma snonkaku vepyum si nko, mampaf si nko va. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Nkoine mambekanaek samfur seser di suru, nkonakam sinan kma oser, ma naek kasun inkoveja oser imar kwar, imboi vedar vepupesya isya so sinan kma nkovedi ro Kanaan.’ <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Faker wairek Mesir anya ikofen, ‘Ive yasewar fa yafawi kaku, mkawos kaku ke rova: Rarirya mkomin oso kyain; vese mkoya mkun pokemno vo mkobur ve kina mkovena fafisu ine vero basbiser. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Mkokaver muma ido mkun vedar vepupes mkovanya, irya yafawi kaku mampaf si mkova, imboi snonkaku bepyum si mko. Inja nari yakaver naek mkove yakarwarek anya faro mko, insape yavuk fa mkokain ma mkove mkei fa mkofarvavyan ro sup ine.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 42:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Posa rodiya fafisu skokofek inoken na fa nvebei skomam kumpan sya sisya skaver ro inoken skovanna oser-oser. Fafis skomam kumpan ansya mura Yakub fnovek romawa vyansi simkake. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Posa Yakub ikofen, “Mko vedar fa romawa ayesya sve fromo kame. Yusuf imar kwar, Simeon kyaver va, ma fafisu ine ive mkun Benyamin i wer. Marindi vekur aya ine ifnakva!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Ruben ikofen be kmari, “Kamam, rwir Benyamin i ve aya, nari yun kaver i ve kamam au, imboi orova ido, Kamam mun sadwer romawa snon ayansuya.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Imbape Yakub ikofen, “Orova, na mkun Benyamin iva; Naek eba vyeja imar kwar, fafis ine derer monda vedawerya. Imbude royo kyur i ro nyan di bori. Ayaine yave mansar kwar, inja marindi mkofrur yov ayanine nari dun aya ve marmar.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s1">Yusuf naek vyesi kuker Benyamin i srave Mesir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1-2" />Basbiser vemun anya imsinba ro sup Kanaan, fafisu Yakub kina vyansya san pres pokem sun ro Mesir ansya ra sivro, mura Yakub ikofen faro romawa vyansya, “Mkora mura wer ve Mesir fa mkokoves pokem no veko.”<verse eid="GEN 43:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Mura Yehuda ikofen faro i, “Faker wairek Mesir dawos pakrek kaku ve inko vo dove nkun vedar kasun nkovanya va ido nkopok fa nkores ro varpon vyejava. <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Kamam wamarisen fa vedar kasun nkovanya iso ido, nari nkora nkokoves rovean no. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Imboi kamam wamarisen fa Benyamin iso nkova ido, na nkorava, snar faker wairek Mesir anya ikofen vo dove vedar kasun nkovanya isova ido nkopok nkores ro varpon vyeja vaveri.”<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Yakub ikofen, “Mkofrur fa saneri ipreiva, snar mkovadir faro i vo mkove mkona vedar kasun yandi.”<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Skokarem faro i, “Snonkaku anya ifuken nko vesyakwar ma kako kina kovanine, dove, ‘Sinan kma mkoveja ikenem kaker? Mkona vedar kasuno?’ Inja nkokarem fakfuken vyenakam. Nkofawiva nari iwan fa nkun vedar kasun nkovanya.”<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Mura Yehuda ikofen faro kmari, “Wamarisen fa romawa anya iso, insa nkora mura fasau imbude komindi imar snar basbiser ine ndi. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Ayaiso nari vemam warek i ma eve sano warek i, imboi yun kaver i kuker payamyumba ido kamam buk sasar ve aya ma yavar sasar ine ro ras kenem yedi kasiper. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Rarirya kove yaryerva rirya kada, nari nkora mura rarwan ri suru kwar.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Mura sinan kma skovanya ikofen, “Imbo rarirya ido, mkun nana vepyum kaku ro sup ine, mkoserna ro inoken mkovanna fa ne faferes faro faker wairek Mesir ani: Kesi, roveinem, rampa-rampa ma aibon kemiri ma aibon kenari. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Mkun kako kumpan sya apaper ri suru, snar kumpan mkosrow ro inoken mkovannasya ivye mkokaver si. Imbude srir sasar si ndi. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Mkun veknik mkovanya vo mkokaver fasau. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Ivye kada Allah Vepoik Syadi vyuk fa faker wairek Mesir aniwa sneri so mko ma kyaver Benyamin ma Simeon su. Imboi faro aya, rofyor romawa ayansya ive sidawer bur aya ido, rosai ive yafrurya?”<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Posa Yusuf naek vyansya sun faferes anna ma kumpan apaper ri suru vo sra ve Mesir kuker Benyamin i. Skora ro Mesir kwar ido insape skorafa skores ro varpon Yusuf i. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Fafisu Yusuf myam Benyamin i ma naek veba vyansya mura ikofen faro manfamyan eve vukor ro rum vyani, “Wun snonkaku sine ve rum ayedi. Nari sanan so aya ro mun orikok ine, inja kwaruk rofanfan osero ramnai wakun i.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Manfamyan anya ifrur rosai Yusuf ikofen na ma dun Yusuf naek vyansya ve rum faker wairek vyanya.<verse eid="GEN 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Yusuf naek vyansya simkak kaku fafisu sun sko ve Yusuf rum vyani, skokara radine, “Sun ko ma rodine, snar kumpan kosrow ro inoken kovanna ro fafisu korama vepon anya. Nari sfor ko ramnai sun keledai kovansya posa sna kove women.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Inja, fafis skofanam ve kedwai ro Yusuf rum vyani, skokofen faro manfamyan eve vukor ro Yusuf rum vyani, <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />“Nkor fakman ro amber au, fafisu veyande kwar iyafa nkorama nkokoves roveyan. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21-22" />Fafisu nkobur, ro fyor nkoveryar fa nkenef, nkovas inoken nkovena. Nkomam ido kumpan nkovuki vyak pokem ansya sisya svarek ro pokem syabo. Nkofawi mansei verir kumpan sya ro inoken nkovannani. Kur ine nkun kaver kumpan ansine faro amber au. Ma nkun kako kumpan siyawer fa nkovuki kyoves roveyan.”<verse eid="GEN 43:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Manfamyan anya ikofen, “Mko knon. Mkomkak awer. Allah mkovedi, isoine Allah sinan kma mkovanya isyom ani, I verir kumpan ansya ro inoken mkovanna ni. Vavyak mkovuki vyak pokem ansya yasmai si kwar.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 43:23">Raposa isasyar Simeon i ma dun i ve sko, <verse eid="GEN 43:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Posa dun si fa ssun ro rum. Vyuk war na fa skovuki vyan wemin skovena ma kako roveyan faro keledai skovansi, <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />posa ido, skofasos faferes na fa skovuk faro Yusuf ro fafisu ryave rum ro mun orikokya, snar skomnaf kwar, nari skonan kam so i ro mun orikokya. <verse eid="GEN 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Fafisu Yusuf ryama kwar ro rum ido, naek vyansya svuk faferes na faro i ma skunem ro varpon vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Yusuf ifuken, skoisya kuker payamyumke, ma ikofen, “Mkofawar ve aya kwar, sinan kma mkovedi eve mansar kwar ani. Rariso kuker i? Isya kuker pyum ke?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Skokarem be i, “Manfyan bedi, sinan kma inkovani, isya kuker payamyum” insape skunem svan suba be i.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Rofior Yusuf myam veknik vye Benyamin i mura, ikofen, “Inja, ine vedar kasun mkovedi, mkokofen badir kwar ve aya nanya? Ivye kada Allah vye navye au, romawa yedi.” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Yusuf sneri muk kaku snar sane raro vyena faro vedar kasun vyedi. Indokada sneri idworem ba, inja ibur sko ra syun be sim vyedi ma kyanes. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Posa ipyos mkarui vyena, ramnai fyarmku vo isasyar wer, Yusuf iwan fa sfasos anan ma aninem. <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Yusuf danan ro karabaja iya vardi, ma naek vyansya sanan ro karabaja eveseya. Snonkaku Mesir vero diyansya sakanan ro karabaja eveseya kako, snar smam snonkaku Ibranisya ve snonkaku vekaryonba. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Yusuf naek vyansya sanan ro karabaja vekar mufa ve Yusuf i, skain raris mov sikapar si raya, randak ro romawa rak isof ro romawa vepupes. Fafisu skomam rarwas anya, muraido skomam yaye sko ma skokmome. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Svuk ve sko roveyan vero karabaja Yusuf vyedi, imboi Benyamin i ma ismai rarwas nabor syadi rarwan di rim ro naek veba vyesi. Ramnai san sinem kuker Yusuf i isof sarbor kaku.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s1">Yusuf ifrowes vir naek vyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Posa ido Yusuf ikofen faro manfamyan eve vukor ro rum vyedi, “Mkokafen pokem no ro snonkaku sine rosaser sena ra nafo, mkokafen kaver kumpan sesya ro rosaser veser pokem sanna. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Mkokafen kako syobis sarak ayedi ro rosaser veknik vepos kawek skovedi kuker kumpan vekoves pokem vyesi.” Manfamyan ani ifrur roi ikofen anna. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Meser myas ro arwo primya, manfamyan Yusuf vyansya srir naek vyansya kuker keledai sesya fa sibur. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Skosasyar fa skovinkwan bur kota anya vaim, Yusuf ikofen ve manfamyan eve vukor ro rum vyani, “Waspak fa wayom snonkaku siwara. Wasrow si kwar ido, wakofen be si, ‘Amber ayani ifrur pyum yov mko. Rosai evewari mkofrur vavyeva yov i? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Rosai evewari mkokarau syobis sarak amber ayani vyejani? Syobis anya rosaser amber ayani dinem ro ma vyuk kinsasor kako. Mkofrur sasar veba kaku!’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Fafisu mamfamyan ani isrow kuker Yusuf naek vyansya ido, dawos raris sasoser Yusuf ikofen anna. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Imbape skarem faro i, “Amber, wakofen radirya kukro? Nkofores kaku, nkofrur ra disyava veri! <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Amber wafawi fafisu nkokaver ker Kanaan, kumpan nkosrow ro rosaser veser pokem nkovanna nkokaver si kwar ve amber au. Inja, nari nkokaraw sarak orovaido brawen ro faker wairek Mesir rum vyeja va veri! <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Amber wasrow syobis anya ro nkomindi rosaser vyeja ido, ivye vye vemun ra imar ma nkoinekam nkove manfyan ve amber au.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Manfamyan anya ikofen, “Ipyum; imboi mansei yasrow syobis anya roya, i monda iso eve manfyan ve aya; imboi evese mkoya ivye mkobur mura kwar.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Mura skosabu rosaser skovanna bur keledai skovansya ma skovas rosaser anna. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Yusuf manfamyan vyani kyuvek rosaser anna randak ro romawa rakya isof ro romawa vepupesya, ma syobis anya isrow i ro rosaser Benyamin vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Benyamin naek eba vyansya skarsosen kaku inja spansawek sansun sena. Sivyawen kaver rosaser sanna ro keledai sansya vo skaver ve kota.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Fafis Yehuda ma naek vyansya sisya kwar ro Yusuf rum vyanya, Yusuf isya kaker ro diya. Mura skunem svan suba ro varpon vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Inja Yusuf ikofen faro si, “Rosai evedar mkofrur ra dinenya? Mkofawi vae, ayaine ma nari yafawi frur mkovena vevyevana kuker kinsasor?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Mura Yehuda ikofen, “Rosai ive nkokofen faro amber au raya? Mov risai ive nkosampum ma nkovesano warek mankun inko raya? Sasar inkovena Allah vyasna ra nvarek pardei kwar. Inja ivye kwar, nkoine kam nkove manfyan ve amber au warpu naek kasun nkovani mkosrow syobis aninem anya roya.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Yusuf kyarem ve si, “Orova! Yamewer yafrur ra diryandi! Imboi mansei syobis aninem ayanya sisrowi roya i monda eve manfyan ve ayani. Evese mkoya ivye mkobur kaver ve sinan kma mkovanya kuker aski.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehuda vye sano warek Benyamin i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Yehuda imbran ve varpon fanam Yusuf i ma ikofen, “Yor fakman ro amber au, wamarisen ido buk swaf ve aya fa yawawos wer ve amber ayanawi. Wamsor awer aya; Amber au wamnis kaku ra wairek Mesir mankundi. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Amber wafuken kwar ve inko, ‘Sinan kma mkovedi isya kaker ma mkona naek o wer fa isya?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Nkokarem radine, ‘inkoveja vye mansar kwar ma veknik karyer nkovedi vye veyaven fafisu vye mansar bos kaku. Naek veba karyer vena sna oser kuker veknik nkovani imar kwar, inja kur ine demir monda vekenem kaker, inja kma inkovani vye syowi vye mamin kaku i.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Amber wawan fa nkun i muma insa amber wakmam i, <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />inja nkokarem be amber au vo nkove; veknik nkovanya nari isasyar vinkwan bur kma inkovanyava, snar rofyor isasyar bur kma nkovanya ido, sinan kma inkovanya nari imar. <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Mura ido amber wakofen be inko vo wove, ‘Veknik kasun inkovani nkuni fa iso nkova ido, nkopok nkomam varpon bejava.’<verse eid="GEN 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />Fafisu nkokaver ve sinan kma nkovani, nkove vadir roi amber wakofen anna. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Swafo wer ido sinan kma inkovani iwan fa nkora muma wer fa nkokoves rovean no. <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Nkokarem be i, ‘Na nkora murava, snar nkun veknik nkovanyava ido nkopok nkores ro faker wairek Mesir varpon vyedi. Veknik nkovanya iso ido insape nkora mura.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Sinan kma inkovanya ikofen, ‘Mkofawi kwar Rahel, swa ayani ikapar romawa ri suru monda. <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Romawa veponya ibur aya kwar. Aiwan verafdi no smun i kwar, snar isof ro ras ine yamam i werva. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Inja mkun romawa kasun ine wer bur aya, ma royo kyur inido, marindi mkofrur yov aya ine dun marmar ve aya, snar yave mansar kwar.’”<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30-31" />Inja Yehuda ikofen wer ve Yusuf i, “Fafis manfyan bena nkokaver ve sinan kma nkovani ma veknik nkovani ibur so inkova ido, sinan kma inkovani nari imar. Snar veknik nkovani evewar sinan kma inkovani ismai papoik fa ikenem kakerya. Ivye wer ido sinan kma inkovanya vye mansar bos kaku inja marindi nkofrur yov i anine nari vyewar marmar vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 44:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Ramnai ido, manfyan yaine yawos namuk kwar faro sinan kma nkovani, ayaine yave sasuref sadwer i. Yakofen faro kamami radine, rofyor yun kaver kasun inkovanya ve kamam iva ido, yakamar sasar veba ine ro ras kenem ayena kasiper. <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Inja, manfyan yaine, yor ve amber au, buk fa yavarek ro dine fa yave manfyan ve amber au sadwer veknik nkovani; imbo ivye iso naek veba vyansya vo ibur. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Mov risai nari yawos ve kamami raya rofyor veknik nkovanine isova? Manfyan yaine yasambrav va fa yamam marindi nari venyanem sinan kma nkovanyani.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Yusuf vye vadir mankundi faro naek vyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Fafisu anya Yusuf sneri idworem ba kwar ro varpon faker vyansi. Inja iwan si fa sisasyar bur sim anya insa ikofen vadir ve naek vyansya, inido manseirya kaku.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:13">Kis. 7:13</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Faker vyansya sisasyar bur sim anya posa ido Yusuf kyanes naba kaku, isof snonkaku Mesir vero simya vandirisya srower, ma roi evesya anya vye abar kako ra ro Firaun Aidoran vyani. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Yusuf ikofen faro naek vyansi, “Ayaine Yusuf! Kamam ikenem kaker?” Naek vyansya sikandor ma simkak namsinba inja skarem faro iva. <verse eid="GEN 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Mura Yusuf ikofen be si; “Mkorama mkosnefer ve aya.” Inja simbran fa sfanam i, ma ikofen wer, “Aya Yusuf, mkovov kwar ve Mesir ani.” <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Mkomkak awer ma mkofafko awer mankun mko snar mkovov aya kwar. Snar Allah mankundi iso veyun aya ma ro dine fa yapon mko insa kawasa sibor sismai fadaduru. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Kur ine insape pasivarek eve suru ro basbiser veba ine, ma nari pasivarek ri rim wer snonkaku sya som sker ma sink va. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />“Allah dun aya kwar fa yapon mko insama mkosmai faspar kuker nyan vefrur kanandor ine, ma insama mkosmai faduru ro kenem mkovena, mko ma kpu mkovesyakam. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Inja, mko vefnaifa yarama ro dinenyava, imboi Allah mankundi. I vevuk fa yasmai nasan vekaki ro wairek Mesir. Yasmai kayaryar fa yakif vave sasoser ro rum rido vyeja kasiper ma ro sup Mesir kasiper.<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />Inja mkosamberen, mkokaver faro kamami ma mkokofen yov i, Yusuf, romawa bani, ikofen radine, ‘Allah vyuk fa yave snopor ro sup Mesir kasiper; Mkorama fasaw kaku.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:9-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Kis. 7:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Kamam nari kwain ro sup Gosyen, fanam aya -- kamam au, kuker romawa kpu, domba, kambing, sapi, ma roi vebor kamam nwana. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Kamam kwain ro sup Gosyen ido, nari yafaduru au. Snar basbiserya isyeser vaim, myun pasi varek ri rim kaker inja nari yafaduru kamam au ma kina vebor ma rofanfan ansine insa mkananjar awer.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Kis. 7:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Yusuf ikofen wer, “Kur ine mkomam karyer, naba syadi Benyamin au, kaku ayairi Yusuf i. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Mkokofen faro kma kovani, aya vekif nasan ma vesmai papoik veba kaku ro dine, ro Mesir, ma mkofawar rosai mkomam kwar nane faro i. Insape mkun fasau i muma.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Raposa ido Yusuf ma Benyamin sufor yaye su vo sukanes. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Ramnai, fafisu kyanes kaker, Yusuf fyor naek veba vyansyakam ma isyumsi. Posaido insape naek vyansya skain sfawar kayam kuker i.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Rofyor Firaun ma kawasa vero aidoran vyedi simnaf abar vekur Yusuf naek vyansi srama, inja Firaun i ma faker vyansya sakmarisen kako. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Mura Firaun ikofen faro Yusuf i, “Wawan fa naek bansya sivyawen gandum no ro keledai sesya ma sibur kaver ve Kanaan. <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />Insamaido sun kmami ma kina vyesyakam fa sibur muma, nari yavuk vesi saprop vepyum kaku ro sup Mesir, ma nari sismai nana ma anvepokem ro saprop vemafen ani. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Wawan fa sun mura kako kereta faro vin svuksya ma romawa kasunsya, ma svuki dun kako kma skovani. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Siswaruser awer roi vebor siburna, snar roi vebor vepyum kaku ro sup Mesir kasiper nari sna na.”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Romawa Yakub vyansi sifrur raris mov Firaun dawos raya. Yusuf vyuk vesi kereta ri veso, raris Firaun mov ikofen raya, ma vyaryamsi kuker rovean ro marandan sedi. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Vyuk vesi kako sansun vebabona oser-oser, vape faro Benyamin i vyuk ve i kumpan sarak usin di kyor ma sansun vebabona min di rim. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Fyarem kako keledai snomansya samfur ve kmari veyun roi vebor vepyum kaku ro sup Mesir, ma keledai vinsya samfur wer fa sun pokem, mamami ma rovean evesena fa san ro marandan sedi ve sup Mesir. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Posa Yusuf ryir naek vyansya fa sibur kaver, ma danun faro si, “Mkomsor yaye awer mko ro marandan.”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Inja sisasyar bur Mesir ma skaver ve sup Kanaan faro Yakub, kma skovani. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Skokofen faro kma skovani, “Yusuf ikenem kaker! Iso eve snopor ro sup Mesir kasiper.” Yakub ryower abar anna imboi sneri iprim monda, snar ikyar ro sikofen nava.<verse eid="GEN 45:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Vape fafisu skofawar rosai Yusuf ikofen ve sko anna, ma fafisu myam kereta Yusuf fyarem fa veyuni ve Mesir, insape sneri kpis ma ikyare. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Ikofen, “Aroro Yusuf romawa ayani ikenem kaker! Irya monda yawasen ro sanerido! Yasawon kaku insa yara fasaw veri fa yasrow kuker i fyor yamar vaim.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s1">Yakub ma Kina Vyesya sfaryan ve Mesir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Yakub imbran ve Mesir kuker nana vebor vyenakam. Ryaro Bersyeba ido, ikun farsarser faro Allah kmar Isak isyom anya. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Fafisu rovya, Allah ikofen faro i ro mamam radine, “Yakub, Yakub!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">Yakub kyarem, “Ayaisine, Manseren.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Allah ikofen, “Ayaine Allah, Allah kmam isyom ani. Wamkak awer fa rwa ve Mesir. Nari Yavuk fa kpu besya sve er veba ro diwa. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Nari Yambran so au ve Mesir, ma kako nari Yun kaver kpu besya fa skaver ve sup ine. Yusuf nari isya ro ris bedi fafisu marmar bedi ryama.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Posa Yakub ibur Bersyeba. Romawa vyansya sikanow Yakub i kuker vin svuk sya ma romawa sesyakam ro kereta wairek Mesir fyarem anna. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Skun kako rofanfan ma nana vebor skosmai kwar ro Kanaan, ramnai skora ve Mesir. Yakub dun kpu vyesya kame, sisosine<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Kis. 7:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />kpu vyesyakam snon ma vin.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Yakub romawa vyesi veso ve Mesir sisosine: <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Ruben, romawa rakya; romawa vyesya: Henokh, Palu, Hesron ma Karmi. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Simeon; romawa vyesya: Yemuel, Yamin, Ohad, Yakhin, Sohar ma Saul. (Saul inido Simeon swa vye vin Kanaanya romawa vyedirya.) <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Lewi; romawa vyesya: Gerson, Kehat ma Merari. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Yehuda; romawa vyesya: Syela, Peres ma Serah, Yehuda romawa min vyesya, sisoine Er ma Onan sumar ro Kanaan. Peres romawa vyesya: Hesron ma Hamul. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Isakhar; romawa vyesya: Tola, Pua, Ayub ma Simron. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Sebulon; romawa vyesya: Sered, Elon, ma Yahleel. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Sine kame romawa snon Lea ikapar ve Yakub i ro Padan-Aram, ma ikapar kako inai vin oser venirve Dina. Rarirya kpu Yakub vyesya ro Lea i barborya samfur di kyor seser di kyor.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Gad; romawa vyesya: Sifyon, Hagi, Syuni, Esbon, Eri, Arodi ma Areli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Asyer; romawa vyesya: Yimna, Yiswa, Yiswi ma Beria kuker srar skovedi Serah. Beria romawa vyesuya susoine Heber ma Malkiel. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Kpu samfur seser di wonem ansine Yakub ismai ro Silpa, isoine vinfamyan Laban vyuk faro inai vye Lea i.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Rahel nya romawa ri suru ve Yakub i, suiso Yusuf ma Benyamin. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Ro Mesir Yusuf nya romawa ri suru, suiso Manasye ma Efraim sna suvedi Asnat, isoine Potifera eve imam ro Heliopolis inai vyedi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:50-52">SaR. 41:50-52</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Benyamin; romawa vyesya: Bela, Bekher, Asybel, Gera, Naaman, Ehi, Ros, Mupim, Hupim ma Ared. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Snonkaku samfur seser di fyak ansya sirya Yakub romawa ma kpu vyesi ro swa vyedi Rahel i.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Raimnaido Dan; romawa vyeja Husim. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Naftali; romawa vyesya: Yahseel, Guni, Yeser ma Syilem. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Snonkaku ri fik anskoine romawa ma kpu Yakub ismai ro Bilha, vinfamyan Laban vyuk faro inai vye Rahel i.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Yakub kpu vyesya vera ve Mesir barborya samfur di wonem seser di wonem, imbikin vyesya saksun ba. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Yusuf nya romawa ri suru ro Mesir, rarirya Yakub kina vyesi vero ro sup Mesir barborya samfur di fik.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Kis. 7:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakub ma kina Vyesi ro Mesir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Yakub iwan Yehuda i fa imbran vepon fa dor Yusuf i insa isrow kuker kmari ro Gosyen. Fafisu skosuver ro Gosyen, <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yusuf dek kereta vyeja ma isrow kuker kmari ro diya. Fafis susrow su nanya, Yusuf dawer epen kmar sasuri ma kyanes kawan kaku. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Yakub ikofen faro Yusuf i, “Kur ine yafasos fa yamar, snar yasrow au ma yamam au kwar ma yafawi ausya wakenem kaker.”<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Posa Yusuf danun faro naek vyesya ma naek min evesesya, “Yara fasaw kaku fa yakofen vadir ve Firaun i insa ifawi naek ayesya ma kamam kina vyesyakam vekain ro sup Kanaan srama kwar. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Nari yakofen vadir kako mko nido manfarandous domba ma sapi, ma mkun kako rofanfan ma roivebor mkovena kam kwar. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Rofyor Firaun dor mko fa ifuken fararur mkovena ido, <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />mkokofen badir ve i, mkonido manfarandous vemamwarek rofanfan fyor mkobavaya isof kir ine, imnis kpu mkovesi. Rarirya nari iwan mko fa mkokain ro sup Gosyen.” Yusuf ikofen radirya snar manfarandous kambing ma domba irya roi vefrur ayin kaku faro kawasa Mesir sya.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="s1">Yakub rya isrow kuker Firaun i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1-2" />Posa ido, Yusuf dun ro naek vyesya min di rim fa sra sisrow kuker Firaun i. Ikofen vadir radine, “Kamami ma naek ayesi sraker Kanaan kuker rofanfan kambing, domba, sapi, ma nana vebor sena kam, fafis ine sisya ro sup Gosyen.” Ramnai vye vadir naek vyansi faro Firaun i. <verse eid="GEN 47:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Firaun ifuken faro si, “Fararur risai mkokin kaku i?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Skarem be i, “Inkoine manfarandous rofanfan imnis raris up inkovesi. <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Nkorama nkokain ro sup ine ve mandaman snar basbiserya iba kaku ro sup Kanaan, vefnai fa avrisno fa rofanfan kambing, domba, inkovesine sanva. Wamarisen ido buk fa nkokain ro sup Gosyen.” <verse eid="GEN 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Mura Firaun ikofen faro Yusup i, “Kur ine kmami ma naek bansya sisya ro dine kwar. <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Sup Mesir ine sup mankun mkovedi rya kako. Mkokain kwar ro sup mnuk Gosyen, saprop mnuk vepyum kaku ro sup Mesir ine. Wawan kako fa snonkaku vemyaren vefararursya sfaduru rofanfan ayesi.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Yusuf vye vadir kmari faro Firaun i. Mura Yakub vye vok Firaun i. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Ma Firaun ifuken faro i, “Kamam, ras kenem Kamam bedi vye fis?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yakub kyarem, “Women ayaine yakenem pasivarek usin oser samfur ri kyor kwar ma yakenem ve snonkaku vedawai. Kenem ayedine ifo kuker awau ananjar ma ikwan imnis kuker ras kenem up ayesyava fafisu svedawai ro sup ine bori.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Insape Yakub vye vok Firaun i wer posa isasyar bur aidoran wairek vyanya. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Yusuf kyur fasna faro kmari ma naek vyansi mov nari skain ro ma nari sna ve sup mankun isoine saprop mnuk vepyum kaku ro sup Mesir, fanam kota Rameses,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rameses ido snonsnon vebabo faro snonsnon Gosyen.</char></note> raris anun ro Firaun i. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Ma Yusuf fyaduru kmari, naek vyesi ma romawa inai sesya kuker rovean, raris barbor sedi, veba isof kasun.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fafisu Basbiserya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Basbiser anya iba fafayava, evedar ro mov nakam rovean no werva. Kawasa Mesir ma kawasa Kanaan sipikva ma sismai sambravo va snar sibiser. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Fafisu skoves pokem, Yusuf fyanjur kumpan vevak pokem ansi, ma ikramsi ro aidoran Firaun vyani. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Fafisu kumpan vero Mesir ma Kanaan sya sivro, kawasa Mesir ansya sra yov Yusuf i ma sikofen, “Buk ve inko nanan! Mam monda inko vo nkomar awer. Kumpan inkovesya sivrokwar.”<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yusuf kyarem be si, “Kumpan mkovesya sivro ido, mko vuk rofanfan no; nari yavuk roveyan no ve mko.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Mura svuk rofanfan sesya faro Yusuf i ma ikako vyuk nanan farosi, fa fyarwe kuda, domba, kambing, sapi ma keledai sesya. Ro pasi varek anya Yusuf vyuk rovean na farosi ma svuk rofanfan sesya ve vavyak faro Yusuf i.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Pasivarek anya isyonde ido, kawasa ansya srama wer ma sikofen faro Yusuf i, “Nkokofen isnai faro amber au snar kumpan inkovesya sivrokwar, ma kako rofanfan inkovesya amber nwa si kwar. Nkosmai roinowerva fa nari nkovuk faro amber au, iyer monda mankun inko ma saprop inkovena. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Mam monda inko vo nkomar awer! Mam monda awer saprop inkovena fa nmasmusem. Kwoves inko ma saprop inkovena, vavyakya isoine pokemsya. Mankun inko ma saprop inkovena nari Firaun nyana. Imboi buk ve inko pokem infa nkovuki kenem ma kako rokaker mor fa nkovuver ro yaf inkovena!”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Mura Yusuf kyoves saprop vebor vero sup Mesir annakam ve Firaun i. Kawasa Mesir ansya oser-oser vyov saprop vyena, snar basbiser anya iba kaku; inja saprop vebor ro sup Mesir anna Firaun nya nakam. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Kawasa Mesir sya kasiper, Yusuf nya si ve manfamyan. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Saprop mnuk kyovesva na isoine saprop mnuk imamsya sena. Saprop sena svov na va snar sismai rarwas ro Firaun i faro fandun kenem sena ro rasras. <verse eid="GEN 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Yusuf ikofen faro kawasa Mesir ansi, “Mkomame, mko kuker saprop mkovena yakoves na kwar ve Firaun i. Ine irya rokaker mor nari mkovuver ro yaf mkovena. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Fafisu aninek, mkovuk rarwas var eve rim ro yaf anna faro Firaun i. Vesyadi sya insape mkona si ve rokaker mor nari mkovuver ma anan faro mko ma kina mkovesi,”<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Mura skarem be i, “Amber faspar inko kwar inja nkokofen kasumasa. Rarirya nkomarisen fa nkove manfyan be Firaun i.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Posa Yusuf ifrur sasoser faro kawasa ro sup Mesir. Sasoser ani isoine, fafisu snonkaku sya sinek yaf sena, ivye sirwas si var rarwas ri rim, rarwas anna var oser faro Firaun i. Isof ro kur ine sasoser anya isya kaker. Imboi saprop imam sya sena naiso Firaun kyoves va na.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fararyor papupes ro Yakub i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Rarirya kawasa Israel ansi skain ro Mesir, ro sup Gosyen. Sismai nana nabor kaku ma sikapar ra siryewen. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yakub ikenem kaker pasivarek samfur eser seser di fik ro Mesir isof ras kenem vyena ne pasivarek usin oser samfur di fyak seser ri fik. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Fafisya fyanam fa imar, mura dor romawa vye Yusuf i, insape ikofen, “Rwir vramin besuya ro weswaf ayedine ma fores ve aya, nari wakrir aya ro Mesirva.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:29: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rwir...: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Komam ro 24:2</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Yor fa mkokrir aya ro up ayesya mov sikrir si roya; mkun baken ayeja ro dine mura mkorir i ro rus skovedi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Mura Yusuf kyarem, “Nari yafrur rosai kamam wakofen kwar nane.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:29-30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:29-30">SaR. 49:29-30</ref>,</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:6">50:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Yakub ikofen wer, “Fores ve aya nari wafrur na radirya.” Mura Yusuf fyores, inja Yakub ikofen kasumasa ro kamboi anenef vyedi.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s1">Yakub vye vok Efraim ma Manasye su</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Fafisu ri veso nasyonde ido sikofen vadir ve Yusuf i, sove: “Kma bani iduf marvak.” Inja Yusuf dun romawa vyansuya susoine Manasye ma Efraim fa skorakaki Yakub i. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Fafis Yakub imnaf Yusuf isyama ryayov i, mura iryur samamvrav vyena kam posa kyain ro kamboi vyedi. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Yakub ikofen faro Yusuf i, “Allah Vepoik Syadi Kaku vefasnai mankundi kwar faro aya ro Lus, ro sup Kanaan, ma eve vok aya kwar.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:13-14">SaR. 28:13-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Ikofen ve aya ra dine, “Nari Yavuk ve au romawa ma kpu sibor kaku, insa sve er vebor kaku; Nari yavuk sup mnuk ine fa vye sup mankun faro kpu besya isof fyoro fyoro.”<verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Yakub ikofen pdef, “Yusuf, romawa bansuine Efraim ma Manasye wakapar kwar ro Mesir ine rofyor yarama ro dine vaim, yakor su ve romawa ayesuya raris Ruben ma Simon su. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Nwa romawa no wer ido yakor si ve romawa wer va imboi romawa besirya; var rarwas vavov asuser sena nari sismai na ro Efraim ma Manasye su. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Yafrur ra dirya snar yawasen kaver rosai vekur snam Rahel i. Ro marandan ayedi fyor yakaver ker Padan-Aram, sna bani imar ro sup Kanaan, fanam be Efrata, isof sneri muk kaku. Yakrir i ro diwa, ro ris nyan veso yov Efrata.” (Kur ine Efrata sap i ve Betlehem.)<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:16-19">SaR. 35:16-19</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Fafisu Yakub myam Yusuf romawa vyansuya, mura ifuken, “Romawa suine nido?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yusuf kyarem be i, “Suine nido romawa Allah vyuk ve aya ro sup Mesir ine.” Yakub ikofen, “besu fa sufanam be aya insa yave vok su.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Yakub myam isnai mankunba snar vye mansar bos kaku inja mkassu pampan. Yusuf vye romawa ansuya fa sufris Yakub i, mura dawer epen su ma isyum su. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Insape Yakub ikofen ve Yusuf i, “Yoverada na yasrow kuker au werva, imbape fyor ine Allah vyuk fa yasrow kuker au ma romawa bansuine.” <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Insape Yusuf dun romawa ansuya fa sukanden bur Yakub i, posa kyunem ma kyuk wepur vyansuba ro varpon kmari.<verse eid="GEN 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13-14" />Posa Yusuf vye romawa vyansuya fanam Yakub i, romawa kasun Efraim ryo var rasar ma romawa rak Manasye i ryo var raku. Imbape Yakub syopar vramin vyesuya fa var rasarya ryo Manasye vruri ma vramin var rakuya fa ryo Efraim vruri. <verse eid="GEN 48:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Posa ido vye vok Yusuf i, ikofen radine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">“Allah, irya Manseren, sinan kpu Abraham ma kamam Ishak susyomya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">I monda vefarkin aya isof ras ine;<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />I monda manakya vefaspar aya bur marindi nabor.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Ivye kada Allah ani vye vok romawa suine.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Ivye kada snonsnon ayedi, Abraham ma Ishak naser swarapepen pdef</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">snar romawa suine!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Ivye kada sikapar siryewen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">ma kpu sesya sibor kaku ro supswan ine.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Yusuf imarisen mankunba snar Yakub ryir vramin var rakuya ro Efraim vruri; inja ikanow Yakub vrasi bur Efraim vruri ma ryir i ro Manasye vruri. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Ikofen ve kmar Yakub i, “Kamam, rarirya nawer, romawa rakya isine; rwir vramin var rakuya ro vruri.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Imbape Yakub imewer, inja ikofen, “Yafawi kwar, romawa yedi, yafawi kwar. Manasye papoik vyedi nari iba ma nari vye er veba. Imbape veknik vyedi papoik vyedi nari iba syadi, ma veknik vyedi kpu vyesi nari sikapar er vebor veba.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Insape vye vok romawa ansuyawer ro ras ani, ikofen radine, “Snonkaku Israel sya nari sap snonsnon muvena fafis sve vok snonkaku sya. Nari sikofen, ‘Ivye kada Allah ifrur fa wamnis Efraim ma Manasye.’” Rarirya Yakub vye Efraim i fa pyon, insape Manasye i.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:21">Ibr. 11:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Ramnai ikofen be Yusuf i, “Fyorova ido nari yamar, vape Allah nari dun kaver mko ve sup marin mkovedi. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Faro au monda, imboi faro naek veba bansyava, yavuk Sikhem, saprop vemafen yafasyar bur kawasa Amori sya kuker romamun ayena.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s1">Wos papupes Yakub vyena faro romawa vyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Posa Yakub dor romawa vyansi ma ikofen, “Mkoryur ro dine, fanam aya. Ive yakofen vadir rosai nari vekur mko ro fafisu nayama:<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />Yakub romawa vyena mko, mkoryur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:2">Mkomnaf Israel, kma mkovedi.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />Ruben romawa rak ayedi, au irya sambrav ayena, bon rak ro vave snon ayena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:3">Au vedoser ma vesambrav syadi ro fandu romawa ayesyakam.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Warvaren wamnis war vedaf ma vekakek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">inja au vepon rawerya wer va;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">snar wenef kuker kya ayedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">wafrur mamas mov anenef ayedi.<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />Mambekanaek Simeon ma Lewi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:5">Romamun suvena suvuki frur mbriwer.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Yapok yaso su ro au suvena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">rova ro do raryur suvena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">Snar masasor suvena newari sumamun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">sukaruk urek ro sapi wedoi fa ifrur marisen su.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Fras ro masasor suvena, snar namsinba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Dormomen suvena nasmai fras, snar nkarfiva veri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Nari Yararwas su ro Israel kasiper.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Nari Yakakek su ro fandu er veba anya kasiper.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />Yehuda, nari wamerkar mbrov besi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:8">naek besi nari sisandik au</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:8">ma skunem ro varpon bedi.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Yehuda imnis singa kuv babo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">vemun aiwan fa dan, posa vekaver ve niw vyedi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">vemnaisu ma vevarek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">snonkaku osero vaveri fa ikyaren i<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 24:9">Bil. 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:5">Why. 5:5</ref> </char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Yehuda nari ikifepen ankyon vave sasoserya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">kpu vyesi nari sikif epen vave sasoserya isof fyoro-fyoro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">Er vebor nari sun som,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">ma skunem ro bav vyedi.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Keledai kuv vyedi nari fyes i ro aiknam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">anggur knam vepyum kaku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">Pyap sansun vyena kuker war anggur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">war anggur vefanandik brus kaku.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Mkassu sumayar ma sufanandik syadi war anggur ma nakor vyesya sipyoper syadi sus dur.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkassu sufanandik snar dinem war anggur, inido imserva imboi ine vye vair an ma aninem vesararir.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />Sebulon nari kyain ro swan andir;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:13">saw payar vevrin faro wai veba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:13">was vyedi isof ro Sidon.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />Isakhar imnis keledai vesambrav</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:14">ve varek ro fandu aram veser roi vemarvak kaku.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Myam mov anya ipyum kaku</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">ma sup anya ipyum bos veri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">mura kyankunem fa vyarsonem roi vemarvak ro kruri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">ma sveyau i fa ifararur ve manfyan.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />Imboi Dan, nari ve mankara faro er bedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:16">au kako er oso ro fandu er vese ro Israel.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Wamnis ikak vero nyan andir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">ikak vemun sayaryur ro ris nyan rayuk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">vesos kuda wekuver evewar kuda anya doper</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">ma snonkaku veyeki nya isapi.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />Sye <char style="nd">Manseren Allah</char> yave wawaf vave faspar veramuma ro Au.<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />Snonkaku manfasyar sya nari sfarmun Gad i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:19">imbape nari iwarye fa fyasyar si.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />Asyer, au ma kpu besi nari mkosasyar rovean vesararir ma vepyum kaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:20">nari fasos anan vepyum faro wairek sya.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />Naftali imnis rusa vin verafdi vefrar mura muma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:21">nari ikapar mkun vedoser kaku.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />Yusuf imnis keledai kuv babo, keledai verafdi vefanam war sun, vefrar farma ro urek kapis.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ro wos Ibraniya mnuk ine isnai mankun ba imboi fasfas veseya isoine: Yusuf imnis raris aiknam vekain ro sun andir, snaw vyena nasraren ro fofen keru.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Mbrov vyesya sfarmun marsir i va,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:23">siyau sikfo i kuker maryai ma ikoi.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Vape Yusuf vrado vyedi syamvrav pdef,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">ma maryai saren vyedi ipok kaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">snar fanfnovek ro Manfarandous Vepok Syadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">Allah Yakub, Manfadiren Israel.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Ivyekada Allah, kma bani isyomya nari isaramper au; Ivyekada Vepoik Syadi kaku ro supswan ine kasiper vye vok au</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">kuker mekem ro mandep ma marei ro sapropya dori.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">Ivyekada romawa kpu besya sibor kaku ma rofanfan besya sikapar siryewen.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Vok ro Allah sinan kma bani</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">iba syadi kayan vebor ro urek bon vekain fyoro kwar anna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">Ivye kada vok annakam nasabu ro Yusuf vruri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">i monda eve manfarkin faro naek vyesi.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />Benyamin i irya naf sup vermomen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:27">Ro arwo babo myun maref.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:27">Ro mun rovya irarwas na.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Irya wos papupes Yakub ikofen faro romawa vyesi. Ikofen wos vekakur anna faro romawa vyansya oser-oser. Romawa samfur seser di suru Yakub vyansine siso eve up ro er samfur seser di suru ro er veba Israel.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakub imar ma sikrir i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29-30" />Posa Yakub ikofen faro romawa vyansi, “Fyoro va ido nari yabur imnis raris sinan up ayansi. Mkun aya ma mkokrir aya ro ris sedi ro avyav Makhpela, ro Mamre ro sup Kanaan. Abraham kyoves avyav ma sapropya kasiper ro Efron snon Hetya fa nya ve rus. <verse eid="GEN 49:29-30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Ro mov ani sikrir Abraham ma Sara, Ishak ma Ribka; ma rodiya kako yakrir Lea i. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Saprop ma avyav ani Abraham kyoves namuk i kwar ro snonkaku Het sya. Mkokrir aya ro mov ani.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Yakub vyuk wos ananun nane faro romawa vyesi ra posa ryir i fa vyarek ma imar.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Yusuf ryir baken vyedi ro bo kmar Yakub i vo kyanes ma isyumi. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Posa Yusuf iwan manfamyan vyesya fa sun mani ma rampa-rampa fa svuki vyui i insama isnarem awer. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Fararur anya imbran ras samfur di fyak, raris ras swaf sna fa sve rampa-rampa snonkaku vemar. Kawasa Mesir ansya svarop Yakub i ras samfur di fik.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Fafisu vavevarop anya isyonde, Yusuf ikofen faro Firaun faker vyansi, “Mkove syowi ayanido mkokofen vadir ankinem ine faro Firaun i, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />‘Ro fyor kamam fanam imarya, iwan fa yafores ve i, nari yakrir i ro rus fyasos kwar ro Kanaanya. Inja buk fa yaramura yakrir kamami. Posa nari yakaver.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:29-31">SaR. 47:29-31</ref></char></note><verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Muraido Firaun ikofen, “Rwamura wakrir kmami raris mov fores kwar yov i raya.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Posa Yusuf ryamura ikrir kmari. Faker Firaun vyesya ma sinan-sinan vero aidoran vyedi ma kako amber veba vero Mesir, siso Yusuf i. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Kina, naek, ma naek min vese vyesya sakra kako. Demir monda romawa kasun ma rofanfan sya si vekain ro Gosyen.<verse eid="GEN 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Snon mamun veyek kereta ma kudasya kako siso, rarirya maran anya iba kaku.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Fafisu sraro mov skuk pokem ro Goren-Haatad, ro war Yordan var wamuremya, sikame smandak kuker sne vemuk ma mkarem verok naba kaku. Yusuf vye varop kmar marmar vyedi ras ri fik. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Ro fafisu kawasa Kanaan smam vave varop vero Goren-Haatad anya, mura sikofen, “Vave varop kawasa Mesir sya ifrur fafardun kaku.” Ebedar fa mov anya snir ive Abel-Misraim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">50:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abel-Misraim: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Snonsnon ine ryok imnis wos Ibrani isoine “vave varop kawasa Mesir”. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Irya Yakub romawa vyansya sifrur rosai Yakub danun faro si anna. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Suni ve Kanaan fa sikrir i ro avyav Makhpela, vero Mamre var wamurem, ro yaf Abraham kyoves ro Efron snonkaku Het anya, fa nyave rus karamram.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:16">Kis. 7:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Yusuf ikrir kmari ramnai, naek byesya ma snonkaku vese veyakso fa vekrir kmari ansya skaver ve Mesir.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yusuf Vyuk Sneprei Ve Naek Vyesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Fafisu kma skovanya imar kwar, Yusuf naek vyansya sikofen, “Imbude Yusuf ikram kaker masasor yov ko ndi, ma nari myun su ve ko snar sasar kofrur kwar faro i ro fafisu iyafa?” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Rarirya skankinem faro Yusuf i radine, “Ro fior sinan kovanya imar vaim, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />iwan fa nkokofen vair faro au radine, ‘Buk fakman ro sasar naek veba bansya sifrur kwar faro au ro fafisu iyafa.’ Ryani, nkoine manfamyan Allah kma kovanya isyomya, nkor fa buk fakman ro sasar nkofrurna.” Yusuf kyanes ro fafis imnaf ankinem anya. <verse eid="GEN 50:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Posa naek vyansya srama svan suba ro varpon vyeja ma sikofen, “Nkoine women besi nko.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Imbape Yusuf dawos faro si, “Mkomkak awer; snar nari yafrur ra disyava snar ayaine Allah ri sayava. <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Mkona swaruser oser fa mkofrur imnis va faro aya, imbape Allah fyarwe vavyeva na kuker payamyum, insamaido raris vavyeva ro fafisu iyafa vyewari snon kaku vebor vekenem ro fafis ine sismai payamyumya. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Mko ve virvar awer. Fandun vebor mko ma romawa mkovesya, nari yafasos na fa namawes.” Irya wos sneprei dawos faro si, isof sisnesna naknon.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yusuf Imar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Yusuf kyain pdef ro Mesir fnovek kina vyesya; ras kenem vyedi vye pasivarek usin oser samfur oser. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Fafisu anya myam kaker romawa ma kpu Efraim vyesi. Yusuf ikako fafisuya fyarus Makhir romawa vyesi, isoine Manasye kpu vyesi, ve romawa mankun vyesi. <verse eid="GEN 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Ikofen faro naek vyansya, “Marmar ayeja fyanam kwar, imboi Allah nari fyaduru mko ma fyarkin mko fa mkosasyar bur sup ine, ve sup Allah danun kwar kuker fafores faro Abraham, Ishak ma Yakub.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Posa Yusuf iwan kawasa vyansyakam fa sfores, ikofen, “Mkokarem be aya, nari fafisu Allah fyarkin mko ve sup iwa, mkun kako kor ayesi.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:19">Kel. 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yos. 24:32</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:22">Ibr. 11:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Yusuf imar ro Mesir ro fafisu ras kenem vyeja vye pasi varek utin oser samfur oser. Svui baken vyeja kuker rampa-rampa posa srir i ro aibeiya dori. <figure style="fig" file="Biak-Marandan Abraham.png" size="col" ref="50:26">Marandan Abraham</figure><verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>